<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="NUM" style="id">- Pogoro Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Walanga</para>
  <para style="toc1">Shitabu sha Walanga</para>
  <para style="toc2">Walanga</para>
  <para style="toc3">Wal</para>
  <para style="mt2">Shitabu sha</para>
  <para style="mt1">WALANGA</para>
  <para style="imt">ULONGOLERU</para>
  <para style="ip">Shitabu sha Walanga shiyowelera mwanja gwa Israeli vinja 40 kulawira kushiwala pamberi pa kusoka kuisi yakawapananiti Mlungu, Kanani shitabu ashi shimema lagiru toziya shana seemu nkulu mbili sheni shilanguziya Lagiru lyawalikomangiti wapalu mukila likabila lya Waisraeli shipandi sha 1-26 shiutamaduni na wafunda wajimira shitabu sha Lagiru ndo shitabu sha Wapendekosti Lyanjiru na Kulawa na Walawi na Maholu ga lagiru vilembitwi na mbuyi gwa Mlungu Musa Wala 1: 1. Viraa iwera handa Musa kalembiti vitabu vivuwa na kuvitakulira pa kuviyongera seemu zimonga. Kwa mfanu ndo vikamala kulihola ndo kalembiti mstali handa Walanga 12:3 pahala peni unanaga wakuyi mweni uzyumitwi. Kulawa mwanja mpaka kushiwala, Waisraeli walalamikiti na kumlema Mlungu shaka shoseri na wakomangitwi. Mfanu gumu gweni shipindi sha Waisraeli watiliti na kuwalawumu wantu wa Kanani ndo wantu wana makakala nentu (Walanga 14: 1-4). Toziya ya shilii, Mlungu kalonga shiyiwuku sha Israeli hashihowi shoseri pamberi pa kwingira isi yawaweriti wapananwi. Musa mweni viraa kamjimiriti ndiri Mlungu na kajimiruwa ndiri kwingira isi yayiweriti wapananwi. Na viraa wantu wendeleyi kumlema Mlungu kumbiti Mlungu kendeleya kuwalolera. Shaka wankondu wa Waisraeli pawahigirangwa na Baramu, Mlungu gweka yakuyi ndo yakawagolokera womberi (Walanga 22-24.)</para>
  <para style="iot">YAGAWERAAMU</para>
  <para style="io">Shipandi sha 1 mpaka 10:11 shitakulira visoweru kuusu walanga ya wana wa Israeli handa mgenderanu gwa numba, lihengu na mafupu wagawankiti kulawira mlikabila lyawu shipindi sha kulaviya tambiku mshitalawanda.</para>
  <para style="io">Shapanu walanga iyowelera kuusu mwanja gwa wana wa Israeli kulawa kushiwala, mushipandi sha 10: 12 mpaka 25.</para>
  <para style="io">Shipandi sha 26 mpaka 36 shiyowelera walanga ya pili na kunyawiwa kwa isi ya Israeli. Ayi ihusu matawu ga seemu geni wana wa Israeli hawapati pakulikala muisi yawaweriti wapananwa na kwa ntambu gaa litapaka ali halibagulwi muwamu mwawu pawingira amu.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="NUM 1" />
  <para style="s">Kuwalangwa kwa wapalu woseri wa Israeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 1:1" />Mulishaka lya kwanja lya mwezi gwa pili shinja sha pili, pa wana wa Israeli kulawa Misri, Mtuwa Mlungu kayoweriti na Musa Muliringu Linanagala kushiwala Sinayi, kamgambiriti hangu, <verse eid="NUM 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 1:2" />gwenga pamuhera na Aruni mushiwalangi shipinga shoseri sha wana wa Israeli, kaya yimu yimu kulawirana na kaya zawu na lukolu zawu. Gugalembi matawu ga wapalu woseri <verse eid="NUM 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 1:3" />mushipinga sha wantu wa Israeli, walii yawaweza kugenda kulikomanga ngondu, wapalu walii yawawera na vinja malongu mawili na kwendeleya, hamuwatuli muvipinga vipinga. <verse eid="NUM 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 1:4" />Numsyagula mpalu yumu kulawa mukila likabila kuwatanga mwenga. Kila yumu hakaweri mkulu gwa lukolu lwakuyi. <verse eid="NUM 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 1:5" />Aga ndo matawu ga wakulu yawagenda kukutanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 1:5">Kulawa likabila lya Rubeni, kaweriti Elisuri mwana gwa Sheduri, <verse eid="NUM 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 1:6" />Kulawa likabila lya Simiyoni, kaweriti Shelumieli mwana gwa Surishadai.<verse eid="NUM 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 1:7" />Kulawa likabila lya Yuda, kaweriti Nashoni mwana gwa Amunadabu.<verse eid="NUM 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 1:8" />Kulawa likabila lya Isakari, kaweriti Nataneli mwana gwa Suari,<verse eid="NUM 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 1:9" />Kulawa likabila lya Zebuluni, kaweriti Eliabu mwana gwa Heloni.<verse eid="NUM 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 1:10" />Kulawa likabila lya Efraimu, kaweriti Elishama mwana gwa Amihudi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 1:10">Kulawa likabila lya Manase, kaweriti Gamalieli mwana gwa Pedasuri.<verse eid="NUM 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 1:11" />Kulawa likabila lya Benjamini, kaweriti Abidani mwana gwa Gidioni.<verse eid="NUM 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 1:12" />Kulawa likabila lya Dani, kaweriti Ahiezeli mwana gwa Amishadai.<verse eid="NUM 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 1:13" />Kulawa likabila lya Asheri, kaweriti Pagieli mwana gwa Okurani.<verse eid="NUM 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 1:14" />Kulawa likabila lya Gadi, kaweriti Eliasafu mwana gwa Deuweli.<verse eid="NUM 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 1:15" />Kulawa likabila lya Nafutali, kaweriti Ahira mwana gwa Enani.<verse eid="NUM 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 1:16" />Awa ndo wakulu yawasyagulitwi kulawa mushipinga shoseri sha wana wa Israeli kuwera wakulu wa makabila gawu. Womberi wawera wakulu mukolu za wana wa Israeli. <verse eid="NUM 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 1:17" />Su Musa na Aruni wawatoliti wantu woseri matawu gagakantituwi, <verse eid="NUM 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 1:18" />su womberi wawajojonikiti wantu woseri na mulishaka lilaa lii lya kwanja lya mwezi gwa pili wajojonira pamuhera wantu woseri mulishaka lilii lya kwanja mumwezi gwa pili. Womberi wagalembiti matawu ga wapalu woseri yawaweriti na umuli gwa vinja malongu mawili na kwendeleya, matawu gawu wagalembiti kulawirana na kaya zawu na lukolu lwakuyi, <verse eid="NUM 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 1:19" />gambira Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yakamlagaliriti Musa. Su Musa kawawalangiti womberi kushiwala sha Sinayi. <verse eid="NUM 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 1:20" />Wantu yawalawiti mulikabila lya Rubeni, ulii yakaweriti shipanta njira gwa Yakubu ulii yakashemwa Israeli, wapalu woseri yawaweriti na vinja malongu mawili na kwendeleya yakafaa, womberi wingiriti mushonta. Walii yawalembituwi matawu gawu, yumu yumu. Kulawirana na kulembuwa kulawa mukolu zawu na kaya zawu, <verse eid="NUM 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 1:21" />waweriti wantu elufu malongu msheshi na sita na miya muhanu. <verse eid="NUM 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 1:22" />Kulawa mulikabila lya Simiyoni, wapalu woseri yawaweriti na vinja malongu mawili na kwendeleya yawafaa, womberi wingiriti mushonta. Walii yawalembituwi matawu gawu, yumu yumu kulawirana na kulembuwa kulawa mukolu nzyawu na kaya zawu, <verse eid="NUM 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 1:23" />waweriti wantu elufu malongu muhanu na tisa na miya tatu. <verse eid="NUM 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 1:24" />Kulawa mulikabila lya Gadi, wapalu woseri yawaweriti na vinja malongu mawili na kwendeleya yawafaa, womberi wingiriti mushonta. Walii yawalembituwi matawu gawu, yumu yumu kulawirana na kulembuwa kulawa mukolu nzyawu na kaya zawu, <verse eid="NUM 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 1:25" />waweriti elufu malongu msheshi na miya sita na malongu muhanu. <verse eid="NUM 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 1:26" />Kulawa mukabila lya Yuda, wapalu woseri yawaweriti na vinja malongu mawili na kwendeleya yawafaa, womberi wingiriti mushonta. Walii yawalembituwi matawu gawu, yumu yumu kulawirana na kulembuwa kulawa mukolu nzyawu na kaya zawu. <verse eid="NUM 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 1:27" />Wapalu yawalawiti mulikabila lya Yuda waweriti elufu malongu saba na msheshi na miya sita. <verse eid="NUM 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 1:28" />Kulawa mukabila lya Isakari, wapalu woseri yawaweriti na vinja malongu mawili na kwendeleya, womberi wingiriti mushonta, walii yawalembituwi matawu gawu, yumu yumu kulawirana na kulembwa kulawa munkolu nzyawu na kaya zawu. <verse eid="NUM 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 1:29" />Wapalu yawalawiti mulikabila lya Isakari waweriti elufu malongu muhanu na msheshi na miya msheshi. <verse eid="NUM 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 1:30" />Kulawa mulikabira lya Zebuluni, wapalu woseri yawaweriti na vinja malongu mawili na kwendeleya, womberi wingiriti mushonta, walii yawalembituwi matawu gawu, yumu yumu kulawirana na kulembuwa kulawa mukolu nzyawu na kaya zawu. <verse eid="NUM 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 1:31" />Wapalu yawalawiti mulikabila lya Zebuluni waweriti elufu malongu muhanu na saba na miya msheshi. <verse eid="NUM 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 1:32" />Kulawa mulikabila lya Efraimu mwana gwa Yusufu, wapalu woseri yawaweriti na vinja malongu mawili na kwendeleya, womberi wingiriti mushonta, walii yawalembituwi matawu gawu, yumu yumu kulawirana na kulembuwa kulawa mukolu nzyawu na kaya zawu. <verse eid="NUM 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 1:33" />Wapalu yawalawiti mulikabila lya Efraimu waweriti elufu malongu msheshi na miya muhanu. <verse eid="NUM 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 1:34" />Kulawa mulikabila lya Manase mwana gwa Yusufu, wapalu woseri yawaweriti na vinja malongu mawili na kwendeleya, womberi wingiriti mushonta, walii yawalembituwi matawu gawu, yumu yumu kulawirana na kulembuwa kulawa mukolu nzyawu na kaya zawu. <verse eid="NUM 1:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 1:35" />Wapalu yawalawiti mulikabila lya Manase waweriti elufu malongu matatu na mmbili na miya mbili. <verse eid="NUM 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 1:36" />Kulawa mulikabila lya Benjamini, wapalu woseri yawaweriti na vinja malongu mawili na kwendeleya, womberi wingiriti mushonta, walii yawalembituwi matawu gawu, yumu yumu kulawirana na kulembuwa kulawa mukolu nzyawu na kaya zawu. <verse eid="NUM 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 1:37" />Wapalu yawalawiti mulikabila lya Benjamini waweriti elufu malongu matatu na muhanu na miya msheshi. <verse eid="NUM 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 1:38" />Kulawa mukabila lya Dani, wapalu woseri yawaweriti na vinja malongu mawili na kwendeleya, womberi wingiriti mushonta, walii yawalembituwi matawu gawu, yumu yumu kulawirana na kulembuwa kulawa mukolu nzyawu na kaya zawu. <verse eid="NUM 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 1:39" />Wapalu yawalawiiti muikabila lya Dani waweriti elufu malongu sita na mbili na miya saba. <verse eid="NUM 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 1:40" />Kulawa mulikabila lya Asheri, wapalu woseri yawaweriti na vinja malongu mawili na kwendeleya, womberi wingiriti mushonta, walii yawalembituwi matawu gawu, yumu yumu kulawirana na kulembuwa kulawa mukolu nzyawu na kaya zawu. <verse eid="NUM 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 1:41" />Wapalu yawalawiti mulikabila lya Asheri waweriti elufu malongu msheshi na yimu na miya muhanu. <verse eid="NUM 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 1:42" />Kulawa mulikabira lya Nafutali, wapalu woseri yawaweriti na vinja malongu mawili na kwendeleya, womberi wingiriti mushonta, walii yawalembituwi matawu gawu, yumu yumu kulawirana na kulembuwa kulawa mukolu nzyawu na kaya zawu. <verse eid="NUM 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 1:43" />Wapalu yawalawiti mulikabila lya Nafitali waweriti elufu muhanu na ntatu na miya msheshi. <verse eid="NUM 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 1:44" />Awa ndo wapalu yawalangatiwu na Musa pamuhera na Aruni pawatangituwi na wakulu wa wana wa Israeli, kila yumu pakaliwakilisha likabila lyakuyi. <verse eid="NUM 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 1:45" />Su wapalu woseri wa Israeli yawawera na vinja malongu mawili na kwendeleya, walii yawaweza kwingira mushonta lya Israeli <verse eid="NUM 1:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 1:46" />woseri waweriti wantu laki sita na ntatu na miya muhanu na malongu muhanu.<verse eid="NUM 1:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 1:47" />Kumbiti wantu wa Lawi walangatuwa ndiri pamuhera na makabila gamonga, <verse eid="NUM 1:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 1:48" />toziya Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Musa, <verse eid="NUM 1:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 1:49" />naguliwalanga likabila lya Lawi, kayi naguwawalanga pamuhera na wana wa Israeli, <verse eid="NUM 1:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 1:50" />kumbiti guwasyaguli waweri walolera wa Liringu Linanagala na vyombu vyakuyi vyoseri na kila shintu shashiwera mla, womberi hawalipapi Liringu ali pamuhera na vyombu vyakuyi vyoseri. Hawatendi lihengu Muliringu Linanagala na kunyawa malingu gawu kuzyengeta Liringu Linanagala. <verse eid="NUM 1:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="NUM 1:51" />Kayi shaka sha Liringu Linanagala kuwuka kugenda pahala pingi, wantu wa Lawi hawalitupuli na shaka sha kuligolosiya, wantu wa Lawi ndo hawalibawili, kila yakalisegelera hakalagwi. <verse eid="NUM 1:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="NUM 1:52" />Wantu wamonga wa Israeli hawanyawi malingu gawu mupahala pawu na womberi hawatuli bendera kulanguziya shipinga shakuwi. <verse eid="NUM 1:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="NUM 1:53" />Kumbiti wapalu mulikabila lya Lawi hawanyawi malingu gawu kuzyengeta Liringu Linanagala, pawalilolera su muntu yoseri nakiza kuliharabisiya na kujega maya gangu gaweri kwa shipinga sha wana wa Israeli. Su wantu wa Lawi hawaliloleri weri Liringu Linanagala. <verse eid="NUM 1:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="NUM 1:54" />Su wantu wa Israeli watenditi kila shintu gambira Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yakamlagaliriti Musa.<verse eid="NUM 1:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="NUM 2" />
  <para style="s">Malagizu ga kunyawuwa kwa malingu ga makabila ga Israeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 2:1" />Mtuwa Mlungu kawagambiriti Musa na Aruni, <verse eid="NUM 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 2:2" />wana wa Israeli hawabawili malingu gawu kuzyengeta Liringu Linanagala, kila yumu hakalikali pahala papawera na bendera, papalanguziya kaya yakuyi.<verse eid="NUM 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 2:3" />Walii yawagenda kulikala uwega wa kwagulawira mshenji kulola kwaguzyeta mshenji, womberi hawaweri shipinga sha wantu yawawera pasi pa bendera ya Yuda na mkulu gwawu hakaweri Nashoni mwana gwa Aminadabu. <verse eid="NUM 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 2:4" />Shipinga shakuwi hashiweri sha wapalu elufu malongu saba na msheshi na miya sita. <verse eid="NUM 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 2:5" />Likabila lya Isakari hawabawili malingu gawu pa wantu wa Yuda. Mkulu gwa wantu wa Isakari hakaweri Natanieli mwana gwa Suari. <verse eid="NUM 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 2:6" />Shipinga shakuwi hashiweri na wapalu elufu muhanu na msheshi na miya msheshi. <verse eid="NUM 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 2:7" />Shakapanu likabila lya Zebuluni, mkulu gwawu kaweriti Eliyabu mwana gwa Heloni, <verse eid="NUM 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 2:8" />shipinga shakuwi hashiweri na wapalu elufu muhanu na saba na miya msheshi. <verse eid="NUM 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 2:9" />Wantu woseri yawagenda kuwera mushipinga sha Yuda kulawirana na vipinga vyawu hawaweri wantu laki yimu na elufu nani na sita na miya msheshi. Womberi hawalongoleri kugenda mwanja.<verse eid="NUM 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 2:10" />Uwega wa kusika, walii yawawera pasi pa bendera ya shipinga sha Rubeni kulawirana na vipinga vyawu, mkulu gwawu hakaweri Elisuri mwana gwa Shedeuri. <verse eid="NUM 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 2:11" />Shipinga shakuwi kulawirana na walanga hashiweri na wapalu elufu malongu msheshi na sita na miya muhanu. <verse eid="NUM 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 2:12" />Shipinga sha Simiyoni hashibawili malingu gawu pa shipinga sha Rubeni, mkulu gwawu hakaweri Shelumieli mwana gwa Surishadai. <verse eid="NUM 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 2:13" />Shipinga shakuwi hashiweri na wapalu elufu muhanu na tisa na miya tatu. <verse eid="NUM 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 2:14" />Upeleru likabila lya Gadi, mkulu gwawu hakaweri Eliasafu mwana gwa Deueli. <verse eid="NUM 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 2:15" />Shipinga shakuwi hashiweri na wapalu elufu malongu msheshi na muhanu na miya sita na malongu muhanu. <verse eid="NUM 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 2:16" />Wapalu woseri yawawera mushipinga sha Rubeni kulawiranan na vipinga vyawu wawera wantu laki yimu na elufu malongu muhanu na yimu na miya msheshi na malongu muhanu. Womberi hawagendi mumsafara gwa pili.<verse eid="NUM 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 2:17" />Shakapanu shipinga sha likabila lya wantu wa Lawi paliwera pakati pa vipinga vyoseri, pawapapa Liringu Linanagala lilii, womberi hawauki kugenda mwanja, kila shipinga hashigendi mwanja kwa kugolokela pasi pa bendera yawu.<verse eid="NUM 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 2:18" />Uwega wa kwaguzyeta mshenji, walii yawawera pasi pa bendera ya shipinga sha Efraimu, hawabawili malingu gawu kulawirana na vipinga vyawu, mkulu gwawu hakaweri Elishama mwana gwa Amihudi. <verse eid="NUM 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 2:19" />Shipinga shakuwi kulawirana na walanga hashiweri na wapalu elufu malongu msheshi na miya muhanu. <verse eid="NUM 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 2:20" />Shipinga sha Efraimu pashigenditi kala, su shiziti shipinga sha Manasi. Mkulu gwawu kaweriti Gamalieli mwana gwa Pedasuri. <verse eid="NUM 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 2:21" />Shipinga shakuyi hashiweri na wantu elufu malongu matatu na mbili na miya mbili. <verse eid="NUM 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 2:22" />Likabila lya Benjamini, mkulu gwakuyi kaweriti Abidani mwana gwa Gidioni. <verse eid="NUM 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 2:23" />Shipinga shakuwi shiweriti na wantu elufu malongu matatu na muhanu na miya msheshi. <verse eid="NUM 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 2:24" />Walanga yoseri ya wantu yawagenda kuwera mushipinga sha Efraimu kulawirana na vipinga vyawu wawera wantu laki yimu na nani na miya yimu. Shipinga ashi sha Efraimu hashiweri mumsafara gwa tatu.<verse eid="NUM 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 2:25" />Uwega wa kushana, hakuweri na shipinga shashiwera pasi pa bendera ya Dani, mkulu gwawu hakaweri Ahiezeri mana gwa Amishadai. <verse eid="NUM 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 2:26" />Shipinga shakuwi hashiweri na wantu elufu malongu sita na mbili na miya saba. <verse eid="NUM 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 2:27" />Shakapanu walii yawabawila malingu paweni, hawaweri wantu wa likabila lya Asheri, mkulu gwawu kawera Pagieni mwana gwa Okurani. <verse eid="NUM 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 2:28" />Shipinga shakuwi hashiweri na wantu elufu malongu msheshi na yimu na miya muhanu.<verse eid="NUM 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 2:29" />Likabila lya Nafutali nalu hawafati kugonjera mwanja. Mkulu gwa wantu wa Nafutali kawera Ahira mwana gwa Enani. <verse eid="NUM 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 2:30" />Shipinga shakuwi hashiweri na wantu elufu malongu muhanu na ntatu na miya msheshi. <verse eid="NUM 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 2:31" />Wapalu woseri yawalembituwi mushipinga sha Dani waweriti laki yimu na elufu malongu muhanu na saba na miya sita. Shipinga hashi hashiweri sha upeleru kugonjera mwanja kulawirana na bendera zawu.<verse eid="NUM 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 2:32" />Awa ndo wantu wa Israeli yawalangitwi kulawirana na kaya zawu. Woseri walii yawawera mumalingu na muvipinga vyawu waweriti laki sita na elufu tatu na miya muhanu na malongu muhanu. <verse eid="NUM 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 2:33" />Kumbiti wantu wa Lawi wawalangituwi ndiri pakati pa wana wa Israeli gambira Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yakamlagaliriti Musa.<verse eid="NUM 2:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 2:34" />Su wantu wa Israeli watenditi kila shintu gambira Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yakamlagaliriti Musa. Wabawiliti malingu gawu kulawirana na bendera zawu na wagenditi mwanja kila yumu pakagenda na kaya yakuyi na lukolu lwakuyi.<verse eid="NUM 2:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="NUM 3" />
  <para style="s">Wana wa Aruni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 3:1" />Ayi ndo walanga ya shiyiwuku sha Aruni pamuhera na Musa shaka Mtuwa Mlungu pakayoweriti na Musa kulugongu Sinayi. <verse eid="NUM 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 3:2" />Matawu ga wana wa Aruni gaweriti Nadabu shipanta njira na Abihu na Eleazari na Itamari. <verse eid="NUM 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 3:3" />Wana awa wa Aruni wawatyekiti kuwera watambika. <verse eid="NUM 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 3:4" />Kumbiti Nadabu pamuhera na Abihu wahowiti kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu, shaka pawamlaviliriti Mtuwa Mlungu motu ntambu yaifiruwa ndiri kushiwala sha Sinai. Womberi waheriti na wana su Eleazari pamuhera na Itihamari watenditi lihengu handa watambika shaka sha makaliru ga Aruni tati gwawu.<verse eid="NUM 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wana wa Lawi wankusyaguluwa kuwatendera watambika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 3:5" />Shakapanu Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Musa, <verse eid="NUM 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 3:6" />guwajegi wantu wa likabila la Lawi, guwatuli kulongolu kwa mtambika Aruni su guwapanani lihengu lya kumtendera. <verse eid="NUM 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 3:7" />Hawamtenderi lihengu Aruni pamuhera na shipinga shoseri Muliringu Linanagala pawatenda lihengu Pahala Pananagala. <verse eid="NUM 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 3:8" />Womberi hawaloli weri vyombu vyoseri vya Liringu Linanagala na kuwatanga wana wa Israeli pawatenda lihengu Pahala Pananagala. <verse eid="NUM 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 3:9" />Wana wa Lawi hagumpanani Aruni pamuhera na wana wakuyi, womberi walaviwa pakati pa wana wa Israeli wawatenderi. <verse eid="NUM 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 3:10" />Haguwasyaguli Aruni na wana wakuyi su wawezi kutenda mahengu gawu ga utambika, kumbiti handa muntu yoseri gwingi pakasegelera Liringu Linanagala, hakalagwi.<verse eid="NUM 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 3:11" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Musa, <verse eid="NUM 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 3:12" />guloli vinu nuwasyagula wana wa Lawi pakati pa wana woseri wa Israeli pahala pa shipanta njira mpalu gwa kila mdala muntu gwa Israeli. Wantu wa Lawi waneni <verse eid="NUM 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 3:13" />toziya kila shipanta njira gwa wantu wa Israeli kawera gwangu. Panuwalagiti vipanta njira woseri wa wantu wa Misri, nuwalekiti kila shipanta njira muwantu wa Israeli, kila shipanta njira gwa muntu ama nkanyama hawaweri waneni. Neni ndo Mtuwa Mlungu.<verse eid="NUM 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulanguwa kwa wantu wa Lawi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 3:14" />Shakapanu Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Musa kushiwala sha Sinayi, <verse eid="NUM 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 3:15" />guwawalangi wapalu yawawera mulikabila lya Lawi. Guwawalangi kila mpalu yakawera kwanjira mwezi gumu na kwendreya. <verse eid="NUM 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 3:16" />Su Musa kawawalangiti kulawirana na shisoweri sha Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yakamlagaliriti.<verse eid="NUM 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 3:17" />Aga ndo matawu ga wana wa Lawi. Gerishoni na Kohati na Merari. <verse eid="NUM 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 3:18" />Gerishoni kaweriti na wana wawili, Libini na Shimei. <verse eid="NUM 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 3:19" />Kohati kaweriti na wana wamsheshi, Amuramu na Ishari na Hebroni na Uzieli. <verse eid="NUM 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 3:20" />Merari kaweriti na wana wawili, Mahili na Mushi. Kaya azi zilawiti muwantu wa Lawi kulawirana na kolu zawu.<verse eid="NUM 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 3:21" />Kolu mbili zyazilawiti kwa Gerishoni ndo walii yawalawiti kwa wana wakuyi Libini pamuhera na Shimei. <verse eid="NUM 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 3:22" />Walanga ya wapalu woseri yawaweriti na umuli gwa mwezi gumu na kwendeleya waweriti elufu saba na miya muhanu. <verse eid="NUM 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 3:23" />Kaya za wantu wa Gerishoni wafiruwituwi wabawili malingu gawu uwega wa kwaguzyeta mshenji, kumbeli kwa Liringu Linanagala. <verse eid="NUM 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 3:24" />Mkulu gwa kaya ayi ya Gerishoni kaweriti Eliasafu mwana gwa Laeli. <verse eid="NUM 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 3:25" />Lihengu lya wana wa Gerishoni liweriti kulilolera weri Liringu Linanagala na Pahala Pananagala pamuhera na mfiniku gwakuyi na mapaziya ga ligomi lya Liringu Linanagala, <verse eid="NUM 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 3:26" />mapaziya ga mdamu yaguwera pakati pa Liringu Linanagala na mapaziya ga ligomi lya mdamu pamuhera na ngowi zakuyi. Mahengu goseri ga vintu avi gaweriti gawu.<verse eid="NUM 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 3:27" />Kaya za wantu wa Amirami na Hebroni na Uzieli walawiti muyuwuku gwa Kohatihi, awa waweriti wa lukolu lwa Kohatihi. <verse eid="NUM 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 3:28" />Walanga ya wapalu woseri yawaweriti na umuli wa mwezi gumu na kwendeleya waweriti elufu nani na miya sita, womberi ndo yawatenditi lihengu Pahala Pananagala. <verse eid="NUM 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 3:29" />Kaya za wana wa Kohatihi wafiruwiti kubawila malingu gawu uwega wa kusika mwa Liringu Linanagala. <verse eid="NUM 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 3:30" />Mkulu gwa kaya ya lukolu lwa Kohatihi kaweriti Elisafani mwana gwa Uzieli. <verse eid="NUM 3:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 3:31" />Lihengu lya wapalu wa kolu zilii liweriti kulilola weri Lisanduku lya Lipatanu na shintalawanda na luntambi lya shikoluboyi na shitalawanda sha kutambikira na vyombu vyawavitendera watambika Pahala Pananagala na lipaziya, mahengu goseri gakulolera vintu virii Muliringu Linanagala gaweriti gawu.<verse eid="NUM 3:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 3:32" />Su Eleazari mwana gwa mtambika Aruni, wamtyekuiti kuwera mkulu gwa wakulu wa wantu wa Lawi, viraa kaweri mgolokera gwa watenda lihengu woseri wa Liringu Linanagala.<verse eid="NUM 3:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 3:33" />Kaya ya wantu wa Mahili pamuhera na wantu wa Mushi walawiti muyuwuku gwa Merari. <verse eid="NUM 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 3:34" />Walanga ya wapalu woseri kulawa mushiyiwuku sha Merari, walii yawaweriti na mwezi gumu na kwendeleya waweriti elufu sita na miya mbili. <verse eid="NUM 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 3:35" />Mkulu gwa lukolu lwa Merari kaweriti Surieli mwana gwa Abihaili, womberi wafiruwituwi kubawila malingu gawu uwega wa kushana Muliringu Linanagala. <verse eid="NUM 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 3:36" />Womberi wapananituwi lihengu lya kuzilolera weri mpanda za Liringu Linanagala na migomba yakuyi na vikwambikwambi vyakuyi na vikaliru na vintu vyakuyi vyoseri na mahengu goseri ga vintu avi gaweriti gawu. <verse eid="NUM 3:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 3:37" />Mahengu gawu viraa gaweriti kulolera weri mpanda za kukowekera mapaziya pamuhera na vikaliru vyakuyi na mibiki ya kukomelela malingu na ngoyi zakuyi.<verse eid="NUM 3:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 3:38" />Musa na Aruni pamuhera na wana wawu wafiruwituwi kubawila malingu gawu uwega wa kwagulawa mshenji Muliringu Linanagala kulola kwaguzyeta mshenji kulongolu kwa Liringu Linanagala. Womberi waweriti na lihengu lya kutenda Mupahala Pananagala, mushila shintu shashifiruwa toziya ya wantu wa Israeli. Muntu gwingi pakasegelera Pahala Pananagala hakalagwi.<verse eid="NUM 3:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 3:39" />Walanga ya wantu wa Lawi yawalangatuwi gambira Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yakamlagalliriti Musa na Aruni kulawirana na lukolu zawu, kila mpalu yakaweriti na umuli gwa mwezi gumu na kwendeleya waweriti elufu malongu mawili na mbili.<verse eid="NUM 3:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kukomboluwa kwa wana wapanta njira wapalu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 3:40" />Shakapanu Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Musa, guwawalangi kwa matawu gawu wapanta njira wapalu woseri wa wantu wa Israeli yawawera na mwezi gumu na kwendeleya. <verse eid="NUM 3:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 3:41" />Na gwenga haguntulili wantu wa Lawi kwajili yangu neni Mtuwa Mlungu pahala pa wapanta njira wa wantu wa Israeli, pamuhera na wankanyama wawu pahala pa wapanta njira wa wankanyama wa wantu wa Israeli. Neni ndo Mtuwa Mlungu.<verse eid="NUM 3:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 3:42" />Musa kawawalangiti wapanta njira woseri wa wantu wa Israeli gambira Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yakamlagaliriti. <verse eid="NUM 3:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 3:43" />Wapanta njira woseri wapalu yawaweriti na mwezi gumu na kwendeleya, yawalembituwi kwa matawu gawu waweriti elufu malongu mawili na mbili na miya mbili na malongu saba na tatu.<verse eid="NUM 3:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 3:44" />Mtuwa Mlungu viraa kamgambiriti Musa, <verse eid="NUM 3:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 3:45" />vinu guwatutuli gweka wantu wa Lawi waweri wa neni badala ya wapanta njira wa wantu wa Israeli, viraa virii guwatuli gweka wang'ombi wa wantu wa Lawi woseri badala ya wiwuka wa kwanja wa wang'ombi wa wantu wa Israeli. Neni ndo Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="NUM 3:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 3:46" />Toziya kwana wapanta njira wa Waisraeli yawongereka nentu ya wapanta njira ya Walawi kwa wantu miya mbili sabani na tatu, awa yawawongerikiti haguwakomboli. <verse eid="NUM 3:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 3:47" />Kwa kila muntu kalipi vipandi muhanu vya madini ga feza kulawirana na shiyasi shashitulitwi Pahala Pananagala. <verse eid="NUM 3:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 3:48" />Na vipandi avi kwajili ya ukombola wa kwongereka kwa wantu wa Israeli, hagumpanani Aruni pamuhera na wana wakuyi.<verse eid="NUM 3:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 3:49" />Su Musa kajimiriti, kajojoniriti vipandi vya madini ga feza kulawa kwa walii yawongerikiti muwalanga ya ukombola wa wantu wa Lawi, <verse eid="NUM 3:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 3:50" />su yomberi kawankiti vipandi elufu yimu na miya tatu na malongu sita na muhanu. <verse eid="NUM 3:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="NUM 3:51" />Musa kawapananiti Aruni pamuhera na wana wakuyi, vipandi virii vya madini ga feza gambira Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yakamlagaliriti.<verse eid="NUM 3:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="NUM 4" />
  <para style="s">Mahengu gawapananituwi wantu wa Kohatihi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 4:1" />Mtuwa Mlungu kawagambiriti Musa na Aruni, <verse eid="NUM 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 4:2" />guwawalangi wantu wa lukolu lwa Kohati, ulii lwaluwera mushiyiwuku sha Lawi kugenderana na lukolu na kaya zawu. <verse eid="NUM 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 4:3" />Guwawalangi wapalu woseri yawawera na vinja malongu matatu mpaka vinja malongu muhanu, wizi watendi mahengu Kuliringu Linanagala.<verse eid="NUM 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 4:4" />Ali liwera lihengu lya wantu wa Kohati Kuliringu Linanagala, womberi hawavilori weri vintu vinanagala nentu. <verse eid="NUM 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 4:5" />Shaka sha mwenga kuwuka kugenda pahala pamonga, Aruni pamuhera na wana wakuyi hawingiri Kuliringu na kuliwusiya lipaziya lyalilekaniziya Pahala Pananagala Nentu na Pahala Pananagala. Womberi hawaligubiki Lisanduku lya Lipatanu kwa lipaziya ali. <verse eid="NUM 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 4:6" />Shakapanu womberi hawagubiki lukuli linama lya mbuzi, viraa hawagubiki kwa nguwu ya buluu iherepa na hawatuli mibiki ya kupapira lisanduku ali.<verse eid="NUM 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 4:7" />Pambindi pa shitalawanda shashiwera kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu sha kulavilira mabumunda, hawayaliki nguwu ya buluu na panguwu ayi hawatuli sahani na visahani vya kutulila ubani, mabakuli na vikombi kwajili ya kulavilira tambiku ya virandu, libumunda halyendereyi kuwera pashitalawanda ashi. <verse eid="NUM 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 4:8" />Shakapanu hawavigibikili vyombu avi vyoseri kwa nguwu nsheri, na panguwu ayi hawagubiki kwa lukuli linama lya mbuzi na hawatuli mibiki ya kupapira mupeti ya shitalawanda ashi.<verse eid="NUM 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 4:9" />Womberi hawatoli nguwu ya buluu na kushigubikira shintambi sha shikoluboyi pamuhera na vikoluboyi vyakuyi na mikasi yakuyi na masiniya gakuyi pamuhera na vyombu vyakuyi vyavilekeruwa lipaki lya mizyetuni. <verse eid="NUM 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 4:10" />Hawavituli pamuhera na vyombu vyoseri vyavigubikiruwa kwa lukuli linama lya mbuzi na kuvitawa pamibiki ya kupapira.<verse eid="NUM 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 4:11" />Shakapanu hawayaliki nguwu ya buluu pashitalawanda sha zahabu ya kutumiziya ubani na kugubikira kwa lukuli linama lya mbuzi na hawatuli mupeti zilii mibiki ya kupapira.<verse eid="NUM 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 4:12" />Havitoli vyombu vyoseri vyavitenderuwa Pahala Pananagala, hawavitawi kwa nguwu ya buluu na kuvigubika kwa lukuli linama lya mbuzi, shakapanu hawavituli pamibiki yakuyi ya kupapira.<verse eid="NUM 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 4:13" />Womberi hawawusiyi livu kulawa mushitalawanda sha shaba sha tambiku ya kulunguziya na pashitawalanda hawayaliki nguwu ya zambalawu. <verse eid="NUM 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 4:14" />Panguwu ayi hawatuli vyombu vyoseri vyawavitendera pashitalawanda sha kutambikira, hawatuli sepetu na uma wa kubanira vinofu na mbundi na mabakuli ga kutulila mwazi gwa kuwamishira wantu. Pavintu avi hawayaliki lukuli linama lya mbuzi na kutula mibiki ya kupapira.<verse eid="NUM 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 4:15" />Pa Aruni na wana wakuyi pawamalila kupagubika Pahala Pananagala pamuhera na vyombu vyakuyi vyoseri, pawawera kala kugenda mwanja, wantu wa lukolu lwa Kohatihi hawizi na kuvipapa. Kumbiti hapeni wavishinkuli vintu vinanagala, pawavishinkula hawahowi. Wantu wa Kohatihi hawavipapi vintu virii vyaviwera Muliringu Linanagala.<verse eid="NUM 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 4:16" />Eleazari mwana gwa mtambika Aruni hakaliloli weri lipaki lya mzyetuni na ubani wa ununkira na tambiku za viboga za kila lishaka na lipaki lya kutyekuwa. Eleazari hakagolokeri lihengu lyalitenduwa Kuliringu Linanagala pamuhera na kuwagolokera walii yawalola weri kila shintu shashiwera Kuliringu ali.<verse eid="NUM 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 4:17" />Shakapanu Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Musa na Aruni, <verse eid="NUM 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 4:18" />namuleka lukolu lwa Kohatihi lyagamili kulawa kwa wantu wa Lawi. <verse eid="NUM 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 4:19" />Su kuwatenda womberi nawahowa kwa kuvisegelera vyombu avi vinanagala nentu gwenga hagutendi hangu, Aruni pamuhera na wana wakuyi hawaingiri na kumpanana kila muntu shintu shakutenda ama lihengu lyakuyi. <verse eid="NUM 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 4:20" />Kumbiti wantu wa Kohatihi hapeni wingiri kuvilola vintu avi vinanagala nentu, pawavilola womberi hawahowi.<verse eid="NUM 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lihengu lya wantu wa Lawi wa lukolu lya Gerishoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 4:21" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Musa, <verse eid="NUM 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 4:22" />Guwawalangi viraa wantu wa Gerishoni kulawirana na lukolu na kaya zawu. <verse eid="NUM 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 4:23" />Guwawalangi wapalu woseri yawawera na vinja malongu matatu mpaka vinja malongu muhanu walii yawiza kutenda lihengu Kuliringu Linanagala.<verse eid="NUM 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 4:24" />Lihengu lyawu haliweri ali, <verse eid="NUM 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 4:25" />womberi hawagajegi mapaziya ga Liringu Linanagala na Liringu Linanagala lyeni, mfiniku gwakuyi, mfiniku gwa lukuli linama lwa mbuzi lyaliwera panani pakuwi na lipaziya lya lugomi lwa Liringu Linanagala. <verse eid="NUM 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 4:26" />Viraa hawalitoli lipaziya lya mdamu lyalizyengeta Liringu Linanagala na pashitalawanda sha kutambikira na lipaziya lya lugomi lya Liringu Linanagala na ngoyi pamuhera na vyombu vyakuyi vyoseri vya Mulirirngu. Wantu wa Gerishoni hawatendi mahengu aga goseri gagatendiruwa muvintu avi. <verse eid="NUM 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 4:27" />Aruni pamuhera na wana wakuyi watambika hawagolokeri mahengu goseri gawatenda shiyiwuku sha Gerishoni. Haguwapanani vintu vyoseri virii vyawagenda kupapa. <verse eid="NUM 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 4:28" />Ali ndo lihengu lya shiyiwuku sha Gerishoni Kuliringu Linanagala. Mahengu gawu hagagololekeruwi na Itihamari mwana gwa mtambika Aruni.<verse eid="NUM 4:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mahengu ga Walawi wa lukolu lwa Merari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 4:29" />Viraa haguwawalangi wana wa Merari kugenderana na lukolu lwawu na kaya zawu. <verse eid="NUM 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 4:30" />Haguwawalangi wapalu woseri yawawera kwanjira vinja malongu matatu mpaka vinja malongu muhanu yawiza kutenda mahengu Kuliringu Linanagala. <verse eid="NUM 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 4:31" />Ali haliweri lihengu lyawu lyawagenda kutenda Kuliringu Linanagala. Womberi hawatoli fulemu za Liringu ali, viraa hawatoli mpanda zakuyi na migomba yakuyi na vikalilu vyakuyi. <verse eid="NUM 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 4:32" />Viraa virii womberi hawatoli mpanda pamuhera na vikalilu vyakuyi zyazizengetira mdamu na mambu na ngoyi zakuyi pamuhera na vintu vyamonga vya kunyawira. Su gwenga haguwalagaliri womberi kulawirana na matawu gawu muvintu vyawagenda kupapa. <verse eid="NUM 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 4:33" />Ali haliweri lihengu lya wantu wa shiyiwuku sha Merari lyawagenda kutenda Kuliringu Linanagala muugolokera wa Itihamari mwana gwa mtambika Aruni.<verse eid="NUM 4:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuwalangwa kwa Walawi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 4:34" />Su Musa na Aruni na wakulu wa shipinga shoseri wawalangawiti shipinga shoseri sha wantu wa shiyiwuku sha Kohatihi kulawirana na kaya zawu. <verse eid="NUM 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 4:35" />Wapalu woseri yawawera na vinja kwanjira malongu matatu mpaka malongu muhanu, walii yawiziti kutenda mahengu Kuliringu Linanagala, <verse eid="NUM 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 4:36" />wapalu woseri yawalangaliwituwi waweriti elufu mbili na miya saba na malongu muhanu. <verse eid="NUM 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 4:37" />Ayi walanga ya wantu woseri mushiyiwuku sha Kohatihi, walii yawatenditi mahengu Kuliringu Linanagala. Musa na Aruni wawawalangiti gambira Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yakalagaliriti kupitira Musa.<verse eid="NUM 4:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 4:38" />Wantu woseri wa shiyiwuku sha Gerishoni kugenderana na kaya zawu, <verse eid="NUM 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 4:39" />walii yawaweriti na vinja kwanjira malongu matatu mpaka vinja malongu muhanu yawiziti kutenda mahengu Kuliringu Linanagalana, <verse eid="NUM 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 4:40" />waweriti wantu elufu mbili miya sita na malongu matatu. <verse eid="NUM 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 4:41" />Ayi ndo iweriti walanga ya wantu walii yawaweriti mushiyiwuku sha Gerishoni yawatenditi mahengu Kuliringu Linanagala. Musa na Aruni wawawalangiti gambira Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yakalagaliriti. <verse eid="NUM 4:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 4:42" />Walanga ya wantu wa shiyiwuku sha Merari kulawirana na kolu na kaya zawu, <verse eid="NUM 4:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 4:43" />wapalu walii yawaweriti na vinja kwanjira malongu matatu mpaka vinja malongu muhanu, yawatenditi mahengu Kuliringu Linanagala, <verse eid="NUM 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 4:44" />waweriti wantu elufu tatu na miya mbili. <verse eid="NUM 4:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 4:45" />Su ayi iweriti walanga ya wantu wa shiyiwuku sha Merari, wantu walii Musa na Aruni wawalangiti gambira Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yakamlagaliriti Musa.<verse eid="NUM 4:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 4:46" />Su Musa na Aruni pamuhera na wakulu wa wantu wa Israeli wawawalangiti wantu woseri wa Lawi kulawirana na kolu zawu na kaya zawu. <verse eid="NUM 4:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 4:47" />Wapalu woseri yawaweriti na vinja kwanjira malongu matatu mpaka vinja malongu muhanu, walii yawiziti kutenda mahengu na kulipapa Liringu Linanagala <verse eid="NUM 4:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 4:48" />woseri waweriti elufu nani na miya muhanu na malongu nani. <verse eid="NUM 4:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 4:49" />Kila yumu kapananituwi lihengu lyakuyi lya kupapa Liringu Linanagala gambira Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yakamlagaliriti Musa.<verse eid="NUM 4:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="NUM 5" />
  <para style="s">Wantu wahumba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 5:1" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Musa, <verse eid="NUM 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 5:2" />guwagambiri wana wa Israeli wamlaviyi kunja kukambi kila muntu yakawera na ungumbula na kila muntu yakalawa ufira na kila yakawera kahakata kulongolu kwa Mlungu kwa kushinkura mtugulu. <verse eid="NUM 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 5:3" />Hamuwalaviyi kunja kukambi wantu woseri awa, wapalu na wadala su nawiza kutula uhakata mukambi zawu pahala panulikala pakati pawu. <verse eid="NUM 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 5:4" />Wana wa Israeli watenditi ntambu ayi, wawawingiti kunja kukambi. Womberi watenditi gambira Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yakamlagaliriti Musa.<verse eid="NUM 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuwuzilira kwa shilii shidoda shagutenditi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 5:5" />Shakapanu Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Musa, <verse eid="NUM 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 5:6" />Guwagambiri wana wa Israeli kuwera muntu yoseri, mpalu ama mdala pakamtendera vidoda kwa muntu yoseri ulii, pakahera uwaminika kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu, muntu ayu hakaweri na likosa. <verse eid="NUM 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 5:7" />Muntu ayu mpaka katakuli vidoda vyakuyi vyakatenditi. Yomberi mpaka kalaviyi mawuziliru na hakawongeri yimu ya muhanu na hakampanani muntu ulii yakamtendiriti vidoda. <verse eid="NUM 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 5:8" />Kumbiti paiwera muntu ulii yakatendiritwi vidoda kahowa na kahera mlongu kwa kuwanka fidiya ilii, su fidiya ilii hailaviwi kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu kwajili ya watambika, fidiya ayi pamuhera na nkanyama kondolu gwa shipalu kwajili ya tambiku ya kupunguwa toziya ya vidoda vyakuyi muntu ulii. <verse eid="NUM 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 5:9" />Malaviwu goseri wana wa Israeli gawajegiti kwa mtambika, su malaviwu galii hagaweri ga mtambika. <verse eid="NUM 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 5:10" />Su kila mafupu pagalaviwa kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu kwa kumjegera mtambika, su mafupu galii hagaweri ga mtambika.<verse eid="NUM 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sitaka lya mdala yakawera ndiri mwaminika mundowa kwa mpalu gwakuyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 5:11" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Musa, <verse eid="NUM 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 5:12" />Guwagambiri aga wana wa Israeli. Handa mdala yoseri ulii pakahera uwaminika kwa mpalu gwakuyi <verse eid="NUM 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 5:13" />pakagonja na mpalu gwingi pota na mpalu gwakuyi ama muntu gwingi kumana, mdala ulii hakaweri kahakata kulongolu kwa Mlungu, kumbiti kwahera muntu yakawoniti pakatenditi shitwatira shakuwi shilii toziya wambatiti ndiri ugoni. <verse eid="NUM 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 5:14" />Su mpalu gwakuyi pakahola na pakawera na weya kwa mdala gwakuyi yakalituliti uhakata, ama pakawera na weya na mdala gwakuyi tembera mdala gwakuyi kalituliti ndiri uhakata, <verse eid="NUM 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 5:15" />shakapanu mpalu ulii hakamjegi mdala gwakuyi kwa mtambika. Yomberi hakalaviyi malaviwu shibaba shimu sha ubumu wa shayili, kumbiti ubumu ulii nawawulekera lipaki ama ubani toziya ilii iwera malaviwu ga viboga vya mpalu yakamuhola mdala gwakuyi katenda uhumba, malaviwu gagalaviwa kulanguziya handa nakaka mdala gwakuyi kawera na likosa ama kawera ndiri na likosa.<verse eid="NUM 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 5:16" />Mtambika hakamjegi mdala ulii pakwegera na shitalawanda sha kutambikira na kumgolosiya kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="NUM 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 5:17" />Su hakamiminiri mashi mananagala mushiwiga shididini, hakatoli lidika lya pasi pa Liringu Linanagala na kuliyitira mumashi galii su kugatenda gakalipi. <verse eid="NUM 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 5:18" />Mtambika pakamtula kala mdala ulii kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu, mtambika hakazigubutuli mvili za mdala ulii na kumpanana malaviwu galii ga viboga yagalaviituwi toziya mpalu gwakuyi kamuholiti kuwera kagonja na mpalu gwingi. Mtambika hakashikoleli shombu shilii shashiwera na mashi makaripa yagajega mpangiru. <verse eid="NUM 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 5:19" />“Shakapanu mtambika hakamlapiziyi mdala ulii pakalonga. Payiwera gugonjiti ndiri na mpalu gwingi na gulitula ndiri uhakata paguwera pasi pa mpalu gwaku, su hapeni gupati mpangiru yaijeguwa na mashi aga makaripa.” <verse eid="NUM 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 5:20" />“Kumbiti handa gutenda vidoda uganu gwapasi pa mpalu gwaku, gulitula uhumba kwa kugonja na mpalu gwingi, mpalu yakawera ndiri mpalu gaku,” <verse eid="NUM 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 5:21" />“Mtambika kamlapiziyi mdala ulii shirapu sha mpangiru na kumgambira mdala uii, Mtuwa Mlungu kakukomangi guweri na mpangiru pakati pa wantu waku, guweri mpendi na mtima gwaku guvimbi.” <verse eid="NUM 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 5:22" />“Mashi aga yagajega mpangiru gingiri mumtima mwaku na gakutendi guweri mpendi na mtima gwaku guvimbi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 5:22">Na mdala ulii hakajimiri, yina haa.”<verse eid="NUM 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 5:23" />Su mtambika hakagalembi mpangiru azi mushintola na kuzigulula mumashi makaripa, <verse eid="NUM 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 5:24" />shakapanu hakamlandasiyi mdala ulii mashi makaripa galii yagajega mpangiru, mashi galii hagamwingiri munshimba mwakuyi na kumtenda kaweri na utama ukaripa nentu handa katenda aga. <verse eid="NUM 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 5:25" />Su mtambika hakayanji hakatoli malaviwu ga viboga virii vya weya mumawoku mwa mdala ulii na kuinyasula kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu na kuijega pashitalawanda sha kutambikira. <verse eid="NUM 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 5:26" />Shakapanu mtambika hakatoli liwoku limu lya malaviwu ga viboga kuwera maholuziwu na kugalunguziya pashitalawanda sha kutambikira. Upeleru mtambika hakamlandisiyi mdala ulii mashi galii. <verse eid="NUM 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 5:27" />Pakalanda kala, handa kalituliti uhakata na kaweriti ndiri maminika kwa mpalu gwakuyi, mashi galii gagajega mpangiru hagamtendi kaweri na utama mkaripa nentu munshimba na nshimba yakuyi hayivimbi na mtima gwakuyi gwa kulera mwana hagwaribiki. Mdala ulii hakaweri na mpangiru pakati pa wantu wakuyi. <verse eid="NUM 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 5:28" />Handa mdala ulii pakajimilika kulongolu kwa Mlungu na kawera ndiri na likosa, su hapeni kambuki na hakawezi kupata wana.<verse eid="NUM 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 5:29" />Su aga ndo malagaliru ga weya payiwera mdala kagonja na mpalu yakawera ndiri gwakuyi na kajimilika ndiri kulongolu kwa Mlungu, uganu kayugitwi kala, su yomberi hakalituli mweni uhakata kulongolu kwa Mlungu, <verse eid="NUM 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 5:30" />ama shaka mpalu pakawera na weya na kumuhola mdala gwakuyi kuwera na kagonja na mpalu gwingi. Yomberi hakamgolosiyi mdala ulii kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu, mtambika hakagatendi malagaliru goseri galii. <verse eid="NUM 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 5:31" />Mpalu gwakuyi hapeni kaweri na shidoda shoseri, kumbiti mdala hakatozwi kulawirana na shidoda shilii shakatenditi.<verse eid="NUM 5:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="NUM 6" />
  <para style="s">Malagaliru ga muntu yakatula nazili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 6:1" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambira Musa, <verse eid="NUM 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 6:2" />Guwagambiri wana wa Israeli malagaliru aga. Payiwera mpalu ama mdala pakafira kutula nazili, lagiru ya kulityeka kwajili ya Mtuwa Mlungu, <verse eid="NUM 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 6:3" />yomberi nakalanda divayi ama ujimbi, nakalanda isheshema ya divayi ama isheshema ya ntambu yamonga. Viraa nakalanda togwa yailawirana na zabibu ama kuliya zabibu zyaziwuliti ama zyaziyumiti. <verse eid="NUM 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 6:4" />Shaka shoseri pakawera mlagila, yomberi nakaliya shintu shoseri shashilawirana na mzabibu, kwanjira mbeyu ama mibaku yakuyi.<verse eid="NUM 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 6:5" />Mashaka goseri ga nazili yakuyi kwa kujitula gweka, hapeni kamogi mvili mumtuwi mwakuyi. Yomberi kafiruwa kaweri mnanagala kwa kulityeka kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu mpaka shaka shakuwi pashipera, hakazileki mvili zakuwi ziweri ntali. <verse eid="NUM 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 6:6" />Shaka shoseri shakulityeka kwajili ya Mtuwa Mlungu, yomberi nakasegelera mitugulu. <verse eid="NUM 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 6:7" />Ata paiwera mtugulu gwa tati ama mawu gwakuyi ama kaka ama dada gwakuyi, yomberi nakiza kulitula uhakata kulongolu kwa Mlungu toziya kalityekiti kwajili ya Mtuwa Mlungu kwa lapilu. <verse eid="NUM 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 6:8" />Shaka shoseri pakawera mnazili, su hakaweri mtyeka kwajili ya Mtuwa Mlungu.<verse eid="NUM 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 6:9" />Handa muntu yoseri pakahowa vumu kulongolu kwakuyi mnazili, mvili zakuyi pazituluwa uhakata kulongolu kwa Mlungu, muntu yakatula nazili ulii hakamogi mvili zakuyi lishaka lya kupungiwa kwakuyi mulishaka lya saba. <verse eid="NUM 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 6:10" />Mulishaka lya nani yomberi hakajegi wankunda wawili ama wateteli wawili kwa mtambika kulongolu kwa ligomi lya kwingirira Muliringu Linanagala. <verse eid="NUM 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 6:11" />Mtambika hakamlaviyi mpongu yumu kuwera tambiku ya kuwusiya vidoda na wamonga kuwera tambiku ya kulunguziwa nakamu, su hakamkolaniziyi mawoku toziya yomberi katenditi vidoda kwajili ya mitugulu. Lishaka lilaa lilii yomberi hakaweri mnanagala hakagutyeki kayi mtuwi gwakuyi. <verse eid="NUM 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 6:12" />Yomberi hakalityeki mweni kwajili ya Mtuwa Mlungu mushaka shakuwi sha kulitula gweka na hakamjegi mwana gwa kondolu gwa shipalu gwa shinja shimu kuwera tambiku ya likosa. Mashaka aga ga kwanja hapeni gawalanguwi toziya mvili zakuyi zyazityekituwi, zitulituwi uhakata kulongolu kwa Mlungu.<verse eid="NUM 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 6:13" />Aga ndo malagaliru kwa mlagilu mushaka sha kulitula gweka kwakuyi pashipera. Yomberi hakajeguwi kulongolu kwa lugomi lya kwingilira Muliringu Linanagala. <verse eid="NUM 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 6:14" />Palii paligomi yomberi hakamlaviliri Mtuwa Mlungu mafupu gakuyi, mwana gwa kondolu gwa shipalu yumu gwa shinja shimu yakawera ndiri na dosari kuwera tambiku ya kulunguziwa nakamu na mwana kondolu gwashidala yumu yakawera ndiri na dosari kuwera tambiku ya kuwusiya vidoda na mwana gwa kondolu gwa shipalu yumu kwajili ya tambiku ya ponga. <verse eid="NUM 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 6:15" />Viraa hakalaviyi lijamanda lya mabumunda yagalekeluwa ndiri simika na maandazi ga ubumu unama na lipaki na mabumunda mababani yagasyaguwa lipaki pamuhera na tambiku za viboga na tambiku za virandiru.<verse eid="NUM 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 6:16" />Mtambika kamlaviliri Mtuwa Mlungu vintu vyoseri virii pamuhera na tambiku yakuyi ya kuwusiya vidoda na tambiku yakuyi ya kulunguziya nakamu. <verse eid="NUM 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 6:17" />Yomberi hakamlaviliri Mtuwa Mlungu, lijamanda lilii lya mabumunda galii gagalekeluwa ndiri simika, hakamlaviliri tambiku ya kondolu ulii kuwera tambiku ya ponga, hakamlaviri pamuhera na tambiku za viboga na tambiku za vilandiru.<verse eid="NUM 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 6:18" />Paligomi palii pakwingilira Muliringu Linanagala, mlagilu ulii hakamogi mvili zyakazityekiti. Su hakazitoli mvili zilii na kuzipambira pa motu pasi pa tambiku ya ponga.<verse eid="NUM 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 6:19" />Shakapanu mtambika hakatoli liwoku lya mwana gwa kondolu gwashipalu lyalipwasiwituwi pamuhera na andazi limu lyalilekerituwi ndiri simika kulawa mulijamanda lya mabumunda mababani gagalekeluwa ndiri simika na kumpanana mnazili mumawoku pakamalila kala kumoga mvili zakuyi zyakaweriti nazi shaka sha kutyekuwa kwakuyi. <verse eid="NUM 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 6:20" />Mtambika hakavinyasuli vintu virii kuwera tambiku kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu, vintu virii haviweri vinanagala kwa mtambika, pamuhera na shidari shakashinyasuliti pamuhera na lihondu lyaliraviwituwi kuwera tambiku. Pa aga, muntu yakatula nazili hakawezi kulanda divayi.<verse eid="NUM 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 6:21" />Ali ndo lilagaliru kwa muntu yakalaviya nazili yakagaliripiriti malaviwu gakuyi kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu, pamonga mekawezi kulaviya shoseri, yomberi hakatendi kulinganira na nazili yakalituliti kulawirana na lilagaliru lya kulityeka kwakuyi.<verse eid="NUM 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Matekeleru ga Mtuwa Mlungu kupitira watambika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 6:22" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Musa, <verse eid="NUM 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 6:23" />Gumgambiri Aruni na wana wakuyi, hamuwatekeleri wana wa Israeli ntambu ayi.<verse eid="NUM 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 6:24" />Mtuwa Mlungu kawatekeleri</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 6:24">na kuwalolera.<verse eid="NUM 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 6:25" />Mtuwa Mlungu kawaloli kwa uheri</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 6:25">na kakutenderi maheri,<verse eid="NUM 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 6:26" />Mtuwa Mlungu kawapendereyi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 6:26">na kawapanani ponga.<verse eid="NUM 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 6:27" />Hangu ndo watambika hawawatekeleri wantu wa Israeli na neni hanuwatekeleri.<verse eid="NUM 6:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="NUM 7" />
  <para style="s">Malaviwu ga wakulu kwajili ya kutyekuwa Liringu Linanagala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 7:1" />Lishaka Musa pakamaliliti kuligolosiya Liringu Linanagala, yomberi kalimiminiriti lipaki su kulitenda liweri linanagala na kulityeka pamuhera na vyombu vyakuyi vyoseri. Viraa yomberi kashityekuwiti shitalawanda sha kutambikira pamuhera na vyombu vyakuyi vyoseri. <verse eid="NUM 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 7:2" />Shakapanu wakulu wa wantu wa Israeli na wakulu wa kolu na wakulu wa makabila walaviya tambiku zawu, awa ndo walii yawamtangiti Musa kuwawalanga wantu wa Israeli. <verse eid="NUM 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 7:3" />Womberi wajegiti malaviwu gawu kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu, mbutuka sita zyaigubikituwi zyazikwegituwi na wankanyama na wang'ombi washipalu lilongu na mbili na mbutuka yaikweguwituwi na wankanyama kwa kila wakulu wa wawili na ng'ombi pongu yumu kwa kila mkulu. Womberi wavilaviyiti kulongolu kwa Liringu Linanagala.<verse eid="NUM 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 7:4" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Musa, <verse eid="NUM 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 7:5" />guwanki malaviwu aga kulawa kwa womberi, su gatenderuwi mulihegu lya Liringu Linanagala. Guwapanani wantu wa Lawi kila yumu kulawirana na lihengu lyakuyi.<verse eid="NUM 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 7:6" />Su Musa katoliti mbutuka za kukwega zilii na wankanyama walii kawapananiti wantu wa Lawi. <verse eid="NUM 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 7:7" />Wantu wa Gerishoni wapananituwi mbutuka mbili na wankanyama wamsheshi kulawirana na lihengu lyawu, <verse eid="NUM 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 7:8" />Wantu wa Merari wapananituwi mbutuka za msheshi na wang'ombi washipalu wamsheshi kuwatanga mumahengu gawu. Awa Wagerishoni na Wamerari waweriti pasi pa ulonguziya wa Itihamari mwana gwa mtambika Aruni. <verse eid="NUM 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 7:9" />Kumbiti Musa kawapananiti ndiri shoseri wantu wa Kohati toziya womberi waweriti na lihengu lya kuvilolera vintu vinanagala vyavifiruwitwi kupapwa mumawega.<verse eid="NUM 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malaviwu ga wakulu kwajili ya pakutambikira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 7:10" />Lishaka shitalawanda sha kutambikira pashityekuwitwi, wakulu walii wagajegiti malaviwu gawu kwajili ya lihengu ali. <verse eid="NUM 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 7:11" />“Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Musa, kila lishaka mkulu yumu hakalaviyi tambiku yakuyi kwajili ya kushityeka shitalawanda sha kutambikira.”<verse eid="NUM 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 7:12" />Su ulii yakalaviyiti tambiku lishaka lya kwanja, kaweriti Nashoni mwana gwa Aminadabu gwa kabila lya Yuda. <verse eid="NUM 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 7:13" />Tambiku yakuyi iweriti sahani yimu ya madini ga feza ga kilu yimu na nusu na bakuli ayi paviwera vimemiziwa ubumu unama yauhanganyitwi na lipaki kwajili ya tambiku ya viboga viraa, <verse eid="NUM 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 7:14" />Bakuli shimu sha zahabu shashiwera na utopa wa gramu miya na lilongu shashimemiziwitwi ubani viraa. <verse eid="NUM 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 7:15" />Ng'ombi gwashipalu yakakamala nentu ndiri yumu na kondolu gwashipalu yumu na mwana gwa kondolu gwashipalu yumu gwa shinja shimu kwajili ya tambiku ya kulunguziwa nakamu viraa. <verse eid="NUM 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 7:16" />Mbuzi pongu yumu kwajili ya tambiku ya kuwusiya vidoda viraa, <verse eid="NUM 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 7:17" />wang'ombi washipalu wawili na kondolu washipalu wamuhanu na wambuzi pongu wamuhanu na wakondolu washipalu wa muhanu wa shinja shimu kwajili ya tambiku ya ponga. Ayi ndo iweriti tambiku yakalaviyiti Nashoni mwana gwa Aminadabu.<verse eid="NUM 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 7:18" />Lishaka lya pili, Natihaneli mwana gwa Suari, mkulu gwa likabira lya Isakari kalaviyiti tambiku yakuyi.<verse eid="NUM 7:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 7:19" />Yomberi kalaviyiti sahani yimu yainyawitwi kwa madini ga feza kilu yimu na nusu na bakuli yimu yainyawitwi kwa madini ga feza gramu miya nani kulawirana na vipimu vyavitulitwi Muliringu Linanagala, sahani pamuhera na bakuli ayi vimemiziwitwi ubumu unama yauhanganyikitwi lipaki kwajili ya tambiku ya viboga viraa. <verse eid="NUM 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 7:20" />Bakuli shimu sha zahabu sha gramu miya na lilongu pashimemiziwitwi ubani viraa, <verse eid="NUM 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 7:21" />Ng'ombi gwashipalu yakakamala nentu ndiri yumu na kondolu gwashipalu yumu na mwana gwa kondolu gwashipalu yumu gwa shinja shimu kwajili ya tambiku ya kulunguziwa nakamu viraa. <verse eid="NUM 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 7:22" />Mbuzi pongu yumu kwajili ya tambiku ya kuwusiya vidoda viraa, <verse eid="NUM 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 7:23" />wang'ombi washipalu wawili na kondolu washipalu wamuhanu na wambuzi pongu wamuhanu na wakondolu washipalu wa muhanu wa shinja shimu kwajili ya tambiku ya ponga. Ayi iweriti tambiku yailaviwituwi na Netihaneli mwana gwa Suari viraa.<verse eid="NUM 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 7:24" />Lishaka lya tatu, Eliyabu mwana gwa Heloni, yomberi kaweriti mkulu gwa wantu wa likabila lya Zebuluni, su kalaviyiti malaviwu gakuyi. <verse eid="NUM 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 7:25" />Yomberi kalaviyiti sahani yimu yainyawitwi kwa madini ga feza kilu yimu na nusu na bakuli yimu yainyawitwi kwa madini ga feza gramu miya nani kulawirana na vipimu vyavitulitwi Muliringu Linanagala, sahani pamuhera na bakuli azi vimemiziwitwi ubumu unama yauhanganyikitwi lipaki kwajili ya tambiku ya viboga viraa. <verse eid="NUM 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 7:26" />Bakuli yimu ya zahabu shashiwera na utopa wa gramu miya na lilongu shashimemiziwitwi ubani viraa, <verse eid="NUM 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 7:27" />ng'ombi gwashipalu yakakamala nentu ndiri yumu na kondolu gwashipalu yumu na mwana gwa kondolu gwashipalu yumu gwa shinja shimu kwajili ya tambiku ya kulunguziwa nakamu viraa. <verse eid="NUM 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 7:28" />Mbuzi pongu yumu kwajili ya tambiku ya kuwusiya vidoda viraa, <verse eid="NUM 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 7:29" />wang'ombi washipalu wawili na kondolu washipalu wamuhanu na wambuzi pongu wamuhanu na wakondolu washipalu wa muhanu wa shinja shimu kwajili ya tambiku ya ponga. Ayi iweriti tambiku yailaviwitwi na Eliyabu mwana gwa Heloni.<verse eid="NUM 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 7:30" />Lishaka lya msheshi Elisuri mwana gwa Shedeuri, mkulu ngwa likabila lya Rubeni, kalaviyiti malaviwu gakuyi. <verse eid="NUM 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 7:31" />Yomberi kalaviyiti sahani yimu yainyawitwi kwa madini ga feza kilu yimu na nusu na bakuli yimu yainyawitwi kwa madini ga feza gramu miya nani kulawirana na vipimu vyavitulitwi Muliringu Linanagala, sahani pamuhera na bakuli ayi vimemiziwitwi ubumu unama yauhanganyikitwi lipaki kwajili ya tambiku ya viboga. <verse eid="NUM 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 7:32" />Bakuli shimu shashiwera na utopa wa gramu miya na lilongu shashimemiziwitwi ubani, <verse eid="NUM 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 7:33" />ng'ombi gwashipalu yakakamala nentu ndiri yumu na kondolu gwashipalu yumu na mwana gwa kondolu gwashipalu yumu gwa shinja shimu kwajili ya tambiku ya kulunguziwa nakamu. <verse eid="NUM 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 7:34" />Mbuzi pongu yumu kwajili ya tambiku ya kuwusiya vidoda, <verse eid="NUM 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 7:35" />wang'ombi washipalu wawili na kondolu washipalu wamuhanu na wambuzi pongu wamuhanu na wakondolu washipalu wa muhanu wa shinja shimu kwajili ya tambiku ya ponga. Ayi iweriti tambiku yailaviwitwi na Elisuri mwana gwa Shedeuri.<verse eid="NUM 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 7:36" />Lishaka lya muhanu Shelumieli mwana gwa Surishadayi, mkulu ngwa likabila lya Simiyoni, kalaviyiti malaviwu gakuyi.<verse eid="NUM 7:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 7:37" />Yomberi kalaviyiti sahani yimu yainyawitwi kwa madini ga feza kilu yimu na nusu na bakuli yimu yainyawitwi kwa madini ga feza gramu miya nani kulawirana na vipimu vyavitulitwi Muliringu Linanagala, sahani pamuhera na bakuli azi vimemiziwitwi ubumu unama yauhanganyikitwi lipaki kwajili ya tambiku ya viboga. <verse eid="NUM 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 7:38" />Bakuli yimu yainyawitwi kwa madini ga zahabu shashiweriti na utopa wa gramu miya na lilongu shashimemiziwitwi ubani, <verse eid="NUM 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 7:39" />ng'ombi gwashipalu yakakamala nentu ndiri yumu na kondolu gwashipalu yumu na mwana gwa kondolu gwashipalu yumu gwa shinja shimu kwajili ya tambiku ya kulunguziwa nakamu. <verse eid="NUM 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 7:40" />Mbuzi pongu yumu kwajili ya tambiku ya kuwusiya vidoda, <verse eid="NUM 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 7:41" />wang'ombi washipalu wawili na kondolu washipalu wamuhanu na wambuzi pongu wamuhanu na wakondolu washipalu wa muhanu wa shinja shimu kwajili ya tambiku ya ponga. Ayi iweriti tambiku yailaviwitwi na Shelumieli mwana gwa Surishadayi.<verse eid="NUM 7:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 7:42" />Lishaka lya sita Eliasafu mwana gwa Deuli, mkulu gwa likabila lya Gadi, kalaviyiti malaviwu gakuyi. <verse eid="NUM 7:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 7:43" />Yomberi kalaviyiti sahani yimu yainyawitwi kwa madini ga feza kilu yimu na nusu na bakuli yimu yainyawitwi kwa madini ga feza gramu miya nani kulawirana na vipimu vyavitulituwi Muliringu Linanagala, sahani pamuhera na bakuli azi vimemiziwitwi ubumu unama yauhanganyikitwi lipaki kwajili ya tambiku ya viboga. <verse eid="NUM 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 7:44" />Bakuli shimu sha zahabu shashiweriti na utopa wa gramu miya na lilongu shashimemiziwitwi ubani, <verse eid="NUM 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 7:45" />ng'ombi gwashipalu yakakamala nentu ndiri yumu na kondolu gwashipalu yumu na mwana gwa kondolu gwashipalu yumu gwa shinja shimu kwajili ya tambiku ya kulunguziwa nakamu. <verse eid="NUM 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 7:46" />Mbuzi pongu yumu kwajili ya tambiku ya kuwusiya vidoda, <verse eid="NUM 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 7:47" />wang'ombi washipalu wawili na kondolu washipalu wamuhanu na wambuzi pongu wamuhanu na wakondolu washipalu wa muhanu wa shinja shimu kwajili ya tambiku ya ponga. Ayi iweriti tambiku yailaviwitwi na Eliasafu mwana gwa Deuli.<verse eid="NUM 7:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 7:48" />Lishaka lya saba Elishama mwana gwa Amihudi, mkulu gwa likabila lya Efraimu, kalaviyiti malaviwu gakuyi. <verse eid="NUM 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 7:49" />Yomberi kalaviyiti sahani yimu yainyawitwi kwa madini ga feza kilu yimu na nusu na bakuli yimu yainyawitwi kwa madini ga feza gramu miya nani kulawirana na vipimu vyavitulituwi Muliringu Linanagala, sahani pamuhera na bakuli azi vimemiziwitwi ubumu unama yauhanganyikitwi lipaki kwajili ya tambiku ya viboga. <verse eid="NUM 7:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 7:50" />Bakuli shimu sha zahabu shashiweriti na utopa wa gramu miya na lilongu shashimemiziwitwi ubani, <verse eid="NUM 7:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="NUM 7:51" />ng'ombi gwashipalu yakakamala nentu ndiri yumu na kondolu gwashipalu yumu na mwana gwa kondolu gwashipalu yumu gwa shinja shimu kwajili ya tambiku ya kulunguziwa nakamu. <verse eid="NUM 7:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="NUM 7:52" />Mbuzi pongu yumu kwajili ya tambiku ya kuwusiya vidoda, <verse eid="NUM 7:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="NUM 7:53" />wang'ombi washipalu wawili na kondolu washipalu wamuhanu na wambuzi pongu wamuhanu na wakondolu washipalu wa muhanu wa shinja shimu kwajili ya tambiku ya ponga. Ayi iweriti tambiku yailaviwitwi na Elishama mwana gwa Amihudi.<verse eid="NUM 7:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="NUM 7:54" />Lishaka lya nani Gamalieli mwana gwa Pedasuri, mkulu gwa likabila lya Manasi, kalaviyiti mlaviwu gakuyi. <verse eid="NUM 7:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="NUM 7:55" />Yomberi kalaviyiti sahani yimu yainyawitwi kwa madini ga feza kilu yimu na nusu na bakuli yimu yainyawitwi kwa madini ga feza gramu miya nani kulawirana na vipimu vyavitulitwi Muliringu Linanagala, sahani pamuhera na bakuli azi vimemiziwitwi ubumu unama yauhanganyikitwi lipaki kwajili ya tambiku ya viboga. <verse eid="NUM 7:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="NUM 7:56" />Bakuli shimu sha zahabu shashiwera na utopa wa gramu miya na lilongu shashimemiziwitwi ubani, <verse eid="NUM 7:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="NUM 7:57" />ng'ombi gwashipalu yakakamala nentu ndiri yumu na kondolu gwashipalu yumu na mwana gwa kondolu gwashipalu yumu gwa shinja shimu kwajili ya tambiku ya kulunguziwa nakamu. <verse eid="NUM 7:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="NUM 7:58" />Mbuzi pongu yumu kwajili ya tambiku ya kuwusiya vidoda, <verse eid="NUM 7:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="NUM 7:59" />wang'ombi washipalu wawili na kondolu washipalu wamuhanu na wambuzi pongu wamuhanu na wakondolu washipalu wa muhanu wa shinja shimu kwajili ya tambiku ya ponga. Ayi iweriti tambiku yailaviwitwi na Gamalieli mwana gwa Padasuri.<verse eid="NUM 7:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="NUM 7:60" />Lishaka lya tisa Abidani mwana gwa Gidiyoni, mkulu gwa likabila lya Benjamini, kalaviyiti malaviwu gakuyi. <verse eid="NUM 7:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="NUM 7:61" />Yomberi kalaviyiti sahani yimu yainyawitwi kwa madini ga feza kilu yimu na nusu na bakuli yimu yainyawitwi kwa madini ga feza gramu miya nani kulawirana na vipimu vyavitulitwi Muliringu Linanagala, sahani pamuhera na bakuli azi vimemiziwitwi ubumu unama yauhanganyikitwi lipaki kwajili ya tambiku ya viboga. <verse eid="NUM 7:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="NUM 7:62" />Bakuli shimu sha zahabu shashiwera na utopa wa gramu miya na lilongu shashimemiziwitwi ubani, <verse eid="NUM 7:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="NUM 7:63" />ng'ombi gwashipalu yakakamala nentu ndiri yumu na kondolu gwashipalu yumu na mwana gwa kondolu gwashipalu yumu gwa shinja shimu kwajili ya tambiku ya kulunguziwa nakamu. <verse eid="NUM 7:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="NUM 7:64" />Mbuzi pongu yumu kwajili ya tambiku ya kuwusiya vidoda, <verse eid="NUM 7:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="NUM 7:65" />wang'ombi washipalu wawili na kondolu washipalu wamuhanu na wambuzi pongu wamuhanu na wakondolu washipalu wa muhanu wa shinja shimu kwajili ya tambiku ya ponga. Ayi iweriti tambiku yailaviwitwi na Abidani mwana gwa Gidiyoni.<verse eid="NUM 7:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="NUM 7:66" />Lishaka lya lilongu Ahiezeri mwana gwa Amishadayi, mkulu gwa likabila lya Dani, kalaviyiti malaviwu gakuyi. <verse eid="NUM 7:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="NUM 7:67" />Yomberi kalaviyiti sahani yimu yainyawitwi kwa madini ga feza kilu yimu na nusu na bakuli yimu yainyawituwi kwa madini ga feza gramu miya nani kulawirana na vipimu vyavitulitwi Muliringu Linanagala, sahani pamuhera na bakuli azi vimemiziwitwi ubumu unama yauhanganyikituwi lipaki kwajili ya tambiku ya viboga. <verse eid="NUM 7:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="NUM 7:68" />Bakuli yimu ya zahabu shashiwera na utopa wa gramu miya na lilongu shashimemiziwitwi ubani, <verse eid="NUM 7:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="NUM 7:69" />ng'ombi gwashipalu yakakamala nentu ndiri yumu na kondolu gwashipalu yumu na mwana gwa kondolu gwashipalu yumu gwa shinja shimu kwajili ya tambiku ya kulunguziwa nakamu. <verse eid="NUM 7:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="NUM 7:70" />Mbuzi pongu yumu kwajili ya tambiku ya kuwusiya vidoda, <verse eid="NUM 7:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="NUM 7:71" />wang'ombi washipalu wawili na kondolu washipalu wamuhanu na wambuzi pongu wamuhanu na wakondolu washipalu wa muhanu wa shinja shimu kwajili ya tambiku ya ponga. Ayi iweriti tambiku yailaviwitwi na Ahiezeri mwana gwa Amishadayi.<verse eid="NUM 7:71" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="NUM 7:72" />Lishaka lya lilongu na limu, Pagieli mwana gwa Okurani, mkulu gwa likabila lya Asheri, kalaviyiti malaviwu gakuyi. <verse eid="NUM 7:72" /><verse number="73" style="v" sid="NUM 7:73" />Yomberi kalaviyiti sahani yimu yainyawitwi kwa madini ga feza kilu yimu na nusu na bakuli yimu yainyawitwi kwa madini ga feza gram miya nani kulawirana na vipimu vyavitulitwi Muliringu Linanagala, sahani pamuhera na bakuli ayi vimemiziwitwi ubumu unama yauhanganyikitwi lipaki kwajili ya tambiku ya viboga. <verse eid="NUM 7:73" /><verse number="74" style="v" sid="NUM 7:74" />Bakuli yimu sha zahabu shashiwera na utopa wa gram miya na lilongu shashimemiziwitwi ubani, <verse eid="NUM 7:74" /><verse number="75" style="v" sid="NUM 7:75" />ng'ombi gwashipalu yakakamala nentu ndiri yumu na kondolu gwashipalu yumu na mwana gwa kondolu gwashipalu yumu gwa shinja shimu kwajili ya tambiku ya kulunguziwa nakamu. <verse eid="NUM 7:75" /><verse number="76" style="v" sid="NUM 7:76" />Mbuzi pongu yumu kwajili ya tambiku ya kuwusiya vidoda, <verse eid="NUM 7:76" /><verse number="77" style="v" sid="NUM 7:77" />wang'ombi washipalu wawili na kondolu washipalu wamuhanu na wambuzi pongu wamuhanu na wakondolu washipalu wa muhanu wa shinja shimu kwajili ya tambiku ya ponga. Ayi iweriti tambiku yailaviwitwi na Pagieli mwana gwa Okurani.<verse eid="NUM 7:77" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="NUM 7:78" />Mulishaka lya lilongu na mbili Ahira mwana gwa Enani, mkulu gwa likabila lya Nafutali, kalaviyiti malaviwu gakuyi. <verse eid="NUM 7:78" /><verse number="79" style="v" sid="NUM 7:79" />Yomberi kalaviyiti sahani yimu yainyawitwi kwa madini ga feza kilu yimu na nusu na bakuli yimu yainyawitwi kwa madini ga feza gramu miya nani kulawirana na vipimu vyavitulitwi Muliringu Linanagala, sahani pamuhera na bakuli ayi vimemiziwitwi ubumu unama yauhanganyikitwi lipaki kwajili ya tambiku ya viboga. <verse eid="NUM 7:79" /><verse number="80" style="v" sid="NUM 7:80" />Bakuli yimu yaiwera na utopa wa gramu miya na lilongu shashimemiziwituwi ubani, <verse eid="NUM 7:80" /><verse number="81" style="v" sid="NUM 7:81" />ng'ombi gwashipalu yakakamala nentu ndiri yumu na kondolu gwashipalu yumu na mwana gwa kondolu gwashipalu yumu gwa shinja shimu kwajili ya tambiku ya kulunguziwa nakamu. <verse eid="NUM 7:81" /><verse number="82" style="v" sid="NUM 7:82" />Mbuzi pongu yumu kwajili ya tambiku ya kuwusiya vidoda, <verse eid="NUM 7:82" /><verse number="83" style="v" sid="NUM 7:83" />wang'ombi washipalu wawili na kondolu washipalu wamuhanu na wambuzi pongu wamuhanu na wakondolu washipalu wa muhanu wa shinja shimu kwajili ya tambiku ya ponga. Ayi iweriti tambiku yailaviwitwi na Ahira mwana gwa Enani.<verse eid="NUM 7:83" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="84" style="v" sid="NUM 7:84" />Mawalanga goseri ga malaviwu ga wakulu wa Waisraeli kwajili ya shitalawanda sha kutambikira lishaka palityekuwitwi gaweriti, sahani zyazinyawitwi kwa madini ga feza ziweriti lilongu na mbili na mabakuli gaganyawitwi kwa madini ga feza gaweriti lilongu na mbili na visahani vyavinyawitwi kwa zahabu viweriti lilongu na mbili. <verse eid="NUM 7:84" /><verse number="85" style="v" sid="NUM 7:85" />Kila sahani yainyawitwi kwa madini ga feza iweriti na utopa wa kilu yimu na nusu na kila bakuli liweriti na utopa wa gramu miya nani. Su vyombu vyoseri viweriti na utopa wa kilu malongu mawili na saba na gramu miya sita kulawirana na vipimu vyavitulitwi Muliringu Linanagala.<verse eid="NUM 7:85" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="86" style="v" sid="NUM 7:86" />Visahani virii lilongu na mbili vyavinyawitwi kwa zahabu, virii vyavimemiti ubani kila shimu shiweriti na utopa wa gramu miya na lilongu kulawirana na vipimu vyavitulitwi Muliringu Linanagala, vyoseri viweriti na utopa wa kilu yimu na gramu miya tatu na malongu mawili. <verse eid="NUM 7:86" /><verse number="87" style="v" sid="NUM 7:87" />Walanga ya wankanyama woseri wakulunguziwa waweriti, wang'ombi washipalu lilongu na mbili na wakondolu washipalu wa shinja shimu waweriti lilongu na mbili na wambuzi pongu waweriti lilongu na mbili pamuhera na tambiku ya viboga kwajili ya tambiku ya kuwusiya vidoda. <verse eid="NUM 7:87" /><verse number="88" style="v" sid="NUM 7:88" />Walanga ya wankanyama yawalaviyitwi kuwera tambiku ya ponga waweriti wang'ombi washipalu malongu mawili na msheshi na wakondolu washipalu malongu sita na wambuzi pongu waweriti malongu sita na wakondolu washipalu wa shinja shimu waweriti malongu sita. Ayi ndo iweriti tambiku yailaviwitwi kwajili ya shitalawanda sha kutambikira pa shitalawanda ashi kutyekuwiti.<verse eid="NUM 7:88" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="89" style="v" sid="NUM 7:89" />Musa pakingiriti Muliringu Linanagala su kayoweri na Mtuwa Mlungu, yomberi kapikaniriti liziwu kulawa pamfiniku yagushemuwa shigoda sha kulekeziya, shashiweriti panani pa Lisanduku lya Lipatanu, kulawa pakati pa viumbi walii wawili yawawera na mbapatiru.<verse eid="NUM 7:89" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="NUM 8" />
  <para style="s">Aruni kankutula vintambi vya vikoluboyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 8:1" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Musa, <verse eid="NUM 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 8:2" />“Gumgambiri Aruni kuwera shaka pakagenda kuvitula vikoluboyi saba, yomberi kazituli su zilangali uwega wa kulongolu kwa shintambi ashi.”<verse eid="NUM 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 8:3" />Aruni katenditi ntambu ilii, kavituliti vikoluboyi vilangalili uwega kulongolu kwa shintambi, gambira Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yakamlagaliriti Musa. <verse eid="NUM 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 8:4" />Kulawa kumpindi mpaka pasi pa shintambi ashi sha shikoluboyi, shinyawituwi kwa zahabu yaipondituwi kulawirana na mfanu Mtuwa Mlungu yakamlanguziyiti Musa.<verse eid="NUM 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kutuluwa gweka wantu wa Lawi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 8:5" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti kayi Musa, <verse eid="NUM 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 8:6" />“Guwatuli gweka wantu wa Lawi kulawa kwa wantu wa Israeli, su guwapungi. <verse eid="NUM 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 8:7" />Hagutendi ntambu ayi kuwapunga, gwenga guwamishiri mashi, shakapanu walimogi nshimba yawu yoseri na wagululi nguwu zawu na walipungi wawu weni. <verse eid="NUM 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 8:8" />Shakapanu hawamtoli ng'ombi gwa shipalu yumu yakakamala nentu ndiri pamuhera na tambiku ya viboga ya ubumu unama yauhanganyikituwi na lipaki, su gwenga hagumtoli ng'ombi yumu yakakamala nentu ndiri yumonga kwajili ya tambiku ya kuwusiya vidoda. <verse eid="NUM 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 8:9" />Su hagushijojoniri shipinga shoseri sha wantu wa Israeli na kuwajega wantu wa likabila lya Lawi kulongolu kwa Liringu Linanagala. <verse eid="NUM 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 8:10" />Paguwajega wantu wa likabila lya Lawi kulongolu kwaneni, wantu wa Israeli hawawatulili mawoku womberi. <verse eid="NUM 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 8:11" />Su Aruni hakawatuli womberi kulongolu kwaneni handa tambiku ya kunyasulwa kulawa kwa wantu wa Israeli, su womberi hawaweri kala kuntendera lihengu.<verse eid="NUM 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 8:12" />Pa wantu wa likabila lya Lawi kuwatula mawoku pampindi pa pongu awa, gwenga gumtoli pongu yumu mwana gwa ng'ombi kuwera tambiku ya kuwusiya vidoda na yumonga hagumlaviyi kuwera tambiku ya kulunguziwa nakamu su kuwakolaniziya mawoku wantu wa likabila lya Lawi. <verse eid="NUM 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 8:13" />Shakapanu haguwagolusiyi wantu wa Lawi kulongolu kwa Aruni pamuhera na wana wakuyi kuwera gambira tambiku ya kunyasuluwa kulongolu kwa Mtuwa. <verse eid="NUM 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 8:14" />Kwanjira ayi gwenga haguwatuli gweka wantu wa likabila lya Lawi kulawa kwa wana wa Israeli na wantu wa likabila lya Lawi hawaweri waneni.<verse eid="NUM 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 8:15" />Paguwapunga kala wantu wa Lawi na kuwalaviya gambira tambiku ya kunyasuluwa, womberi hawingiri kutenda mahengu gawu Kuliringu Linanagala. <verse eid="NUM 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 8:16" />Womberi walaviluwa waweri waneni badala ya vipanta njira wa wantu wa Israeli. <verse eid="NUM 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 8:17" />Kila shipanta njira mwana mpalu mwa wantu wa Israeli, muntu ama nkanyama su kaweriti gwa neni. Shaka panuwagamiziyiti vipanta njira muisi ya Misri, neni nuwatuliti gweka womberi kwajili ya neni namweni. <verse eid="NUM 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 8:18" />Kumbiti vinu nuwatola wantu wa likabia lya Lawi badala ya vipanta njira wa wana wapalu wa Israeli. <verse eid="NUM 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 8:19" />Neni nimpanana Aruni pamuhera na wana wakuyi, wantu woseri wa Israeli kuwera mafupu ga kutendera mahengu Kuliringu Linanagala kwajili ya wantu wa Israeli na kuwakolaniziya mawoku wantu wa Israeli nawiza kuhowa pawasegelera Pahala Pananagala.”<verse eid="NUM 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 8:20" />Su Musa na Aruni na shipinga shoseri sha wantu wa Israeli, wawatyekiti wantu wa likabila lya Lawi gambira Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yakamlagaliriti Musa. <verse eid="NUM 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 8:21" />Wantu wa likabila lya Lawi walipungiti weni na wagululiti nguwu zawu. Shakapanu Aruni kawalaviriti gambira tambiku ya kunyasuluwa kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu na kuwapunga su kawakolaniziyiti mawoku. <verse eid="NUM 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 8:22" />Pa aga, wantu wa likabila lya Lawi wagenditi Kuliringu Linanagala kutenda mahengu gawu pasi pa ugolokera wa Aruni pamuhera na wana wapalu wakuyi. Womberi watenditi gambira Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yakamlagaliriti Musa.<verse eid="NUM 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 8:23" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Musa, <verse eid="NUM 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 8:24" />“Kila muntu gwa likabila lya Lawi yakawera na vinja malongu mawili na muhanu na kwendeleya, yomberi hakatendi mahengu Kuliringu Linanagala, <verse eid="NUM 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 8:25" />yomberi hakaleki kutenda mahengu Kuliringu Linanagala pakawera na vinja malongu muhanu. <verse eid="NUM 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 8:26" />Yomberi pakuleka kutenda mahengu, su mekawezi kuwatanga wantu wa likabila lya Lawi wayaguwi pawatenda mahengu Kuliringu Linanagala, kumbiti kalekeziwa ndiri kutenda mahengu Kuliringu mulii. Ayi ndo ntambu yaguwapanana wantu wa likabila lya Lawi mahengu kutenda.”<verse eid="NUM 8:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="NUM 9" />
  <para style="s">Msambu gwa Pasaka ya pili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 9:1" />Mtuwa Mlungu kayoweriti na Musa kushiwala sha Sinayi mumwezi gwa kwanja gwa shinja sha pili pawalawiti kala muisi ya Misri. Su kamgambiriti, <verse eid="NUM 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 9:2" />“Guwagambiri wana wa Israeli kuwera womberi wafiruwa kuvina msambu gwa Pasaka ntambu yaitulituwi. <verse eid="NUM 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 9:3" />Mvini msambu agu mushaka shashitulitwi, mulishaka lya lilongu na msheshi mumwezi agu, shaka sha pamihi womberi hawatendi hangu kulawirana na amuli na malagizu gakuyi goseri.”<verse eid="NUM 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 9:4" />Su Musa kawagambiriti wantu wa Israeli kuvina msambu gwa Pasaka, <verse eid="NUM 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 9:5" />womberi waviniti msambu gwa Pasaka pamihi kushiwala sha Sinayi mulishaka lya lilongu na msheshi lya mwezi gwa kwanja. Wantu wa Israeli watenditi goseri gambira Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yakamlagaliriti Musa.<verse eid="NUM 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 9:6" />Kumbiti kuweriti na wantu wamu waweziti ndiri kuguvina msambu gwa Pasaka mulishaka lilii toziya womberi waweriti wahumba kwa kushinkula mitugulu. Su womberi wawagendiriti Musa pamuhera na Aruni, <verse eid="NUM 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 9:7" />“Wawagambiriti, twenga twawahakata kulongolu kwa Mlungu toziya tushinkula mitugulu, kumbiti iwera hashi tuleweleruwa kumlavilira Mtuwa Mlungu malaviwu pamuhera na wantu wa Israeli mushaka shashitulitwi?”<verse eid="NUM 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 9:8" />“Musa kawawankula, muheperi mpaka palii neni pampata malagizu kulawa kwa Mtuwa Mlungu kuusu mwenga.”<verse eid="NUM 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 9:9" />Shakapanu Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Musa, <verse eid="NUM 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 9:10" />“Yumu gwenu ama yumu gwa shiyiwuku shamwenga pakawera kajimilika ndiri kulongolu kwa Mlungu toziya ya kushinkura mtugulu ama pakawera kutali mumwanja kumbiti pakafira kuliya msambu gwa Pasaka, <verse eid="NUM 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 9:11" />muntu ayu hakatendi Pasaka ayi mulishaka lya lilongu na msheshi lya mwezi gwagufata. Yomberi hakatendi msambu kwa kuliya mabumunda yagalekuluwa ndiri simika pamuhera na likolu likaripa. <verse eid="NUM 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 9:12" />Nawasigaziya shiboga shoseri mpaka mandalawira, kayi nawamega shifupa shoseri sha nkanyama gwa tambiku. Womberi pawatenda msambu gwa Pasaka, wafiruwa kufata malagizu goseri. <verse eid="NUM 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 9:13" />Kumbiti muntu yoseri kaherepa ama muntu yakawera ndiri mumwanja, yomberi hakatendi ndiri msambu gwa Pasaka, hakatuluwi gweka kulawa kwa wantu wakuyi toziya kandavilira ndiri tambiku mushaka shashitulitwiti. Muntu ayu hakatozwi toziya ya vidoda vyakuyi.<verse eid="NUM 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 9:14" />Muhenga yakalikala pakati penu pakafira kuntendera msambu gwa Pasaka, muntu ayu kafiruwa katendi kulawirana na amuli na malagizu ga msambu gwa Pasaka. Muntu muhenga ama mwenikaya, hakatendi malagizu galaa galii ga msambu gwa Pasaka.”<verse eid="NUM 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lihundi lya motu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="EXO 40:34-38">Kulawa 40:34-38</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 9:15" />Lishaka Liringu Linanagala paligolusiwa, liwundi lisulukiti kuligubika Liringu ali. Pashiru mpaka mandawira liwundi ali liwoneka gambira motu. <verse eid="NUM 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 9:16" />Su ayi ndo ntambu yaiweriti kila lishaka, liwundi liligubikiti Liringu Linanagala paluwala na pashiru liwoneka gambira motu. <verse eid="NUM 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 9:17" />Shaka shoseri liwundi paliwera pa Liringu Linanagala, wana wa Israeli walikaliti na liwundi ali palinyasulituwi, wantu wa Israeli wahukiti kwendeleya na mwanja. <verse eid="NUM 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 9:18" />Womberi wagenditi mwanja kwa amuli ya Mtuwa Mlungu na walikaliti kayi kwa amuli yakuyi. Shaka shoseri liwundi paliwera pa Liringu Linanagala, wantu walikaliti palii. <verse eid="NUM 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 9:19" />Ata liwundi ali palilikala pa Liringu Linanagala kwa mashaka ngoo, wantu wa Israeli wamjimiriti Mtuwa Mlungu, womberi wawukiti ndiri palii. <verse eid="NUM 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 9:20" />Shaka shamonga liwundi ali paliwera pa Liringu linanagala kwa shaka shididini hera, kwa lilagaliru lya Mtuwa Mlungu, womberi wawukiti kugenda mwanja ama walikaliti. <verse eid="NUM 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 9:21" />Paiwera liwundi ali lilikala kwanjira pashiru mpaka mandawira hera, palinyasulwa mandawira yaifata, womberi wawukiti kwendeleya na mwanja. Su liwundi palinyasulwa paluwala ama pamihi, womberi wagenditi mwanja. <verse eid="NUM 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 9:22" />Lihundi ali palilikala pa Liringu Linanagala kwa mashaka mawili ama mwezi ama shinja, wantu wa Israeli hawasigali mumalingu gawu, kumbiti palinyasulitwi womberi watupuliti malingu gawu kugenda mwanja. <verse eid="NUM 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 9:23" />Kwa amuli ya Mtuwa Mlungu, womberi walikaliti na kwa amuli ya Mtuwa Mlungu, womberi wendereyiti na mwanja. Su womberi wajimiriti malagizu ga Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yakamlagaliriti Musa.<verse eid="NUM 9:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="NUM 10" />
  <para style="s">Mbalapi zyazinyawituwi kwa madini ga feza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 10:1" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Musa, <verse eid="NUM 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 10:2" />“Gunyawi mbalapi mbili kwa madini ga feza. Gwenga haguzigombi mpalapi azi paguwashema wantu na shaka sha kutupula Liringu Linanagala. <verse eid="NUM 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 10:3" />Mbalapi zoseri mbili pazigombwa pamuhera, shipinga shoseri hashijojoniki kulongolu kwaku paligomi lya kwingilira ku Liringu Linanagala. <verse eid="NUM 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 10:4" />Kumbiti mbalapi yimu hera paigombwa, su wakulu hera wa makabila ga Israeli hawajojoniki kulongolu kwaku. <verse eid="NUM 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 10:5" />Handa mbalapi palilaviya liziwu lya lilangaliru lya kuwuka, makabila gagabawiriti malingu gawu uwega wa kwagulawira mshenji hawanji kugenda mwanja. <verse eid="NUM 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 10:6" />Mbalapi paligombwa mara ya pili makabila gagabawiriti malingu gawu uwega wa kusika hawanji kuwuka. Mlilu haguweri lilangaliru lya kugenda mwanja. <verse eid="NUM 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 10:7" />Gwenga pagufira kuwajojonira hera wantu pamuhera, gugombi mbalapi kumbiti hapeni zilaviyi lilangaliru lya wantu kugenda.”<verse eid="NUM 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 10:8" />Wana wa Aruni yawawera watambika, womberi ndo hawazigombi mbalapi azi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 10:8">“Malagizu aga hagaweri kwa viyiwuku vyoseri vyaviza. <verse eid="NUM 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 10:9" />Gwenga pagulikomanga na wangondu yawingira kwa makakala muisi yaku, guwagambiri watambika kugomba mbalapi kwa liziwu lilii lya kuwukira. Neni Mtuwa Mlungu gwaku, hampikaniri na hanuwalopoziyi mwenga kulawa kwa wangondu wenu. <verse eid="NUM 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 10:10" />Viraa guwagambiri watambika kugomba mbalapi shaka wantu pawanemelera, na pawawera musambu gwa kila shinja na wantu pawavina msambu gwa lyezi lya syayi mukila mwezi. Guwagambiri womberi kuzigomba mbalapi wantu pawalaviya tambiku za kulunguziwa nakamu na palii pawalaviya tambiku za ponga. Handa pawatenda hangu, neni hanuwaholeri mwenga. Neni ndo Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwenu.”<verse eid="NUM 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Waisraeli wankuwuka Sinayi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 10:11" />Mulishaka lya malongu mawili mumwezi gwa pili, shinja sha pili kwanjila wantu wa Israeli pawawukiti kulawa Misri, liwundi lyaliweriti panani pa Liringu Linanagala linyasulituwi. <verse eid="NUM 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 10:12" />Shakapanu wanjiti mwanja kuwuka kulawa kushiwala sha Sinayi na wagenditi kulola kushana mpaka liwundi paligolokiti shiwala sha Parani. <verse eid="NUM 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 10:13" />Kwa mala ya kwanja Waisraeli wanjiti mwanja agu pawagajimira malilagaliru ga Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yakamlagaliriti Musa.<verse eid="NUM 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 10:14" />Walii yawaweriti pasi pa bendera ya shipinga sha likabila lya Yuda walongoleriti, shipinga shimu pa shipinga shamonga. Mkulu gwawu kaweriti Nashoni mwana gwa Aminadabu. <verse eid="NUM 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 10:15" />Natihaneli mwana gwa Suari kaweriti mkulu gwa shipinga sha likabila lya Isakari. <verse eid="NUM 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 10:16" />Viraa Eliyabu mwana gwa Heloni kaweriti mkulu gwa shipinga sha likabila lya Zebuluni.<verse eid="NUM 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 10:17" />Shakapanu Liringu Linanagala litupulitwi, su wantu wa shiyiwuku sha Gerishoni pamuhera na shiyiwuku sha Merari, walii yawalipapiti, wanjiti mwanja.<verse eid="NUM 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 10:18" />Shipinga shashiweriti pasi pa bendera ya likabila lya Rubeni, shifatiti kugenda mwanja shipinga pa shipinga. Mkulu gwawu kaweriti Elizuri mwana gwa Shedeuri. <verse eid="NUM 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 10:19" />Shelumieli mwana gwa Surishadayi kashilonguziyiti shipinga sha likabira lya Simiyoni. <verse eid="NUM 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 10:20" />Na Eliasafu mwana gwa Deuweli, kashilonguziyiti shipinga sha likabira lya Gadi. <verse eid="NUM 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 10:21" />Shakapanu wafatiti wantu wa kolu lwa Kohatihi, womberi wapapiti vyombu vinanagala vya Liringu Linanagala. Liringu Linanagala libaliluwa pamberi pa kuwuka mwanja.<verse eid="NUM 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 10:22" />Shipinga shashiweriti pasi pa bendera ya likabila lya Efraimu, shifatiti kugenda mwanja shipinga pa shipinga. Mkulu gwa shipinga ashi kaweriti Elishama mwana gwa Amiudi. <verse eid="NUM 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 10:23" />Gamalieli mwana gwa Pedasuri, kalilonguziyiti likabila lya Manasi. <verse eid="NUM 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 10:24" />Na Abiya mwana gwa Gidiyoni kalonguziyiti likabila lya Benjamini.<verse eid="NUM 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 10:25" />Upeleru walii yawaweriti pasi pa bendera ya shipinga shashilonguziwitwi na likabira lya Dani, yawaweriti gambira walolera kumbeli kwa vipinga vyoseri, wagenditi mwanja shipinga pa shipinga. Womberi walonguziwituwiti na Ahiezeri mwana gwa Amishidayi. <verse eid="NUM 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 10:26" />Pagieli mwana gwa Okurani kalilonguziyiti likabila lya Asheri. <verse eid="NUM 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 10:27" />Na Ahira mwana gwa Enani, yomberi kalilonguziyiti likabila lya Nafutali. <verse eid="NUM 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 10:28" />Agu ndo mlongoleru yawagufatiti wantu wa Israeli kulawirana na vipinga vyawu pawawuka kugenda mwanja.<verse eid="NUM 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 10:29" />Musa kamgambiriti Hobabu mwana gwa Reuweli shemeji gwakuyi, Reuweli muntu gwa Midiyani, mganafu gwa Musa, “Twenga twamwanja kugenda pahala Mtuwa Mlungu kalongiti, haniwapanani mwenga pahala panu’. Su gwizi tugendi pamuhera, twenga hatukutenderi manemu toziya Mtuwa Mlungu kalagalira kutupanana vintu viherepa twenga Waisraeli.”<verse eid="NUM 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 10:30" />Kumbiti Hobabu kawankuliti, “Neni hapeni ng'endi pamuhera na mwenga, kumbiti hambuyi muisi yangu kulikala na wantu wangu.”<verse eid="NUM 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 10:31" />Su Musa kamgambiriti, “Shondi nagutuleka toziya gwenga gupamana pahala patuweza kubawila malingu kushiwala, viraa guweza kutulanguziya. <verse eid="NUM 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 10:32" />Kayi pagugenda pamuhera na twenga, shoseri shiheri shakagenda kututendera Mtuwa Mlungu, ashi hagutenderuwi na gwenga viraa.”<verse eid="NUM 10:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mwanja gwankuwanja</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 10:33" />Su wantu wagenditi mwanja kulawa Sinayi, Lugongu lwa Mtuwa Mlungu, womberi wagenditi mwanja kwa mashaka matatu. Lisandiku lya Lipatanu lya Mtuwa Mlungu liwalonguleriti mwanja gwa mashaka galii matatu su kuwasakulira pahala pa kunyawa kambi. <verse eid="NUM 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 10:34" />Kila pawagenditi mwanja kulawa pahala pamu kugenda pahala pingi, liwundi lya Mtuwa Mlungu liweriti kumpindi kwawu paluwala.<verse eid="NUM 10:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 10:35" />Kila shaka lisandiku paligenditi mwanja kulongolu, Musa kalongiti, “Gugoloki gwee Mtuwa Mlungu, guwapalasiyi wangondu waku na walii yawakukalalira guwatendi watugi kulawa kulongolu kwaku.!” <verse eid="NUM 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 10:36" />Na shaka paligolokiti, Musa kalongiti, “Guwawuyiri, gwee Mtuwa Mlungu, awa maelufu kwa maelufu ga Waisraeli.”<verse eid="NUM 10:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="NUM 11" />
  <para style="s">Semu ishemuwa Tabera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 11:1" />Lishaka limu wantu wanjiti kumlalamikira Mtuwa Mlungu kuusu ntabiku zawu. Mtuwa Mlungu pakawapikiniriti womberi vyawatakuliti, su kaweriti na maya kawajegiriti motu. Shakapanu motu kulawa kwa Mtuwa Mlungu guyakiti pakati pawu na kulunguziya uwega umu wa malingu. <verse eid="NUM 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 11:2" />Wantu wamliliriti Musa na Musa kamluwiti Mtuwa Mlungu na motu gulii gutenditi tiya. <verse eid="NUM 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 11:3" />Su pahala palii pawashemuwa Tabera, toziya palii motu gwa Mtuwa Mlungu guyakiti pakati pa wantu.<verse eid="NUM 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Musa kankasyagula wakulu malongu saba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 11:4" />Pakati pa Waisraeli paweriti na muwamu mwa wantu wa Israeli kuweriti na shikundi shimu shashigenditi pamuhera sheni shiweriti na nfiru nkulu ya nyama. Ata Wantu wa Israeli na womberi wanjiti kulalama pawalonga. “Pamonga handa metuwezi kupata nyama ya kuliya! <verse eid="NUM 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 11:5" />Tulihola wasomba watuliyiti Misri pota shibena mgongu, mateteri na mateteri kulu, likolu vitunguwu na vitunguwu saumu! <verse eid="NUM 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 11:6" />Kumbiti vinu likakala litupera na kwahera shiboga shimonga ila mana hera!”<verse eid="NUM 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 11:7" />Mana iweriti handa mbeyu za mapemba, rangi yakuyi iweriti handa ya langi nfufu yaihanganyitwi na njanu. <verse eid="NUM 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 11:8" />Wantu watindira tindira na kuijojonira shakapanu wayisyaga kwa lwala ama wayitwangiti kwa matuli, wavuluga muviwiga na kunyawa maandazi. Kunoga kwakuyi kuweriti handa maandazi gawakalangiti kwa lipaki. <verse eid="NUM 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 11:9" />Mangami pagatulukiti pakambi shipindi sha pashiru mana ituluka viraa pamuhera na mangami. <verse eid="NUM 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 11:10" />Musa kapikiniriti wantu wankulira mkaya zawu zoseri, kila muntu pa ligomi lya liringu lyakuyi, su maya ya Mtuwa Mlungu kakalaliti nentu, na Musa wamkalaziiti. <verse eid="NUM 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 11:11" />Musa ndo pakamgambiriti Mtuwa Mlungu, “Iwera hashi gundendera vidoda neni ntumintumi gwaku? Mbona gufiriziwa ndiri na neni, ntambu gaa guntwika shisanga sha kuwatunza wantu woseri awa? Mana walira kulongolu kwa neni. <verse eid="NUM 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 11:12" />Hashi, ndo neni yanuwaleriti, ata gung'ambiliti nuwapapi pashifuwa shangu gambira yaya yakapapa mwana nonu na kuwajega kulii kuisi yaguwalagila kuwapanana wambuyi wetu? <verse eid="NUM 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 11:13" />Neni hampati koshi vinofu vya kuwaliziya wantu woseri awa? Toziya wankulila kulongolu kwaneni pawalonga, gutupanani vinofu tulii! <verse eid="NUM 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 11:14" />Hawezi ndiri kuwatunza wantu woseri awa gweka yangu, ashi ndo shitwatira shikulu nentu kwa neni. <verse eid="NUM 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 11:15" />Payiwera hangu ndo yaguntendera, mbaka gunagi kalongola! Handa pampata shibali kulongolu kwaku, nagundeka weri muntabiku yangu.”<verse eid="NUM 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 11:16" />Su, Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambira Musa, “Muwajojoniri wazewi malongu saba wa Israeli weni gwenga guvimana wankumpanana ligoya na kujimiruwa na wantu kuwera walongoziya guwejegi kuliringu lya kuliwona wagoloki pakwegera na gwenga. <verse eid="NUM 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 11:17" />Hansuluki aku na kuyowera na gwenga, hantoli seemu ya rohu yanikupananiti, niwapanani wantu awa. Nawomberi hawatoli lihengu lya kuwalolera weri wantu awa pamuhera na gwenga, nagwiza kushipapa shisanka ashi gweka yaku. <verse eid="NUM 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 11:18" />Vinu guwagambiri wantu, kuwera mulipungi toziya ya shilawu, hamliyi vinofu. Mtuwa Mlungu kapikanira pamlira na kulonga kuwera kwahera gwa kuwapanani vinofu, viraa ntambu ya mwenga iweriti iherepa pamuweriti muisi ya Misri. Vinu Mtuwa Mlungu hakawapanani vinofu, mwenga muviliyi. <verse eid="NUM 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 11:19" />Hapeni mliyi vinofu kwa lishaka limu hera ama mashaka mawili ama mashaka muhanu ama mashaka malongu ama malongu mawili, <verse eid="NUM 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 11:20" />kumbiti hamliyi vinofu kwa mwezi goseri! Hamuliyi vinofu mpaka mvitoki. Goseri aga toziya mumlemiti Mtuwa Mlungu yakaweriti palaa panu pakati penu, na kulira kulongolu kwakuyi pamlonga, iwera hashi tulawiti muisi ya Misri?”<verse eid="NUM 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 11:21" />Kumbiti Musa kamgambiriti “Mtuwa Mlungu, walanga ya wantu yawalonguziya panu ndo miya sita elufu wawagenda kwa magulu na gwenga gutakula hagumpanani vinofu vya kutosheya mwezi goseri! <verse eid="NUM 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 11:22" />Hashi, haweza kulikitula kondolu na ng'ombi wa kuwatosha? Hashi, wasomba woseri mubahari wawalowi kwajili ya womberi?”<verse eid="NUM 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 11:23" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamwankuliti Musa, “Hashi, uwezu waneni upungula?” “Haguwoni handa shisoweru shaneni hashiweri sha nakaka kwa gwenga ama ndala!”<verse eid="NUM 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 11:24" />Su Musa kagenda na kuwagambira wantu galii gakatakuliti Mtuwa Mlungu shakapanu kajojonili wazewi malongu saba kulawa muwamu mwa wazewi walongoziya na womberi wawatula kondolu kuizyengeta Lihema linanagala. <verse eid="NUM 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 11:25" />Su Mtuwa Mlungu kasulukiti muliwundi na kuyowera nayu. Shakapanu katola seemu ya rohu yakampananiti Musa, kawapananiti kila yumu gwa wazewi malongu saba. Pawayingirituwi na rohu ilii, wazewi walii wanjiti kutunga, kumbiti waweziti kutakula kwa likakala lya rohu ayi. <verse eid="NUM 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 11:26" />Wazewi wawili pakati pa walii malongu saba yawasyagulitwi Elidadi na Medadi, wasigaliti mukambi wayawu pawagenditi Kuliringu Linanagala. Rohu kawiziriti mlaa mlii mukambi, wanjiti kulonga shisoweru sha Mlungu palii pawaweriti. <verse eid="NUM 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 11:27" />Mndemba yumu kalawa mbiru na kumgambira Musa, “Elidadi na Medadi wankulaviya umbuyi kukambi.”<verse eid="NUM 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 11:28" />Su Yoshuwa mwana gwa Nuni, ulii yakaweriti mtanga gwa Musa kwanjira untemba wakuyi, kamgambiriti Musa, “Mtuwa gwangu guwaleweleri!”<verse eid="NUM 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 11:29" />Kumbiti Musa kamwankula, “hashi, guwona weya kwajili ya neni? Mtuwa Mlungu mekawapanani wantu wakuyi woseri rohu gwakuyi na womberi waweri wambuyi wa Mlungu.” <verse eid="NUM 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 11:30" />Shakapanu Musa kawuyiti na wazewi walii wa Waisraeli.<verse eid="NUM 11:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mtuwa Mlungu kankuwajega wankwali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 11:31" />Palaa palii Mtuwa Mlungu kalijegiti vumu lyega, lyega lilii lijegiti wankwali kulawa kubahali na kuwatenda watulukiri mumbwega mwa kambi, waeneyiti kilu mita zivuwa kuizyengeta kambi, waweriti ngoo mpaka mushiwunu. <verse eid="NUM 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 11:32" />Su lishaka lyoseri ali paliwala na pashiru na lishaka lyalifatiti wantu watenditi lihengu lya kujojonira gwali, kwahera muntu yakajojoniriti pasi pa kilu elufu yimu wawabanika kila pahala kumbwega kukambi su wawayumisiyi. <verse eid="NUM 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 11:33" />Kumbiti paweriti kwankali kwana vinofu vivuwa na pamberi wantu hawenimaliliri kuliya, Mtuwa Mlungu kawakalaliliriti wantu, kawakomangiti wantu kwa malweli madoda nentu. <verse eid="NUM 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 11:34" />Su pahala palii pashemuwa litawu Kiburoti Hataava, mana yakuyi pawawasiliti wantu yawaweriti walwaliya. <verse eid="NUM 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 11:35" />Kulawa palii Kiburoti Haava, wantu wagenditi mwanja mpaka Heseroti, wanyawiti malingu gawu na kulikala aku.<verse eid="NUM 11:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="NUM 12" />
  <para style="s">Miriamu na Aruni wankumlalamikira Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 12:1" />Shakapanu Miriamu pamuhera na Aruni wanjiti kumlonga vidoda Musa toziya ya mdala muntu gwa Kushi yakamuyugiti. <verse eid="NUM 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 12:2" />Womberi walongiti, “Hashi, iwera hashi Mtuwa Mlungu kankuyowera na Musa gweka yakuyi? Iwera hashi kayowera ndiri natwenga?” Mtuwa Mlungu kavipikiniriti visoweru avi. <verse eid="NUM 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 12:3" />Musa kaweriti muntu kananagala kuliku wantu wamonga woseri yawaweriti pasipanu.<verse eid="NUM 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 12:4" />Palaa palii Mtuwa Mlungu kawagambiriti Musa na Aruni na Miriamu, “Mwizi Muliringu Linanagala, mwenga watatu.” Su woseri watatu wagenditi Kuliringu Linanagala. <verse eid="NUM 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 12:5" />Shakapanu Mtuwa Mlungu kasulukiti mumpanda ya liwundi, kagolokiti paligomi lya kwingilira Muliringu Linanagala, su kawashemiti Aruni pamuhera na Miriamu. Woseri wawili wasegeleriti kulongolu. <verse eid="NUM 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 12:6" />Su Mtuwa Mlungu kawagambiriti, “Mpikaniri visoweru vyaneni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 12:6">Handa kwana mbuyi gwa Mlungu pakati penu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 12:6">hanuligubutuli namweni kwayomberi mumawonu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 12:6">hantakuli na yomberi mundotu.<verse eid="NUM 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 12:7" />Kumbiti kwa ntumintumi gwangu Musa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 12:7">yomberi kawera mwaminika mugoseri na numupanana lihengu lya kuwalolera wantu waneni woseri.<verse eid="NUM 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 12:8" />Neni nyowera nayu sheni kwa sheni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 12:8">ntakula nayu paweru pota na kufifa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 12:8">Yomberi kamona neni ntambu yawera.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 12:8">Su iwera hashi mtira ndiri kumtakulila madoda ntumintumi gwangu Musa?”<verse eid="NUM 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 12:9" />Panu Mtuwa Mlungu su kawera na maya na womberi, kawuka na kagenda zakuwi. <verse eid="NUM 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 12:10" />Liwundi paliwukiti kumpindi kuliringu lya kuliwona, Miriamu kawoneka kana ulweri wa likuli, mfufu mbuu handa lifukafuka. Aruni pakagalambukiti na kumlola Miriamu, kalikangasha kuwona handa kana ungumbula. <verse eid="NUM 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 12:11" />Panu, Aruni kamgambira Musa, “Gwee mtuwa gwangu, nagututenda toziya tutenda vitwatira vya unkali mahala na kutenda vidoda. <verse eid="NUM 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 12:12" />Nagumtenda Miriamu kaweri gambira mwana yakiwukiti mukahowa, mweni nusu ya nshimba yakuyi iwola.”<verse eid="NUM 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 12:13" />Musa kamlilira Mtuwa Mlungu pakalonga, “Nukuhiga gwee Mlungu, gumponiziyi.”<verse eid="NUM 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 12:14" />Kumbiti Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Musa, “Handa tati gwakuyi mekamtemeri mata kusheni su kumberiziya, hashi mekaweri ndiri na soni kwa mashaka saba? Su gumlaviyi kunja kukambi kalikali aku kwa mashaka saba, shakapanu guweza kumlekeziya kawuyi mukambi.” <verse eid="NUM 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 12:15" />Su Miriamu kawingituwiti kagendi kunja kukambi kwa mashaka saba. Wantu wanjiti ndiri mwanja mpaka Miriamu pawamuwuziyiti kayi Mukambi.<verse eid="NUM 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 12:16" />Pa aga, wantu wanjiti mwanja kulawa Haseroti, womberi wabawaliti malingu gawu mushiwala sha Parani.<verse eid="NUM 12:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="NUM 13" />
  <para style="s">Walolalola weri kwa bada</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="DEU 1:19-33">Liholu 1:19-33</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 13:1" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambira Musa, <verse eid="NUM 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 13:2" />“Guwatumi wantu wagendi kuilolalola weri isi ya Kanaani yang'enda kuwapanana Waisraeli. Hagumtumi muntu yumu kulawa kila likabila na muntu ayu kaweri mkulu gwa likabila lyakuyi.”<verse eid="NUM 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 13:3" />Su Musa katenditi shilii Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yakamlagaliriti. Kawatumiti wantu walii kulawa kushiwala sha Parani. Wantu woseri yawatumituwi waweriti wakulu wa makabila gawu Waisraeli. <verse eid="NUM 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 13:4" />Aga ndo matawu ga wantu walii,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 13:4">Kulawa likabila lya Rubeni kaweriti Shamuwa mwana gwa Zakuri.<verse eid="NUM 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 13:5" />Kulawa likabila lya Simiyoni, kaweriti Shafati mwana gwa Hori.<verse eid="NUM 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 13:6" />Kulawa likabila lya Yuda, kuweriti Karebu mwana gwa Yefuni.<verse eid="NUM 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 13:7" />Kulawa likabila lya Isakari, kuweriti Igali mwana gwa Yosefu.<verse eid="NUM 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 13:8" />Kulawa likabila lya Efraimu, kuweriti Hoshea mwana gwa Nuni.<verse eid="NUM 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 13:9" />Kulawa likakabila lya Benjamini, kuweriti Paliti mwana gwa Rafu.<verse eid="NUM 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 13:10" />Kulawa likabila lya Zebuluni, kuweriti Gadieli mwana gwa Sodi.<verse eid="NUM 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 13:11" />Kulawa likabila lya Manasi lilaa lilii lyaliweriti likabila lya Yusufu, kuweriti Gadi mwana gwa Susi.<verse eid="NUM 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 13:12" />Kulawa likabila lya Dani, kuweriti Amieli mwana gwa Gemali.<verse eid="NUM 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 13:13" />Kulawa likabila lya Asheri, kuweriti Seturi mwana gwa Mikaeli.<verse eid="NUM 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 13:14" />Kulawa likabila lya Nafutali, kuweriti Nabi mwana gwa Wofisi.<verse eid="NUM 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 13:15" />Kulawa likabila lya Gadi, kuweriti Geueli mwana gwa Maki.<verse eid="NUM 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 13:16" />Aga ndo matawu ga wantu Musa yakawatumiti kugenda kuilolalola weri isi ya Kanaani. Musa kampananiti Hoshea mwana gwa Nuni litawu lya syayi, su kamshemiti Yoshua.<verse eid="NUM 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 13:17" />Musa pakawatumiti wakulu walii kugenda kuilolalola weri isi ya Kanaani, su kawagambiriti, “Mkweni kugenda kulii kuisi ya uwega wa kusika wa Kanaani, mpaka muisi ya vigongu, <verse eid="NUM 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 13:18" />mwakailoliloli weri isi ilii. Mloliloli weri viraa handa wantu yawalikala mlii wawera na makakala ama walegilegi, wavuwa ama wavuwa ndiri. <verse eid="NUM 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 13:19" />Mloliloli weri handa isi ilii iherepa ama iherepa ndiri, miji yawalikala ya ntambu gaa, kwana numba ziherepa ama numba zyazizyengetiruwa na liboma? <verse eid="NUM 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 13:20" />Mloliloli weri viraa handa isi yeni iwera na ulunda ama ihushu, iwera na mitera ama yahera. Muweri na myoyu igangamala na pamuwuya mtoli mabwajubwaju gamu ga isi ilii.” Shilii shiweriti shaka sha zyabibu zyakwanja kuwula.<verse eid="NUM 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 13:21" />Su wantu walii wagenditi na kuilolalola weri isi kulawa kushiwala sha Sini mpaka Rehobu, pakwegera na njira ya kwingilira Hamati. <verse eid="NUM 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 13:22" />Womberi wagenditi mpaka uwega wa kusika wa Kanaani, wapitiriti mpaka mji gwa Hebroni. Mumji agu wawawoniti Waahimani na Washeshai na Watalimai, wantu wa shiyiwuku Anaki. Mji gwa Hebroni gunyawituwiti vinja saba pamberi pa kusoka pa mji gwa Soani yaguwera muisi ya Misri. <verse eid="NUM 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 13:23" />Walolalola awa pawasokiti mulilaranda lya Eshikoli, walolalola walii wabenangiti mikunguwi ga mtera gwa zyabibu, mkunguwi yaguweriti na mabwajubwaju gavuwa, mkunguwi agu gupapawituwiti na wantu wawili mulibiki. Watoliti viraa mabwajubwaju gagashemuwa makomamanga pamuhera na tini. <verse eid="NUM 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 13:24" />Pahala palii pashemuwa lularanda lwa Eshikoli Shiyeburaniya mana yakuyi shikunguwi. Toziya shikunguwi ashi sha zyabibu wantu walii wa Israeli washibenangiti kulawa pahala palii.<verse eid="NUM 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 13:25" />Pawailolalola weri kala isi kwa mashaka malongu msheshi, womberi wawuyiti. <verse eid="NUM 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 13:26" />Womberi wawagendiriti Musa na Aruni pamuhera na shipinga sha Waisraeli aku Kadeshi, kushiwala sha Parani. Su watakuliti galii yawagawoniti na kuwalunguziya mabwajubwaju ga isi ilii. <verse eid="NUM 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 13:27" />Wamgambiriti Musa, “Tusokiti isi yagututumiti tuiloliloli weri, isi ilii ifaa kwa kuiliziya mifugu pamuhera na kulima, aga ndo mabwajubwaju gakuyi. <verse eid="NUM 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 13:28" />Kumbiti wantu yawalikala kulii wawera na makakala nentu na miji yawu mikulu nentu na igangamala. Viraa twenga tushiwoniti shiyiwuku sha Anaki wantu wakulu nentu. <verse eid="NUM 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 13:29" />Waamaleki wankulikala isi ya uwega wa kusika wa Kanaani, wantu wa shiyiwuku sha Hiti na Yebusi na Amori wankulikala pahala pa vigongu, wantu wa shiyiwuku sha Kanaani wankulikala pakwegera na bahari ya Mediteranea na pakwegera na lushemba lwa Yoridani.”<verse eid="NUM 13:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 13:30" />Kumbiti Karebu kawanyamaziyiti wantu kulongolu kwa Musa pakalonga, “Tugendi kalongola twakaikolimlima isi ilii, toziya twana uwezu nentu wa kukanka.”<verse eid="NUM 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 13:31" />Kumbiti wantu yawagenditi pamuhera na Karebu kuilolalola isi ilii walongiti, “Hapeni tuwezi kulikomanga ngondu na wantu walii, womberi wawera na makakala kuliku twenga.” <verse eid="NUM 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 13:32" />Su womberi walongiti mpayu pakati pa Waisraeli kuusu isi yawailolitiloliti weri pawalonga, “Isi ilii yankuwalaga wantu wakuyi. Viraa wantu woseri yatuwawoniti kulii wakulu nentu. <verse eid="NUM 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 13:33" />Tuwawoniti makambaku kulii, wantu wa shiyiwuku sha Anaki. Twenga tuliholiti tuwera gambira vibatala kulongolu kwawu, ndo ntambu yawatuwoniti twenga.”<verse eid="NUM 13:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="NUM 14" />
  <para style="s">Wantu wa Israeli wankulalamika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 14:1" />Pashiru palii wantu wanjiti kulila kwa liziwu likulu na waliliti pashiru poseri. <verse eid="NUM 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 14:2" />Womberi wawalalamikiriti Musa na Aruni pawalonga, “Mbaka metuhowiti kulii Misri! Mbaka metuhowi palaa panu pashiwala! <verse eid="NUM 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 14:3" />Iwera jashi Mtuwa Mlungu kankutujega Muisi ayi? Hatulaguwi munkondu, wadala wetu pamuhera na wana wetu hawatoluwi kwa mamakala. Hashi iwera ndiri mbaka twenga kuwuya muisi ya Misri?” <verse eid="NUM 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 14:4" />Su wanja kuligambiziyana, “Su aya tuwasyaguli wakulu wamonga, tuwuyi muisi ya Misri!”<verse eid="NUM 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 14:5" />Palii Musa na Aruni wasuntamiti makukama kulongolu kwa shipinga shoseri sha Waisraeli. <verse eid="NUM 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 14:6" />Yoshua mwana gwa Nuni, Karebu mwana gwa Yefune, walii yawaweriti wamu wa walii yawagenditi kuilolalola weri isi ilii, su wazipapuliti nguwu zawu <verse eid="NUM 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 14:7" />na kushigambira shipinga shoseri sha Waisraeli, “Isi yatugenditi kuilolalola weri iherepa nentu. <verse eid="NUM 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 14:8" />Payiwera Mtuwa Mlungu kaherepeziwa na twenga, hakatujegi aku na kutupanana isi yaiwera na ulunda na utapaka wakuyi uwera na mbotu na isi iherepa na ifaa kwa mifugu na kulima. <verse eid="NUM 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 14:9" />Kumbiti hera namumlema Mtuwa Mlungu, ama kuwatira wenikaya wa isi ilii. Toziya twenga hatuwankaki kalongola. Shidiwiru shawu shiwusiwa kala kulongolu kwawu, Mtuwa Mlungu kapamuhera na twenga, su namuwatira!” <verse eid="NUM 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 14:10" />Kumbiti shipinga shoseri shitakuliti kuusu kuwagumanga mabuwi. Palaa palii ukwisa wa Mtuwa Mlungu gulawiriti pa Liringu Linanagala, kulongolu kwa Waisraeli woseri.<verse eid="NUM 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Musa kankuwaluwira wantu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 14:11" />Shakapanu Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Musa, “Hashi wantu awa hawanzarawu mpaka ndii? Hashi mpaka ndii hawendereyi kujimira ndiri, ata pamuhera na mawuzawuza goseri ganuwatenderiti pakati pawu? <verse eid="NUM 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 14:12" />Hanuwakomangi kwa malweri madoda na kawagamiziya, kumbiti kulawirana na gwenga, hanikutendi gwenga Musa kuwera isi nkulu na yaiwera na makakala kuliku womberi.”<verse eid="NUM 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 14:13" />Kumbiti Musa kamgambiriti Mtuwa Mlungu, “Gwenga guwalaviyiti wantu awa muisi ya Misri kwa likakala lyaku. Wantu wa Misri pawapinira handa guwatendera hangu wantu waku, <verse eid="NUM 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 14:14" />Wantu wa Misri hawawagambiri wantu wa shiyiwuku sha Kanaani toziya gwenga gwee Mtuwa Mlungu, guwera pamuhera na twenga, gwee Mtuwa Mlungu guwonekinikiti paweru liwundi lyaku paligoloka panani petu, viraa gwenga gutulongolera paliwala kwa mpanda ya liwundi na pashiru kwa mpanda ya motu. <verse eid="NUM 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 14:15" />Su vinu paguwalaga wantu waku woseri kwa mala yimu, wantu wa isi zimonga zyazipikaniriti kala ujumbi waku hawalongi, <verse eid="NUM 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 14:16" />Mtuwa Mlungu kawalagiti wantu wakuyi kushiwala toziya kasinditi kuwajega kuisi yakalagiliriti kuwapanana. <verse eid="NUM 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 14:17" />Su vinu nikuluwa, gwee Mtuwa Mlungu, gutulanguziyi uwezu waku kwa kutenda ntambu yagutulagiliriti pagulongiti, <verse eid="NUM 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 14:18" />neni Mtuwa Mlungu wera ndiri na maya ga kalongola, neni wera na uheri uvuwa, viraa negeziya makontola pamuhera na makosa. Kumbiti kwantambu yoseri ilii hapeni ndeki kuwatoza wana na wazukulu mpaka shileli sha tatu na shamsheshi kwa vidoda vya walera wawu. <verse eid="NUM 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 14:19" />Nikuluwa guwalegiziyi wantu awa vidoda vyawu, ntambu yagwendereyiti kuwalegeziya kwanjira walawi muisi ya Misri mpaka vinu.”<verse eid="NUM 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 14:20" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamwankuliti, “Nuwalegeziya ntambu yaguluwiti. <verse eid="NUM 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 14:21" />Kumbiti nakaka weza ndiri kuhowa na ukwisa wangu ntambu yawendereya kumema pasipanu, <verse eid="NUM 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 14:22" />kwahera ata yumu gwawu ulii yakauwoniti ukwisa waneni pamuhera na mawuzawuza gangu nagutenditi Misri na kushiwala shakapanu kunjera mara zoseri azi pota kujimira liziwu lyangu. <verse eid="NUM 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 14:23" />Womberi hapeni kayiwoni isi ilii yanulagila kuwapanana wambuyi wawu, su ata walii yawanzarawu viraa hapeni waiwoni. <verse eid="NUM 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 14:24" />Kumbiti Karebu yakantendera neni weri kuliku na wamonga. Yomberi kanjimiriti neni nakamu. Su hanumjegi muisi ilii yakaiwoniti kala, shiyiwuku shakuwi hashihali isi ilii. <verse eid="NUM 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 14:25" />Toziya Waameleki na Wakanaani walikala mulilaranda lya isi ilii, shirawu mgalambuki kumbeli mgendi kushiwala kugenda bahari ya Shamu.” <verse eid="NUM 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 14:26" />Shakapanu Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Musa na Aruni, <verse eid="NUM 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 14:27" />“Shipinga ashi sha wantu yawatenditi vidoda hawendreyi kuhinginika mpaka ndii? Neni ntoka na mahinginiku ga Waisraeli kuusu neni! <verse eid="NUM 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 14:28" />Vinu guwawankuli hangu, ntambu yanilikala, nonga neni Mtuwa Mlungu, su hanuwatenderi galaa galii yanigapikaniriti pamugatakuliti. <verse eid="NUM 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 14:29" />Hamuhowi na nshimba zenu haziyaswi mlaamu kushiwala, toziya muhinginikira neni, kwahera ata yumu gwenu yakawera na umuli gwa kwanjira umuli gwa malongu mawili na kwengdereya, <verse eid="NUM 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 14:30" />yakagenda kwingira muisi ilii neni yanilagiliti kuwapanana iweri ya mwenga, kumbiti Karebu mwana gwa Yefune na Yoshuwa mwana gwa Nuni ndo hawingiri. <verse eid="NUM 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 14:31" />Mwenga mtakuliti kuwera wana wenu hawatoluwi kwa makakala, kumbiti neni haniwafikiziyi wana wenu muisi yamuilemiti, su waimani na iweri isi yawu. <verse eid="NUM 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 14:32" />Kumbiti mwenga hamuhowi mlaamu mushiwala! <verse eid="NUM 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 14:33" />Wana wenu hawayeriyeri na kutabika kushiwala kwa vinja malongu msheshi kwa gwenu gwa upeleru pakahowa kushiwala. <verse eid="NUM 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 14:34" />Kulawirana na vidoda vyenu, hamtabiki kwa vinja malongu msheshi, teratera na mashaka galii gamlolitiloliti weri isi ilii, shinja shimu kwa kila lishaka limu, mwenga hamuvimani kuwera neni nkalala na avi. <verse eid="NUM 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 14:35" />Neni Mtuwa Mlungu ntakula, nakaka hanuwatenderi hangu mwenga mwawoseri wamjojonika panu na kunema. Woseri hawapeli mlaamu kushiwala na amu hamuhowi.”<verse eid="NUM 14:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 14:36" />Wantu lilongu walii Musa yakawatumiti kugenda kuilolalola weri isi ilii wawuyiti na kuwatenda wantu wamuhinginikiri Mtuwa Mlungu kwa kujega visoweru vidoda vya isi ayi, <verse eid="NUM 14:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 14:37" />wantu walii yawalaviyiti visoweru vidoda kuusu isi ayi, wahowiti kwa likomangu kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="NUM 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 14:38" />Kumbiti Yoshuwa mwana gwa Nuni na Karebu mwana gwa Yefune, wasigaliti wakomu pakati pa walii yawagenditi kuilolalola weri isi ilii.<verse eid="NUM 14:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mpangu kwa kwanja kuikomanga isi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 14:39" />Musa pakawagambiriti Waisraeli woseri na womberi waliriti kwa utama uvuwa. <verse eid="NUM 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 14:40" />Shirawu yakuyi, womberi wimukiti mandawira putiputi, wagenditi semu za muvigongu, pawalonga, “Vinu tuwera kala kugenda pahala palii Mtuwa Mlungu kwakatulagiliti. Twenga tulonga kuwera tutenditi vidoda.”<verse eid="NUM 14:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 14:41" />Kumbiti Musa kalongiti, “Vinu iwera hashi mulilema lilagaliru lya Mtuwa Mlungu? Su hapeni mkanki! <verse eid="NUM 14:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 14:42" />Namgenda aku kuvigongu namwiza kukomanguwa na wangondu wenu, toziya Mtuwa Mlungu kawera ndiri pamuhera na mwenga. <verse eid="NUM 14:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 14:43" />Pamuwagendera Waameleki na Wakanaani, mwenga hamuhowi munkondu toziya mleka kumfata Mtuwa Mlungu, mweni hapeni kaweri pamuhera na mwenga.”<verse eid="NUM 14:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 14:44" />Pamuhera na aga, womberi wasisitiziti kugenda kulugongu, tembera Lisandiku lya Lipatanu lya Mtuwa Mlungu, kumbiti Musa kawukiti ndiri kukambi. <verse eid="NUM 14:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 14:45" />Ndo Waameleki na Wakanaani, yawalikaliti muisi ayi vigongu, su wasulukiti wawakomangiti na kuwakanka, wawawingiti mpaka kumji gwa Horima.<verse eid="NUM 14:45" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="NUM 15" />
  <para style="s">Malagaliru kuusu malaviwu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 15:1" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Musa, <verse eid="NUM 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 15:2" />guwagambiri Waisraeli kuwera pamsoka muisi yang'enda kuwapanana mulikali, <verse eid="NUM 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 15:3" />pamundavilira neni Mtuwa Mlungu tambiku kulawa mumifugu yenu, ama tambiku ya kulunguziwa nakamu ama tambiku, su muntu kalaviyi shilii shakalagiliti ama kulaviya tambiku ya ntambu yakafira mweni ama tambiku ya shaka sha msambu gwenu gwagutulitwi na kutenda ununkira uherepa wa kunherepeziya neni Mtuwa Mlungu, <verse eid="NUM 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 15:4" />su ulii yakalaviya tambiku yakuyi hakamjegeri viraa Mtuwa Mlungu tambiku ya viboga ya kilu yimu ya ubumu unama yawaukabangiti na kuhanganywa na lita yimu ya lipaki, <verse eid="NUM 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 15:5" />pamuhera na divayi ya tambiku ya shirandu lita yimu, vintu avi havilaviwi pamuhera na kila nkanyama gwa tambiku ya kulunguziwa nakamu. Kondolu ama mbuzi. <verse eid="NUM 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 15:6" />Shaka sha kulaviya tambiku ya kondolu gwa shipalu na kilu yimu ya ubumu yawaukabangitwi na lita yimu na nusu ya lipaki, vyoseri havilaviwi kuwera tambiku ya shiboga. <verse eid="NUM 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 15:7" />Viraa tambiku ya shirandu sha lita yimu na nusu ya divayi na kutenda ununkira uherepa gwa tambiku ya kumuherepeziya Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="NUM 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 15:8" />Pamumlavilira Mtuwa Mlungu, ng'ombi gwashipalu kwajili ya tambiku ya kulunguziwa ama tambiku ya kulaviya shilii shagulagiliti ama kwajili ya tambiku za ponga, <verse eid="NUM 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 15:9" />muntu hakamlaviyi kuwera tambiku pamuhera na tambiku ya viboga vya ubumu wa kilu tatu uherepa na lita mbili za lipaki. <verse eid="NUM 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 15:10" />Viraa pamuhera na tambiku ya shirandu lita mbili za divayi na kutenda ununkira uherepa wa tambiku ya kumuherepeziya Mtuwa Mlungu.<verse eid="NUM 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 15:11" />Kila mala muntu kalaviyi ng'ombi gwashipalu na kondolu gwashipalu na mwana gwa kondolu na mbuzi. <verse eid="NUM 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 15:12" />Walanga ya vintu avi haiyongerewi kulawirana na walanga ya wankanyama yawagenda kulaviwa. <verse eid="NUM 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 15:13" />Kila muntu yakawera mwenikaya gwa Israeli, kafiliziwa katendi vintu avi kwanjira ayi yomberi pakalaviya tambiku ya kulunguziwa nakamu, ununkira uherepa haumuherepeziyi Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="NUM 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 15:14" />Handa kwana muhenga yakalikala pamuhera na mwenga kwa shaka shoseri, pakafira kulaviya tambiku yakuyi ya kulunguziwa su iweri ununkira wa kumuherepeziya Mtuwa Mlungu, su muntu ayu katendi ntambu yamtenda mwenga. <verse eid="NUM 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 15:15" />Muviyiwuku vyoseri vyaviza, amuli zilaa zilii zyamuzitenda mwenga, yomberi hakazitendi muhenga yoseri yakalikala pamuhera na mwenga, kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu hamuweri teratera. <verse eid="NUM 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 15:16" />Mwenga pamuhera na yomberi hamuweri pasi pa mulilagaliru lilaa lilii limu na malagizu galaa galii.<verse eid="NUM 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 15:17" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Musa, <verse eid="NUM 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 15:18" />guwagambiri Waisraeli kuwera shaka pawawingira muisi yanuwajegani <verse eid="NUM 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 15:19" />kila pamuliya viboga vya isi ilii, hamtuli shyasi na kumpanana neni Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="NUM 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 15:20" />Pambanika mabumunda, libumunda lya kwanja lya shiboga shenu sha kwanja, halilaviwi kuwera tambiku kulawa pahala pa kukomera viboga. <verse eid="NUM 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 15:21" />Hamundaviliri neni Mtuwa Mlungu tambiku ayi ya gweka muviyiwuku vyenu vyoseri vyaviza.<verse eid="NUM 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 15:22" />Kumbiti pamleka kuzitenda amuli zoseri zilii neni Mtuwa Mlungu yaniwapananiti kupitira Musa, <verse eid="NUM 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 15:23" />handa mashaka gagiza wantu wafata ndiri goseri galii neni Mtuwa Mlungu numlagaliriti Musa, <verse eid="NUM 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 15:24" />su payiwera likosa ali litendeka pota kuvimana, shipinga sha wantu wavimaniti ndiri, shipinga shoseri hashilaviyi ng'ombi gwashipalu yumu yakakamala nentu ndiri kuwera tambiku ya kulunguziwa, ununkira uherepa wa kumuherepeziya Mtuwa Mlungu, pamuhera na tambiku yakuyi ya viboga na tambiku ya divayi kulawirana na malagizu yakuyi. <verse eid="NUM 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 15:25" />Mtambika hakawakolaniziyi mawoku kwajili ya wantu woseri wa Isreli, womberi hawalegeziwi toziya wavimaniti ndiri kuwera watenditi likosa, na womberi wajegiti tambiku ya kulunguziwa nakamu kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu kuwera tambiku ya kuwusiya vidoda kwajili ya likosa lyawu. <verse eid="NUM 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 15:26" />Waisraeli woseri pamuhera na wahenga yawalikala pakati pawu, hawalegeziwi toziya watenditi likosa ali.<verse eid="NUM 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 15:27" />Muntu yumu pakatenda vidoda pota kuvimana, yomberi hakamlaviyi mbuzi gwashidala gwa shinja shimu kuwera tambiku ya kuwusiya vidoda. <verse eid="NUM 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 15:28" />Mtambika hakamkolaniziyi mawoku kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu, toziya ya muntu ulii yakatenditi vidoda pota kuvimana, su hakalekeziwi. <verse eid="NUM 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 15:29" />Hamfati malagizu aga kwa kila muntu yakatenda vidoda pota kuvimana, kwa muntu Mwisraeli ama muhenga yakalikala pamuhera namwenga.<verse eid="NUM 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 15:30" />Kumbiti muntu yoseri yakatenda vidoda kwa kuvimana, kwa muntu mwenikaya ama muhenga, yomberi hakaweri kankumtendera lijonga Mtuwa Mlungu, su mpaka kalemuwi kulawa kwa wantu wakuyi. <verse eid="NUM 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 15:31" />Toziya kagalema galii Mtuwa Mlungu gakatakuliti na kulema limu lya amuli zyakwi. Muntu ayu hakalemuwi nakamu na kuhowa hakuweri kwakuyi mweni.<verse eid="NUM 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yakalijimira ndiri Lishaka lya Kwoyera hakahowi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 15:32" />Lishaka limu, Waisraeli pawaweriti kushiwala, wamwoniti muntu yumu pakasola mbawu Lishaka lya Kwoyera. <verse eid="NUM 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 15:33" />Su muntu ulii kajeguwa kulongolu kwa Musa na Aruni na wantu woseri. <verse eid="NUM 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 15:34" />Womberi wamtatiriti toziya iweriti wankali hawenitakuli ntambu yakumtenda muntu gwa ntambu ayi. <verse eid="NUM 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 15:35" />Su Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Musa, “Muntu ayu mpaka kalaguwi, wantu woseri hawamgumangi mabuwi kunja kwa kambi.” <verse eid="NUM 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 15:36" />Su wantu wamlaviyiti kunja kukambi, wamgumangiti mabuwi mpaka kahowa, gambira Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yakamlagaliriti Musa.<verse eid="NUM 15:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vifundu mulwiniku lwa nguwu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 15:37" />Shapakanu Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Musa. <verse eid="NUM 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 15:38" />“Guwagambiri wantu wa Israeli guwalagaliri walitenderi vifundu mulwiniku lya nguwu zawu, watuli wuzi wa buluu pashifundu. Guwagambiri watendi hangu muvileri vyawu vyoseri vyaviza. <verse eid="NUM 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 15:39" />Vifundu avi haviweri maholu kwa mwenga. Kila pamuviwona hamuziholi amuli zyangu zoseri na kuzijimira su namwiza kufata galii gamfiruwa na galii gamugawona kwa masu genu maweni. <verse eid="NUM 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 15:40" />Vifundu avi haviwaholuziyi amuli zyangu zoseri na hamuzifati na mwenga hamuweri wananagala wangu. <verse eid="NUM 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 15:41" />Neni ndo Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwenu yaniwalaviyiti kulawa muisi ya Misri su mwenga muweri wantu wangu. Neni ndo Mtuwa Mlungu gwenu.”<verse eid="NUM 15:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="NUM 16" />
  <para style="s">Kora na Datani na Abiramu walema kujimira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 16:1" />Shakapanu Kola mwana gwa Ishali, gwa lukolu lwa Kohati lyaulawiti mulikabila lya Walawi, wawatola wantu pamuhera na wantu watatu wa lukolu lwa Rubeni, womberi waweriti Datani na Abiramu wana wa Eliabu na Oni mwana gwa Peleti. <verse eid="NUM 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 16:2" />Woseri wajimilitwi na wakulu wamanikana miya mbili na malongu muhanu yawasyagulitwi na wantu woseri Waisraeli, womberi wamlemiti Musa. <verse eid="NUM 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 16:3" />Wajojonikiti kulongolu kwa Musa na Haruni wawagambira, “Mwenga mpita kuliku! Shipinga shoseri ndo shinanagala na kila muntu mushipinga ashi mnanagala, na Mtuwa Mlungu ka panu na twawoseri twenga. Iwera hashi vinu mwenga mulitenda mwawatuwa wa wantu woseri wa Mtuwa Mlungu?”<verse eid="NUM 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 16:4" />Musa pakapikiniriti aga kaliyasa pasi makukama. <verse eid="NUM 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 16:5" />Shakapanu kamgambira Kola na wantu yajimirana na yomberi, “Shilawu mandawira, Mtuwa Mlungu hakalanguziyi gaa ndo gwakuyi na gaa yakawera mnanagala, na yomberi hakamsyaguli hakamtendi kasegeleri pakutambikira. <verse eid="NUM 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 16:6" />Su mtendi hangu mandawira, gwenga pamuhera na wantu waku, hamtoli vyetezu vyakutumiziya ubani, <verse eid="NUM 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 16:7" />Mtuli makala ga motu mngati na kulekera ubani kumpindi kwakuyi, shakapanu hamvijegi kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu na hatuwoni gaa kasyagulitwi na Mtuwa Mlungu na mwenga Walawi mpita kuliku!” <verse eid="NUM 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 16:8" />Musa kendereya kumgambira Kola, “mpikinirani, mwenga wantu wa Walawi! <verse eid="NUM 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 16:9" />Hashi, mwona ndo shisoweru shididini kwa mwenga handa Mlungu gwa Israeli kawasyagula mwenga muwamu mwa shipinga sha Waisraeli, su muwezi kumsegelera, mtenderi muliliringu lya Mtuwa Mlungu na kuyitendera na kushitumikira shipinga shoseri? <verse eid="NUM 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 16:10" />Kawapanana ligoya lya kuwera pakwegera na yomberi, mwenga pamuhera na Walawi wayenu woseri. Vinu mfira kunyasula hata utambika? <verse eid="NUM 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 16:11" />Hangu mwenga na shikundi shaku mwankumkomanga Mtuwa Mlungu, mwenga mwangumlalamikira Aruni, kumbiti nanaka muwera mwankulalama kuusu Mlungu.”<verse eid="NUM 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 16:12" />Musa katumiti ujumbi kwa Datani na Abiramu wana wa Eliabu su washemuwi, kumbiti womberi walonga, “Hapeni twizi! <verse eid="NUM 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 16:13" />Hashi, ndo shisoweru shididini handa gutulaviya Misri, isi ya kuliyiziya mifugu na kulima, su gwizi kutulaga amu kushiwala? Kayi, gulitenda gwa mkulu gwetu! <verse eid="NUM 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 16:14" />Nentu ya aga, gutujega ndiri muisi yaifaa kuliyiziya mifugu na kulima, pota kutupanana uhala wa malambu na malambu ga mizabibu, gulihola haguwatendi wantu awa kuwera wanalwisi? Hapeni twizi!”<verse eid="NUM 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 16:15" />Musa kakalaliti nentu, kamgambira Mtuwa Mlungu “Naguzijimira tambiku za wantu awa. Neni hanenitoli punda gwa muntu yoseri, pota hanimtendi muntu!”<verse eid="NUM 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 16:16" />Musa kamgambiriti Kola, “Shirawu naguleka kwiza pamuhera na wandundami waku kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu. Aruni viraa hakaweri. <verse eid="NUM 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 16:17" />Kila yumu gwenu katola shetezu shakuwi, na kulekera ubani, shakapanu hakashijegi kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu, kwa jumla haviweri vyetezu miya mbili na malongu muhanu, kwa vyoseri haviweri miya mbili malongu mhanu, gwenga viraa na Aruni, kila yumu hakaweri na shetezu shakuwi.”<verse eid="NUM 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 16:18" />Su, kila yumu gwawu katola shetezu shakuwi, kalekera makala ga motu na ubani, shakapanu wagenda na kugoloka paligomi lya liringu lya kuliwona, pamuhera na Musa na Aruni. <verse eid="NUM 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 16:19" />Na Kola kawajojonira wantu woseri pamuhera, wagoloka kulongolu kwa Musa na Aruni weni waweriti paligomi lya liringu lya kuliwona. Ndo ukwisa wa Mtuwa Mlungu uwalawira wantu woseri! <verse eid="NUM 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 16:20" />Panu Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Musa na Aruni, <verse eid="NUM 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 16:21" />“Mlituli gweka na wantu awa, nuwalagi vinu hera.”<verse eid="NUM 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 16:22" />Kumbiti Musa na Aruni waliyasa pasi makukama na kulonga “Gwee Mtuwa Mlungu yaguwera shyanjiru sha ukomu kwa viumbi vyoseri. Hashi, muntu yumu pakakoseya, hagushikalaliri shipinga shoseri?”<verse eid="NUM 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 16:23" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Musa, <verse eid="NUM 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 16:24" />“Guwagambiri wantu wawuki pakwegera na pawalikala kuliringu lya Kola, Datani na Abiramu.” <verse eid="NUM 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 16:25" />Su, Musa kagenda kwa Datani na Abiramu, pawamfata wazewi wa Israeli. <verse eid="NUM 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 16:26" />Pakasokiti, kawagambira wantu, “Shondi muwuki mumaringu ga wantu awa wakondola namshinkula shintu shoseri, namwiza kulaguwa pamuhera nawomberi toziya ya vidoda vyawu vyoseri.” <verse eid="NUM 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 16:27" />Su wantu wawukiti mumalingu ga Kora na Datani na Abiramu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 16:27">Datani na Abiramu walawiti mumalingu gawu na wagolokiti paligomi pawawera na wadala wawu na wana wawu woseri ata walii yawaweriti wakonga. <verse eid="NUM 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 16:28" />Panu Musa kawagambira wantu, “Hangu ndo ntambu yamfira kuvimana handa Mtuwa Mlungu yakantumiti kuvitenda vitwatira vyoseri avi, pota kwafira namweni ndiri. <verse eid="NUM 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 16:29" />Wantu awa pawahowiti ntambu yawahowa wantu wamonga, ama pawapata matatizu handa wamonga, su mumani Mtuwa Mlungu kantuma ndiri. <verse eid="NUM 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 16:30" />Kumbiti Mtuwa Mlungu katenda shitwatira sha syayi, alizi igubutuka na kuwamira wantu awa pamuhera na kila shintu shawu, wagenda kuzimu pawawera wakomu, su hamuvimani kuwera wantu awa wamlemiti Mtuwa Mlungu.”<verse eid="NUM 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 16:31" />Katepu hera pakamaliliti kutakula visoweru vyoseri avi, alizi pasi pa Datani na Abiramu igubutuka <verse eid="NUM 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 16:32" />kuwamira wantu awa, walongu wau, pamuhera na wantundami woseri wa Kola na lunda zawu zoseri. <verse eid="NUM 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 16:33" />Su, womberi, pamuheri na vyoseri vyawaweriti navi, wasuluka kuzimu pawawera wakomu. Alizi iwagubikira woseri wagamilira. <verse eid="NUM 16:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 16:34" />Wantu woseri wamonga yawaweriti pakwegera pawapikiniriti kulila kwawu watira pawalonga, “Tutugi, alizi naiyiza kutumira na twenga viraa.”<verse eid="NUM 16:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 16:35" />Shakapanu Mtuwa Mlungu kajega motu kawalunguziya wantu walii mia mbili na malongu mhanu yawagenditi kutumiziya ubani Kuliringu Linanagala.<verse eid="NUM 16:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Shetezu za kutumiziya ubani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 16:36" />Pa aga Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambira Musa, <verse eid="NUM 16:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 16:37" />“Gumgambiri Eliezari mwana gwa mtambika Aruni kavilaviyi vyetezu avi pamotu, kagupalasiya kutali motu gwa guweriti mngati, toziya vyetezu avi ndo vinanagala. <verse eid="NUM 16:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 16:38" />Viwera vinanagala toziya wantu awa wavijegiti pakutambikira pa Mtuwa Mlungu su guvitoli vyetezu vya wantu awa yawalagitwi toziya ya vidoda vyawu wavipondi viweri vibabani su shiweri shifiniku sha pakutambikira. Ali haliweri liberiziwu kwa Wantu wa Israeli woseri.” <verse eid="NUM 16:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 16:39" />Su, Mtambika Eleazari kavitoliti vyetezu avi vya shaba vyeni wavijegiti kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu na wantu walii yawalaguwitwi waziponda kuwera shifiniku sha pakutambikira. <verse eid="NUM 16:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 16:40" />Ali liweriti likalipiru kwa Waisraeli kuwera muntu yoseri yakawera mtambika ndiri, yaani kaweriti gwa ukomu wa Aruni ndiri nakagenda pakutambika kumtumizilira Mtuwa Mlungu ubani. Hera hangu hakalagwi handa Kola na wantundami wakuyi. Goseri aga gatendekiti Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yakawagambiriti Eleazari kwa kupitira Musa.<verse eid="NUM 16:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Aruni kankuwalopuziya wantu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 16:41" />Shirawu yakuyi Waisraeli woseri wamlalamikira Musa na Aruni pawalonga, “Muwalaga wantu wa Mtuwa Mungu.” <verse eid="NUM 16:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 16:42" />Pawajojonikiti palongolu pa Musa na Aruni su kulaviya malalamiku gawu, wagalambikiti kulola liringu lya kuliwona, wawona handa liwundi ligibikira Liringu Linanagala na uweru wa Mtuwa Mlungu uweriti ulawira panu. <verse eid="NUM 16:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 16:43" />Musa na Aruni wagenditi, kugoloka kulongolu Kuliringu Linanagala lya kuliwona. <verse eid="NUM 16:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 16:44" />Na Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Musa, <verse eid="NUM 16:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 16:45" />“Gulituli gweka na wantu awa, nuwalagi mala yimu!” Kumbiti womberi waliyasa pasi makukama. <verse eid="NUM 16:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 16:46" />Musa kamgambira Aruni, “Gutoli shetezu shaku, gushilekiri motu na kushitula pabwega pakutambikira, gushilekeri ubani shakapanu gugendi nashu kalongola kwa wantu na kuwatendera ukolaniziwu mawoku. Gutendi kalongola! Maya ga Mtuwa Mlungu gawafikira kala na likomangu lyanja kuwakomanga.” <verse eid="NUM 16:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 16:47" />Su, Aruni katenda ntambu yakagambiritwi na Musa. Katoliti shetezu shakuwi na kutuga mpaka pakati pa wantu yawaweriti wajojonika pamuhera. Pakawoniti handa komangu lyakwanja kala, kalekera ubani mushetezu na kuwatendera wantu ukolaniziwu. <verse eid="NUM 16:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 16:48" />Pakatenditi hangu, likomangu lilii liyoya, na yomberi kasigala pakati pa yawahowiti na yawaweriti wakomu. <verse eid="NUM 16:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 16:49" />Wantu woseri yawahowiti kwa likomangu waweriti elufu lilongu na msheshi na miya saba, pota kuwalanga walii yawahowiti kulawirana na ukondola wa Kora. <verse eid="NUM 16:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 16:50" />Likomangu paliyoyiti, Aruni kawuyiti kwa Musa kuligomi lya Liringu Linanagala.<verse eid="NUM 16:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="NUM 17" />
  <para style="s">Luhonga lwa Aruni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 17:1" />Shakapanu Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Musa. <verse eid="NUM 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 17:2" />“Guwagambiri Waisraeli wakujegeri luhonga lilongu na mbili, kila mkulu gwa likabila kajegi luhonga lumu. Gulilembi litawu lya kila muntu muluhonga lwakuyi. <verse eid="NUM 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 17:3" />Na litawu lya Aruni gulilembi paluhonga lwa likabila lya Lawi. Hapaweri na luhonga lumu kwa kila mkulu gwa likabila. <verse eid="NUM 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 17:4" />Guzitoli luhonga azi Muliringu Linanagala na kuzitula kulongolu kwa Lisanduku lya Lipatanu, pahala palii panuliwona na gwenga. <verse eid="NUM 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 17:5" />Luhonga lwa muntu yang'enda kumsyagula haimeri. Kwanjira ayi hanugamalili mahinginiku ga Waisraeli kwa mwenga.”<verse eid="NUM 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 17:6" />Musa kayoweriti na wantu wa Israeli. Wakulu wawu woseri wampananiti kila yumu luhonga lwakuyi kulawirana na likabila lyakuyi, walanga yoseri ziweriti luhonga lilongu na mbili. Luhonga lwa Aruni lutulituwiti pamuhera na honga zilii. <verse eid="NUM 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 17:7" />Musa kazituliti honga zilii zoseri kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu Muliringu Linanagala.<verse eid="NUM 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 17:8" />Shirawu yaifatiti mandawira, Musa kagenditi Muliringu Linanagala. Mlii kawoniti luhonga lwa Aruni gwa likabila lya Lawi, imera na kumeriziya vimeru vyavilaviyiti uluwa na kulera mabwajubwaju yagawula yagashemuwa mlozi. <verse eid="NUM 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 17:9" />Shakapanu Musa kavilaviyiti honga zoseri kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu, kawalanguziyiti Waisraeli woseri, na kila mkulu katoliti luhonga lwakuyi. <verse eid="NUM 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 17:10" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Musa, “Guluwuziyi luhonga lwa Aruni kulongolu kwa Lisanduku lya Lipatanu. Alu haluloleruwi weri pahala palii, na liberiziwu kwa woseri yawanema na pawaleka ndiri kuhinginika, hawahowi.” <verse eid="NUM 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 17:11" />Musa katenditi gambira Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yakamlagaliriti.<verse eid="NUM 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 17:12" />Waisraeli wamgambiriti Musa, “Guloli vinu! Twankulaguwa! Tupera twoseri! <verse eid="NUM 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 17:13" />Kila muntu pakasegelera Liringu Linanagala hakahowi. Hashi, hatuhowi twoseri?”<verse eid="NUM 17:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="NUM 18" />
  <para style="s">Mahengu ga Watambika na Walawi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 18:1" />Su Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Aruni, “Paiwera likosa litenduwa na muntu gwa likabila lya Lawi Kuliringu Linanagala, likosa ali haliweri kwaku gamweni na kwa wana waku na wantu wa likabila lyaku. Viraa virii makosa aga pagatendeka mumahengu ga utambika waku, gamweni pamuhera na wana waku hamtozuwi. <verse eid="NUM 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 18:2" />Gwenga na wana waku na walongu waku, hawatendi mahengu gambira watambika, walongu waku wamonga wa likabila lyaku hawatendi mahengu pamuhera na gwenga kulongolu kwa Liringu Linanagala. <verse eid="NUM 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 18:3" />Womberi hawatendi mahengu gwaguwapanana na kutenda utenderu wau Kuliringu Linanagala. Kumbiti wahera ulekeziwu wa kuvishinkura vyombu vya Liringu Linanagala, nawiza kuhowa na gwenga haguhowi viraa. <verse eid="NUM 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 18:4" />Womberi hawaweri pamuhera na gwenga mumahengu na kutenda utenderu wawu kuusu mahengu goseri ga Liringu Linanagala na kuwera na muntu gwingi nakakusegelera pagutenda lihengu lya utambika. <verse eid="NUM 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 18:5" />Mwenga hamtendi mahengu ga Liringu Linanagala pamuhera na pashitalawanda sha kutambikira, su maya gangu nagiza kuwalawila kayi Waisraeli. <verse eid="NUM 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 18:6" />Ndo neni yanuwasyaguliti walongu wenu wa likabila lya Lawi pakati pa Waisraeli kuwera laviwu kwa mwenga. Womberi watuluwa gweka kwajili yaneni Mtuwa Mlungu, su watendi mahengu Muliringu Linanagala. <verse eid="NUM 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 18:7" />Kumbiti gwenga gweka yaku na wana waku hamtendi mahengu goseri ga utambika kwajili ya shitalawanda sha kutambikira na vyoseri vyaviweramu Mupahala Pananagala Nentu. Aga ndo mahengu genu, toziya niwapanani lifupu lya utambika. Muntu yoseri yakawera ndiri mtambika, pakavisegelera vyombu vya Liringu Linanagala, hakalagwi.”<verse eid="NUM 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lifungu lya watambika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 18:8" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Aruni, “Nankupanana malaviwu yampanitwi na Waisraeli, vintu vyoseri vinanagala vyawampanitwi neni. Vintu vyoseri vyavityekuwitwi na Waisraeli. Nankupanana vintu vyoseri gwenga na shileri shaku kuwera lifungu lyamwenga, ali hampananwi mwenga mashaka goseri. <verse eid="NUM 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 18:9" />Pakati pa vintu vinanagala nakamu, virii vyavigenda kulunguziwa nakamu mumotu, avi haviweri vyamwenga. Tambiku za viboga na tambiku za kuwusiya vidoda na tambiku za kuwakolaniziya mawoku. Kila shintu wantu shawagenda kundavilira kuwera tambiku nanagala hashiweri shagwenga na wana waku. <verse eid="NUM 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 18:10" />Hamuviliyi vintu avi gambira vintu vinanagala nentu Mupahala Pananagala na wapalu hera ndo yawaviliya, vintu avi ndo vinanagala kwa mwenga.”<verse eid="NUM 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 18:11" />“Viraa vintu vyamonga vyoseri vyawagenda kundavilira Waisraeli kuwera tambiku za kunyasulwa, haviweri vyagwenga. Nikupanana gwenga na wana wapalu waku na wahinja waku kuwera lifungu lya mwenga mashaka goseri. Muntu yoseri muwalongu waku yakawera ndiri muhumba kaweza kuviliya vintu avi.”<verse eid="NUM 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 18:12" />“Nikupanana vintu vyoseri viherepa vyavilawirana na viboga vya kwanja kukamala virii Waisraeli vyawandavilira, lipaki liherepa lya mizyetuni na divayi pamuhera na mbunji. <verse eid="NUM 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 18:13" />Viboga vyoseri vya kwanja vya mabwajubwaju yagakama mumalambu gawu, galii gawanjegera neni, hagaweri ga gwenga. Kila muntu yakawera ndiri muhumba muwalongu waku, su kawea kuliya.”<verse eid="NUM 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 18:14" />“Kila shintu shashityekuwitwi muisi ya Israeli hashiweri shamwenga.”<verse eid="NUM 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 18:15" />“Kila shipanta njira ulii Waisraeli yawagenda kundavilira, pashiwera shipanta njira sha muntu ama nkanyama, hashiweri shaku. Kumbiti gufiruwa guwakomboli wapanta njira woseri wa wantu na kila shipanta njira sha nkanyama yakawera muhumba mpaka kakombolowi. <verse eid="NUM 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 18:16" />Wapanta njira hawakombolowi pawawera na umuli wa mwezi gumu kwa kulipiwa vipandi muhanu vya madini ga feza, kulawirana na vipimu vyavitulitwi Muliringu Linanagala. <verse eid="NUM 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 18:17" />Kumbiti wapanta njira wa wankanyama wa wang'ombi na kondolu ama wambuzi nawakombolewa. Awa ndo wananagala. Mwazi gwawu hagushimishiri shitalawanda sha kutambikira na lipaki lyawu hagulilunguziyi nakamu kuwera tambiku ya kulunguziwa nakamu kuwera na ununkira uherepa yaguherepeziya neni Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="NUM 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 18:18" />Vinofu vyawu guweza kuviliya vyavilaviwa, handa vidari na ligulu lya kumbeli lya kumliwu vyavilaviwa kuwera tambiku ya kunyasuluwa.”<verse eid="NUM 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 18:19" />“Nikupanana gwenga, wana waku wapalu na wahinja waku, vintu vyoseri virii wantu wa Israeli vyawagenda kundavilira, avi ndo lifungu lya mwenga mashaka goseri. Ali ndo lipatanu lya mashaka goseri kulongolu kwa neni, lilii liwera kwajili yaku na shileri shaku.”<verse eid="NUM 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 18:20" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Aruni, “Gwenga hapeni guweri na uhala woseri muisi yawu, ama lifungu lyaku pakati pawu, neni ndo lifungu lyaku na hanikupanani shilii shagufira pakati pa Waisraeli.”<verse eid="NUM 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lifungu lya wantu wa likabila lya Lawi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 18:21" />“Niwapanani lifungu lya lilongu wantu wa likabila lya Lawi, lifungu lilii lyoseri Waisraeli yawagenda kundavilira kuwera uhala wawu. Aga hagaweri malipu gawu kwa mahengu gawatenda mukulolera weri Liringu Linanagala. <verse eid="NUM 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 18:22" />Kwanjira vinu, wantu wamonga wa Israeli nawasegelera Liringu Linanagala, nawiza kuwoneka watenda vidoda na kuhowa. <verse eid="NUM 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 18:23" />Kumbiti wantu wa likabila lya Lawi gweka yawu, weni hawatendi mahengu Muliringu Linanagala, na hawazibiwi handa shintu shoseri shidoda pashilawira Muliringu lilii. Ali liwera lagaliru lya mashaka goseri muvileri vyamwenga vyoseri. Wantu wa likabila lya Lawi hapeni waweri na ulunda wa kuhala muisi ya Israeli, <verse eid="NUM 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 18:24" />toziya lifungu lya lilongu lyawandavilira Waisraeli, niwapanani kuwera lyawu. Ndo mana ntakula kuwera womberi hapeni wahali pakati pa Waisraeli.”<verse eid="NUM 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zaka za Walawi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 18:25" />Shakapanu Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Musa, <verse eid="NUM 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 18:26" />Kayi haguwagambiri wantu wa likabila lya Lawi malagizu aga. “Shaka pamuliwanka lifungu lya lilongu lilii Mtuwa Mlungu lyakawapananiti kulawa kwa Waisraeli liweri lyamwenga, mwenga hamundaviliri neni Mtuwa Mlungu semu yimu ya lilongu lya lifungu ali. <verse eid="NUM 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 18:27" />Tambiku ayi yamwenga haijimiruwi kuwera handa malimbuku ga viboga ama handa zyabibu zyakandavilira mlimi. <verse eid="NUM 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 18:28" />Su hangu ndo vyamgenda kundavilira neni Mtuwa Mlungu tambiku za lifungu lya lilongu lyamgenda kuwanka kulawa kwa Waisraeli. Lifungu lya lilongu lyamgenda kundalivira neni Mtuwa Mlungu, hamumpanani mtambika Aruni. <verse eid="NUM 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 18:29" />Kulawirana na malaviwu goseri gamgenda kuwanka, mwenga hamundaviliri neni Mtuwa Mlungu lifungu lya lilongu lya semu iherepa nentu kuliku zoseri na nanagala. <verse eid="NUM 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 18:30" />Su gwenga haguwagambiri, pamundavilira kala semu iherepa nentu kuliku zoseri, semu yaisigala hayiweri ya mwenga, ntambu yaiwera kwa mlimi ulii yakatola shashisigaliti pa kulaviya tambiku zakuyi za mabenu ga kwanja kukamala ga viboga na zyabibu. <verse eid="NUM 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 18:31" />Na mwenga hamliyi shashilaviliwitwi pamuhera pahala poseri palii pamuhera na walongu wenu mana ashi shiwera shibenamgongu shenu toziya ya utenderu wenu Muliringu Linanagala. <verse eid="NUM 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 18:32" />Hapeni muweri na likosa lyoseri pamuliya vintu avi, payiwera mumlavilira Mtuwa Mlungu semu iherepa nentu kuliku zoseri, mwenga hapeni muvihigilangi vintu vinanagala vya Waisraeli na kuhowa.”<verse eid="NUM 18:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="NUM 19" />
  <para style="s">Livu lya ng'ombi msheri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 19:1" />Mtuwa Mlungu kendereyiti kuwagambira Musa na Aruni, <verse eid="NUM 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 19:2" />“Aga ndo malagizu ga Malagaliru galii neni Mtuwa Mlungu nugalaviya. Guwagambiri Waisraeli wawajegeri ng'ombi gwashidala msheri yakahera dosari na hakenitendi mahengu ga kulima. <verse eid="NUM 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 19:3" />Mwenga hamumpanani mtambika Eleazari ng'ombi ayu. Hakalaviwi kunja ya kambi na kulikituluwa kulongolu kwa mtambika ayu. <verse eid="NUM 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 19:4" />Shakapanu mtambika Eleazari hakatoli shyasi sha mwazi na kugumishira kwa shyala shakuwi mala saba, kugendera uwega wa kulungolu kwa Liringu Linanagala. <verse eid="NUM 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 19:5" />Ng'ombi yoseri ayu hakalunguziwi nakamu kwa motu kulongolu kwa mtambika. Kila shintu hashilunguziwi nakamu, lukuli na vinofu na mwazi na utumbu wakuyi. <verse eid="NUM 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 19:6" />Shakapanu mtambika hakatoli lubiki lwa mwelezi na shimeru sha hisopu na ubunta msheri na kuvilekera mumotu agu. <verse eid="NUM 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 19:7" />Pa aga, mtambika hakazigululi nguwu zakuwi na kwoga mashi, shakapanu kaweza kwingira kukambi. Yomberi hakaweri muhumba mpaka pamihi. <verse eid="NUM 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 19:8" />Muntu yakamlunguziya ng'ombi ulii viraa hakazigululi nguwu zakuyi na kwoga mashi, kumbiti nayomberi hakaweri muhumba mpaka pamihi. <verse eid="NUM 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 19:9" />Muntu yakawera muherepa hakagajoli livu lya ng'ombi ulii na kugajega pahala paherepa kunja kukambi. Livu lilii halituluwi weri na kutendwa na wantu woseri wa Israeli kuhanganyiya mumashi gaweri mashi ga kuwusiya uhumba, su gawusiyi vidoda. <verse eid="NUM 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 19:10" />Muntu yakagenda kujola livu lya ng'ombi ulii, yomberi hakazigululi nguwu zakuyi, kumbiti hakaweri muhumba mpaka pamihi. Lilagaliru ali haliweri lya mashaka goseri na haliweri lya Waisraeli na wantu wamonga yawagenda kulikala pamuhera nawu.<verse eid="NUM 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malagaliru kuusu kupunguwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 19:11" />Muntu pakashinkula mtugulu gwa muntu yoseri, hakaweri muhumba kwa mashaka saba. <verse eid="NUM 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 19:12" />Lishaka lya tatu na lya saba muntu ayu hakaligululi kwa mashi galii ga kupunga, su hakaweri muherepa. Kumbiti pakaleka kulipunga mulishaka lya tatu na lya saba, muntu ayu hakasigali kuwera muhumba. <verse eid="NUM 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 19:13" />Muntu yakashinkula mitugulu, pakalipunga ndiri, yomberi hakalituli uhumba Liringu Linanagala lya Mtuwa Mlungu, su yomberi hakatulwi gweka kulawa kwa wantu wa Israeli. Muntu ayu hakasigali muhumba toziya kamishiritwi ndiri mashi galii ga kupunga.<verse eid="NUM 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 19:14" />Na lilagaliru ali haliweri handa muntu pakahowa muliringu lyakuyi. Kila muntu yakingira muliringu ali ama ulii yakawera Muliringu ali, hakaweri muhumba kwa mashaka saba. <verse eid="NUM 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 19:15" />Kila shombu shashigubikitwi ndiri shahera shifiku pampindi pakuwi hashiweri shihumba. <verse eid="NUM 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 19:16" />Muntu yoseri yakashinkula mtuguli gwa muntu yakalaguwa ama yakahowiti gambira wantu wamonga kunja kwa numba ama pakashinkula shifupa sha muntu ama pakashinkula lipumba, yomberi hakaweri muhumba kwa mashaka saba.<verse eid="NUM 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 19:17" />Kwajili ya walii yawalituliti uhumba, hawatoli livu lya tambiku ya kuwusiya vidoda yayilunguziwitwi nakamu, livu ali halihanganyiwitwi mushiwiga pamuhera na mashi yagatekitwi kulushemba. <verse eid="NUM 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 19:18" />Muntu yakawera muherepa hakatoli mtera gwa hisopo, hakagushiwiki mumashi galii, shakapanu hakalimishiri Liringu pamuhera na kila shintu shashiweramu na wantu yawaweriti mlaa. Viraa hakamumishiri muntu yakashinkuliti shifupa sha muntu yakahowiti ama mtugulu gwa muntu yakalaguwa ama muntu yakahowiti gambira wantu wamonga ntambu yawahowa ama muntu yakashinkula lipumba. <verse eid="NUM 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 19:19" />Mulishaka lya tatu na lya saba, muntu yakawera muherepa hakamumishiri muntu yakawera muhumba mashi galii. Ayi hayiweri lishaka lya saba, yomberi hakazigululi nguwu zakuyi na kwoga mashi na pamihi hakaweri muherepa.<verse eid="NUM 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 19:20" />Kumbiti muntu pakawera muhumba pakalipunga ndiri, muntu ayu hakatuluwi gweka kulawa kwa wantu wakuyi, toziya kankulitula uhumba Liringu Linanagala lya Mtuwa Mlungu. Toziya yomberi kamishilitwi ndiri mashi galii gakupunga, su kawera muhumba. <verse eid="NUM 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 19:21" />Wantu hawalijimiri lilagaliru ali mashaka goseri. Muntu yakamishira mashi ga kupunga, hakagululi nguwu zakuyi na ulii yakashinkula mashi galii ga muhumba, yomberi hakaweri muhumba mpaka pamihi. <verse eid="NUM 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 19:22" />Shoseri shakashinkula muntu muhumba, shintu ashi hashiweri shihumba, na yoseri ulii yakakishinkula shintu shilii, yomberi hakaweri muhumba mpaka pamihi.”<verse eid="NUM 19:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="NUM 20" />
  <para style="s">Vitwatira vyavilawiriti Kadeshi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="EXO 17:1-7">Kulawa 17:1-7</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 20:1" />Shipinga shoseri sha Waisraeli wasokiti kushiwala sha Sini mumwezi gwa kwanja, wabawiriti malingu gawu aku Kadeshi. Pawawera aku, Miriamu kahowiti na kafindirwa.<verse eid="NUM 20:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 20:2" />Pahala palii pawabawiriti malingu gawu paweriti ndiri na mashi. Su wantu woseri wawawiziriti Musa na Aruni pota kushemuwa. <verse eid="NUM 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 20:3" />Womberi wawahinginikiti woseri pawalonga, “Mbaka metuhowi pamuhera na walongu wetu kulongolu kwa Liringu Linanagala lya Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="NUM 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 20:4" />Iwera hashi mutujegiti sisi wantu wa Mtuwa Mlungu kushiwala uganu? Hashi mtujegiti su tuhowi pamuhera na mifugu yetu? <verse eid="NUM 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 20:5" />Iwera hashi mutulaviyiti Misri na kutujega pahala panu papafaa ndiri? Panu kwahera viboga ama tini ama zyabibu ama makomamanga. Ata mashi ga kulanda kwahera!” <verse eid="NUM 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 20:6" />Palii Musa na Aruni wawukiti pakati pa lipinga lya wantu, wagenditi kugoloka paligomi lya Liringu Linanagala, wasuntamiti makukama. Su uweru wa Mtuwa Mlungu guwalawiriti, <verse eid="NUM 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 20:7" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Musa, <verse eid="NUM 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 20:8" />“Gutoli luhonga lwaku lwalutulwa kulongolu kwa Lisanduku lya Lipatanu, shakapanu gwenga pamuhera na Aruni mlongu gwaku, mushijojoniri shipinga shoseri sha wantu. Shakapanu pawalola guwagambiri litalawu lyaliwera kulongolu kwawu gulaviyi mashi. Gwenga hagulutendi litalawu lilaviyi mashi, su shipinga shoseri sha wantu pamuhera na mifugu yawu wawezi kulanda mashi.” <verse eid="NUM 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 20:9" />Musa kagenditi kulutola luhonga lulii kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yakalagaliritwi.<verse eid="NUM 20:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 20:10" />Shakapanu Musa na Aruni kalijojoniriti lipinga lyoseri lya wantu kulongolu kwa litalawu, Musa kawagambiriti, “Mpikaniri vinu mwenga yamumlema Mlungu. Hashi twenga tuwalaviliri mashi kulawa mulitalawu ali?” <verse eid="NUM 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 20:11" />Sahakapanu Musa kanyasuliti liwoku lyakuyi, kalukomiti litalawu mala mbili kwa luhonga lwakuyi. Mashi gavuwa gabwituliti nentu, wantu walanditi weni pamuhera na mifugu yawu.<verse eid="NUM 20:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 20:12" />Kumbiti Mtuwa Mlungu kawagambiriti Musa na Aruni, “Toziya mwenga munjimira ndiri neni, ama kunshera neni kulongolu kwa masu ga Waisraeli, kwa toziya ayi hapeni mushiyingiziyi shipinga ashi sha wantu muisi ilii yaniwalagiliti.” <verse eid="NUM 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 20:13" />Pa aga pahala palii pashemuwiti Meriba, litawu ali liwera na mana Mahinginiku, toziya palii Waisraeli wamuhinginikiti Mtuwa Mlungu, na palii Mlungu kalanguziyiti makakala gakuyi kwa womberi kwa kuwapanana mashi.<verse eid="NUM 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mfalumi gwa Edomu kankuwalewelera Waisraeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 20:14" />Musa kawatumiti wajumbi kulawa Kadeshi kwawabawiriti malingu gawu kugenda kwa mfalumi gwa Edomu pawawera na ujumbi, “Mlongu gwaku Israeli kalonga hangu, kamgambira, mlongu gwaku, Israeli kalonga, Israeli kalonga hangu gwenga gukumana ntabika kwa twenga zatupatiti. <verse eid="NUM 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 20:15" />Wambuyi wetu yawagenditi Misri, kweni tulikaliti kwa shaka shivuwa na Wamisri ntambu yawawatabisiyiti wambuyi wetu, watutabisiya na twenga. <verse eid="NUM 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 20:16" />Na tumliliriti Mtuwa Mlungu, na yomberi kakupikinira kulira kwa twenga, katujegera ntumintumi gwakuyi yakatuwusiyiti Misri. Vinu twapanu Kadeshi, mji gwagupakana na isi yaku. <verse eid="NUM 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 20:17" />Shondi gutululeziyi tupiti muisi yaku, hapeni tutimbangi malambu genu, pota galii ga mizyabibu, pota hapeni tulandi mashi ga manegu gunu, hatufati njira nkulu ya mfalumi na kugenda moja kwa moja pota kugalambuka kumliwu ama kumshigi, mpaka patulawa Muisi yaku.”<verse eid="NUM 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 20:18" />Kumbiti mfalumi gwa Edomu kamwankula, “Ndala hapeni gupiti muisi ya neni, handa pagupita handawi na kukukomanga ngondu.”<verse eid="NUM 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 20:19" />Waisraeli wamgambira, “Twenga hatufati njira nkulu, handa twenga pauhera na mifugu yetu patulanda mashi genu hatulipi. Shatuluwa shondi gutulekiziyi hera, tupiti muisi yaku. Twenga tufira ndiri shisoweru shamonga.” <verse eid="NUM 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 20:20" />Kumbiti mfalumi gwa Edomu kongeriti kulonga, “Hapeni tuwalekeziyi mpiti muisi yetu.” Kamkamu Waedomu yawawera na makakala walawiti kulikomanga nawu. <verse eid="NUM 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 20:21" />Toziya mfalumi gwa Edomu kawajimiriti ndiri Waisraeli kupita muisi yakuyi, su Waisraeli wagenditi mwanja kupita njira yingi.<verse eid="NUM 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuhowa kwa Aruni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 20:22" />Waisraeli woseri wagenditi mwanja kulawa Kadeshi, wasokiti Kulugongu Hori. <verse eid="NUM 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 20:23" />Su Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Musa na Aruni aku Kulugongu Hori, mumbaka mwa isi ya Edomu, <verse eid="NUM 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 20:24" />“Aruni hakahowi, hapeni kingiri muisi ilii yamuwalagiliti kuwapanana Waisraeli toziya mwenga wawili mgalemiti malagaliru gangu kuusu mashi ga Meriba. <verse eid="NUM 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 20:25" />Vinu gumtoli Aruni pamuhera na Eleazari mwana mpalu gwakuyi kugenda Kulugongu Hori. <verse eid="NUM 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 20:26" />Shakapanu gumvuli Aruni mahabiti gakuyi na gumvalisiyi Eleazari mwana gwakuyi. Aruni hakahowi pakawera aku kulugongu.” <verse eid="NUM 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 20:27" />Musa katenditi gambira Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yakamlagaliriti. Woseri watatu wakweniti kugenda kulugongu uganu shipinga shoseri sha wantu pawawalola. <verse eid="NUM 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 20:28" />Shakapanu Musa kamvuliti Aruni mahabiti gakuyi ga utambika na kumvalisiya Eleazari mwana gwakuyi. Na Aruni kahowiti kulaa kulugongu. Shakapanu Musa pamuhera na Eleazari waseleriti kulawa kulugongu, <verse eid="NUM 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 20:29" />Shipinga shoseri sha wantu pashiyambuliti kuwera Aruni kahowiti, Waisraeli woseri wadayiti kwajili ya yomberi kwa mashaka matatu.<verse eid="NUM 20:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="NUM 21" />
  <para style="s">Waisraeli wawakanka Wakanaani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 21:1" />Mfalumi yumu gwa Kanaani aku Aradi yakalikaliti aku uwega wa kusika mwa Kanaani, pakapatiti visoweru kuwera Waisraeli waweriti wankwiza kupitira njira ya Atiharimu, yomberi kagenditi kulikomanga ngondu na womberi, kawabatiti kwa makakala wamu wawu. <verse eid="NUM 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 21:2" />Su Waisraeli wamlapiriti Mtuwa Mlungu kwa shirapu pawalonga, “Handa pagututanga kuwakoma, su twenga hatuyagamiziyi nakamu miji yawu kwajili yaku.” <verse eid="NUM 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 21:3" />Mtuwa Mlungu kapikaniriti kuluwa kwawu, kawapanana ukanka kwa Wakanaani, Waisraeli wawalagiti nakamu Wakanaani pamuhera na kaya zawu, su pahala palii wapashema Horima.<verse eid="NUM 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Njoka gwa Shaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 21:4" />Waisraeli wagenditi mwanja kulawa lugongu Horima, wapitiriti njira yaigendera kulola kubahari ya Shamu su wayizyengeti isi ya Edomu. Kumbiti pawaweriti munjira wantu wafuwiti moyu toziya ya mwanja gutali. <verse eid="NUM 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 21:5" />Su wanjiti kumuhinginikiya Mlungu pamuhera na Musa, walongiti, “Hashi, kwantambu gaa gutulaviyiti Misri twizi tuhowi panu kushiwala? Panu kwahera shiboga ama mashi, twenga tutoka kuliya shiboga ashi shidoda.!” <verse eid="NUM 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 21:6" />Su Mtuwa Mlungu kajegiti wanjoka yawawera na usungu pakati pa wantu, wawalumiti na Waisraeli wavuwa wahowiti. <verse eid="NUM 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 21:7" />Su wantu wamgenderiti Musa na kumgambira, “Twenga tutenda vidoda kwa kumuhinginikiya Mtuwa Mlungu pamuhera na gwenga viraa. Gumluwi Mtuwa Mlungu katuwusiliri wanjoka awa.” Musa kawaluwiriti kwa Mlungu wantu walii. <verse eid="NUM 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 21:8" />“Shakapanu Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Musa, gunyawi njoka kwa madini ga shaba, gumtuli palupanda. Muntu yoseri yakalumuwa na njoka, pakamlola njoka ayu yakanyawitwi kwa madini ga shaba, hakaponi.” <verse eid="NUM 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 21:9" />Su Musa kanyawiti njoka kwa madini ga shaba, kamtuliti palipanda. Kila muntu yakalumitwi na njoka, pakamoliti njoka ulii gwa shaba, kaponiti.<verse eid="NUM 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mwanja kugenda lularanda lwa wantu wa Mowabu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 21:10" />Waisraeli wendereyiti na mwanja gwawu, shakapanu wabawiriti malingu gawu aku Obotihi. <verse eid="NUM 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 21:11" />Kulawa aku womberi wagenditi mwanja mpaka Iyeabarimu, mushiwala sha uwega wa kwagulawa mshenji Mumowabu. <verse eid="NUM 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 21:12" />Kulawa aku Mowabu wagenditi mwanja na wabawiriti malingu gawu mulilaranda lya Zeredi. <verse eid="NUM 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 21:13" />Kulawa aku Zeredi wagenditi mwanja na wabawiriti malingu gawu kushana mwa lushemba Arinoni, lushemba lulii lwalunyinyirisha mashi kulawa muisi ya wantu wa Amori na kupitira kushiwala. Lushemba lwa Arinoni luweriti mbaka ya wantu wa Mowabu na wantu wa Amori.<verse eid="NUM 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 21:14" />Kwa toziya ayi ilembituwi mushintola sha kulikoma ngondu za Mtuwa Mlungu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:14">“Mji gwa Wahebu muisi Sufa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:14">na lularanda lwa Arinoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:14">lwalusoka mpaka mji gwa Ari,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:14">na kulola uwega mumbaka mwa Mowabu!<verse eid="NUM 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 21:15" />Na luseleru lwa lushi lwalusoka mpaka mji gwa Ari. Ari na kugenda mumbaka mwa Mowabu.”<verse eid="NUM 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 21:16" />Kulawa aku Waisraeli wagenditi mwanja mpaka Beeri, yaani linegu palii Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Musa, “Guwajojoniri wantu pamuhera, neni haniwapanani mashi.” <verse eid="NUM 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 21:17" />Palii Waisraeli wimbiti lwimbu alu:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:17">“Gubwituli mashi gwee linegu! Mulilimbili lwimbu linegu alu!<verse eid="NUM 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 21:18" />Linegu lyalibawitwi na wakulu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:18">lwalibawitwi nentu na yawawera na ukulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:18">kwa honga zawu za ukolamlima</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:18">na honga za wakulu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 21:18">Kulawa kushiwala womberi wagenditi mwanja mpaka Matana, <verse eid="NUM 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 21:19" />kulawa Matana wagenditi mwanja mpaka Nahalieli, kulawa Nahalieli wagenditi mwanja mpaka Bamoti. <verse eid="NUM 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 21:20" />Na kulawa Bamoti wagenditi mwanja mpaka palularanda lyalingira muisi ya Mowabu, palupeleru lwa lugongu lwa Pisiga, lyalilola pasi kushiwala.<verse eid="NUM 21:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Waisraeli wankuwakanka wafalumi Sihoni na Ogu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="DEU 2:26-3:11">Liholu 2:26-3:11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 21:21" />Waisraeli wamjegiti mfalumi Sihoni gwa Waamori, ujumbi awu, <verse eid="NUM 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 21:22" />“Gutujimiri tupiti muisi yaku, twenga hapeni tugendi kumbwega na kwingira mumalambu ama mumalambu ga mizyabibu ama kulanda mashi ga manegu genu, twenga hatugendi munjira nkulu ya mfalumi mpaka patuwuka muisi yaku.” <verse eid="NUM 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 21:23" />Kumbiti mfalumi gwa Sihoni kawajimiriti ndiri Waisraeli wapiti muisi yakuyi. Yomberi kawajojonikiti wantu wakuyi, kagenditi Yahasa aku kushiwala kuwakomanga Waisraeli. <verse eid="NUM 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 21:24" />Kumbiti Waisraeli wamlagiti mfalumi Sihoni, waitoliti isi yakuyi kwanjira lushemba Arinoni mpaka lushemba Yaboki, yaani mumbaka mwa isi ya wantu wa Amoni, mbaka ilii yaiweriti yankuloleruwa nentu. <verse eid="NUM 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 21:25" />Waisraeli waitoliti miji ilii kwa makakala na walikaliti mumiji ya wantu wa Amori aku Heshiboni pamuhera na vijiji vyakuyi. <verse eid="NUM 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 21:26" />Heshiboni guweriti mji gwa mfalumi Sihoni gwa wantu wa Amori, ulii palii kwanja kalikomangiti ngondu na mfalumi gwa Mowabu na kuitola kwa makakala isi yakuyi yoseri mpaka lushemba lwa Arinoni. <verse eid="NUM 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 21:27" />Toziya pamakashu pamberi pakwiza Waisraeli, wantu wimbiti lwimbu kwa misali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:27">“Mwizi Heshiboni na kunyawa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:27">Mji gwa Sihoni na gunyawiwi na kugugangamiziya.<verse eid="NUM 21:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 21:28" />Toziya motu gulawiti Heshiboni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:28">mimbamba ya motu ilawiti mji gwa mfalumi Sihoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:28">gwangamiziyiti mji gwa Ari gwa Mowabu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:28">guwangamiziyiti migongu ya lushemba Arinoni.<verse eid="NUM 21:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 21:29" />Shondi mwawantu wa Mowabu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:29">muwagamiziwa, mwenga wantu yamumguwila mlungu Kemoshi!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:29">Guwatenda wana wenu wapalu kuwera watuga isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:29">wahinga waku guwaleka watoluwi kwa makakala</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:29">mpaka kwa mfalumi Sihoni, gwa Amori.<verse eid="NUM 21:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 21:30" />Kumbiti vinu shiyiwuku shawu shyagamiziwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 21:30">kulawa Heshiboni mpaka diboni. Tuwagamiziyiti nakamu Nofa, pakwegera na Medeba.”<verse eid="NUM 21:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 21:31" />Su Waisraeli walikaliti muisi ya wantu wa Amori. <verse eid="NUM 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 21:32" />Shakapanu Musa katumiti wantu waloliloli weri mji gwa Yazeri, womberi wautoliti kwa makakala pamuhera na vijiji vyakuyi, wawawingiti wantu wa Amori yawalikaliti amu.<verse eid="NUM 21:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 21:33" />Shakapanu Waisraeli wagalambukiti kugenda uwega wa kushana pawafata njira yaigenda Bashani. Mfalumi Ogu gwa Bashani kalawiti na shonta lyakuyi kuwakomanga aku Ederei. <verse eid="NUM 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 21:34" />Kumbiti Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Musa, “Nagumtira, toziya hanukutangi gumkanki pamuhera na wantu wakuyi woseri na isi yawu yoseri. Hagumkomi ntambu yagumkomiti Sihoni mfalumi gwa wantu wa Amori, ulii yakalikaliti Heshiboni.” <verse eid="NUM 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 21:35" />Su Waisraeli wamlagiti Ogu na wana wakuyi na wantu wakuyi woseri, pota kumleka ata muntu yumu, shakapanu waitoliti isi yakuyi.<verse eid="NUM 21:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="NUM 22" />
  <para style="s">Balaamu kankushemuwa na mfalumi gwa Mowabu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 22:1" />Shakapanu Waisraeli wagenditi mwanja kugenda kulularanda lwa Mowabu na kubawila malingu gawu kwagulawa mshenji kulushemba lwa Yoridani kugenda mji gwa Yeriku.<verse eid="NUM 22:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 22:2" />Kumbiti Balaki mwana gwa mfalumi Sipoli, kavimaniti vitwatira vyoseri vyavitenditwi na Waisraeli kwa Waamori. <verse eid="NUM 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 22:3" />Yomberi pamuhera na Wamowabu wakoluwa na lyoga hasa toziya ya kuwera wavuwa. <verse eid="NUM 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 22:4" />Su, Wamowabu wawagambira wakulu wa midiani, “lipinga ali shipindi shivuwa ndiri hawahalibisii kila shintu kumbwegambwega kwa twenga handa pongu ntambu yakaliya mihambi mlilambu” Hangu Balaki mwana gwa Sipili, yakaweriti mfalumi gwa Mowabu shipindi ashi. <verse eid="NUM 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 22:5" />Kamjegeriti ujumbi Balamu, mwana gwa Beoli, aku Peholi, pakwegera na lushemba Eufrati muisi ya Amawi, kamgambira hangu,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 22:5">“Kwana wantu weni walawa Misli, na womberi waeneya kila pahala muisi, kayi litishia kutola alizi yangu. <verse eid="NUM 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 22:6" />Gwizi vinu guwapangili wantu awa kwanjili ya neni mana wana likakala kuliku neni, pamonga hanwezi kuwakanka nawingira miusi yangu, kwa mana nivimana hangu gwenga pagumtekelera muntu katekeruwa na pagumpangila muntu kapangiluwa.”<verse eid="NUM 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 22:7" />Su, wakulu wa Mowabu na midiani watola shingilira mbagu sha mtungira wawuka wagenda kwa Balamu. Pawasokiti wampananiti Balamu ujumbi wa Balaki. <verse eid="NUM 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 22:8" />Balamu kawagambira, “Mgonji pashiru panu neni haniwagambirani gakafira kung'ambira Mtuwa Mlungu” su wazewi awa wa Mowabu walikala na Balamu.<verse eid="NUM 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 22:9" />Shakapanu Mlungu kamwiziriti Balamu, kamkosiya “awa ashina gaa wagulikala nawa?”<verse eid="NUM 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 22:10" />“Balamu kamwankula Mlungu, Balaki mwana gwa Sipoli kanjegera ujumbi handa kaweza kulikoma nawa na kuwawinga nakamu. <verse eid="NUM 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 22:11" />Kwana wantu wamu wawalawiti Misli, kanduwa ng'endi kuwalani wantu awa su pamonga kafaulu kulikoma nawa na kuwawinga.”<verse eid="NUM 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 22:12" />Mlungu kamgambira Balamu, “Namgenda pamuhera na wantu awa, pota naguwapangili wantu awa mana watekeleruwa.” <verse eid="NUM 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 22:13" />Su, mandawira yakuyi Balamu kayumukiti kamgambira mkulu gwa Balaki, mwuyi muisi mwenu, toziya “Mtuwa Mlungu kafira ndiri neni ng'endi pamuhera na mwenga, hangu wakulu wa mowabu wawuka, wawuya kwa Balaki, wamgambira, Bilamu kalema kwiza pamuhera na twenga.” <verse eid="NUM 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 22:14" />“Hangu wakulu wa Mowabu wawuka, wawuya kwa Balaki, wawagambira, Balamu kalema kwiza pamuhera na twenga.”<verse eid="NUM 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 22:15" />Shakapanu, balaki katuma wakulu wamonga, nentu na ukulu wa kumpindi kuliku walii wa kwanja. <verse eid="NUM 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 22:16" />Awa wasokiti kwa Balaamu, wamgambira. “Balaamu mwana gwa Sipori kalonga hangu nagujimira kuwaleweleruwa na choseri ata guleki kwiza kwa neni. <verse eid="NUM 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 22:17" />Hanikupanani ligoya likulu na shoseri shagufira kunduwa hanikutenderi. Gwizi guwapangiri wantu awa.”<verse eid="NUM 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 22:18" />Kumbiti Balamu kamwankula wantundami gwa balaki, “Ata handa balaki hakampanani numba yakuyi imemi mpiya na zahabu, neni nweza ndiri kuleka malagaliru ga Mtuwa Mlungu gwangu kuusu shitwatira shoseri, shididini ama shikulu. <verse eid="NUM 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 22:19" />Kambiti shondi mgonji panu na neni mpati kuvimana shakafira kung'ambira Mtuwa Mlungu kayi.”<verse eid="NUM 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 22:20" />Su, Mtuwa Mlungu Kamwizira Balamu aku pashiru panu, kamgambira, “Handa wantu awa wiza kukushema gugengi pamuhera nawu, kumbiti gutendi hera shili shanfira kukugambira.” <verse eid="NUM 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 22:21" />Balamu kawuya mandawira kayalika vyakulivagira pa punda gwakuyi, kagenda pamuhera na wakulu wa Mowabu.<verse eid="NUM 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Balamu na punda gwakuyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 22:22" />Maya ga Mlungu gaweriti gakalipa toziya Balamu kaweriti kankugenda, su ntumintumi gwa Mtuwa Mlungu waliwoniti munjira. Shaka shilii Balaamu kaweriti kakwena papunda gwakuyi pakawera na wantundami wakuyi. <verse eid="NUM 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 22:23" />Su punda kamwona ntumintumi gwa kumpindi gwa Mtuwa Mlungu kagoloka mnjira, kakola ligumba lyalisomolituwi mhala yakuyi, hangu kaleka njira, kagenda kumbwega. Balamu kamkoma punda ayu, kamwuziya kunjira. <verse eid="NUM 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 22:24" />Shakapanu ntumintumigwa kupindi ayu gwa Mtuwa Mlungu kalongolera kulongolu, kagoloka pahala njira ayi iweriti ibabanika, pakati pa malambu ga mizabibu na vibambaza vya mabuwi wega zoseri mbili. <verse eid="NUM 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 22:25" />Punda pakamwoniti ntumintumi gwa kumpindi ayu gwa Mtuwa Mlungu, kalisukuma mushibambaza na kulipesha ligulu lya Balamu kamkoma kayi Punda ayu. <verse eid="NUM 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 22:26" />Shakapanu ntumintumi gwa kumpindi kalongolera kayi, kagoloka pahala pababani pahera na lupenyu lya kupita kumshigi ama kuliwu. <verse eid="NUM 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 22:27" />Punda pakamwoniti ntumintumi gwa kumpindi gwa Mtuwa Mlungu, kagonja pasi, Balamu keniti maya, kamkoma kwa fimbu yakuyi. <verse eid="NUM 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 22:28" />Panu Mtuwa Mlungu kamtenda punda kayoweri, kamgambiriti Balaamu, “Balamu, nikutendera shishi ata gunkoma mala ndatu azi?”<verse eid="NUM 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 22:29" />Balamu kamgambira punda, “Gwenga guntenda neni mzigizigi! Handa meweri na ligumba menukulagiriti kutali vinu hera”<verse eid="NUM 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 22:30" />Punda kamgambira Balamu, “Hashi, neni na ulaulii punda gwaku yakakupapiti makaliru gaku goseri mpaka lishaka ali lya leru? Hashi nikutenderiti ntambu ayi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 22:30">Balaamu kawankuliti, “Ndala.”<verse eid="NUM 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 22:31" />Panu Mtuwa Mlungu kagavugula masu ga Balaamu na yomberi kamwona ntumintumi gwa kumpindi gwa Mtuwa Mlungu kagoloka mnjira uganu kakola ligumba lyalisomerituwi mhala yakuyi. Balamu kaliyasa pasi makukama. <verse eid="NUM 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 22:32" />Ntumintumi gwa kumpindi Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambira Balamu, “Ntambu gaa gumkoma punda gwaku mala ntatu azi? Niza kukulewelera, toziya shilii shaguhola kutenda shiwera shidoda. <verse eid="NUM 22:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 22:33" />Punda gwaku kamona kasepuka mala ntatu azi, handa mekagalambukili kutali na neni nakaka menikulagi gwenga na kumleka mkomu punda gwaku ayu.”<verse eid="NUM 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 22:34" />“Balamu kamgambira ntumintumi gwa kumpindi gwa Mtuwa Mlungu, Ntenda vidoda nivimaniti ndiri handa ikufiliziya ndiri ng'endereyi na mwanja agu, su hambuyi ukaya.”<verse eid="NUM 22:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 22:35" />Kumbiti ntumintumi gwa kumpindi gwa Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambira Balaamu, “Gugendi na wantu awa, kumbiti hagutakuli hela shilii shanfila kukugambila.” Su Balaamu kendereya na mwanja pamuhera na wakulu wa Balaki.<verse eid="NUM 22:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Balaki kankumshemera Balaamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 22:36" />Balaki pakapatiti visoweru handa Balaamu kunkwiza, kalawiti kagenda kumwanka mumji gwa Ari, mji yaguweriti mumpeku mwa lushemba Arinoni mumbaka ya Mowabu. <verse eid="NUM 22:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 22:37" />Balaki kamgambiriti Balaamu, “kwashishi gwiza ndiri kalongola panukushemiti? Hashi guliholiti handa mweza ndiri kukupa ligoya likulu?”<verse eid="NUM 22:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 22:38" />Balamu kamwankula Balaki, “Vinu niza! Kumbiti hashi nina uwezu wa kulonga shoseri? Shitwatira shakang'ambiliti Mlungu ndo shanfiru kulonga.”<verse eid="NUM 22:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 22:39" />Su, wasoka mji gwa Kiriati husoti. <verse eid="NUM 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 22:40" />Aku Balaki kalaviyiti tambiku ya ng'ombi na kondolu, kawagawira vinofu Balamu na wakulu yawaweriti pamuhera na yomberi.<verse eid="NUM 22:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Balaki kankuwatekelera Waisraeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 22:41" />Shirawu yakuyi, Balaki kamtoliti Balamu, kakwena nayu mpaka Bamoti Baali, kulawa aku Baali kaweziti kuwawona wamu wa Waisraeli.<verse eid="NUM 22:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="NUM 23" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 23:1" />Balaamu kamgambiriti Balaki, “Gunyawiri vitalawanda vya kutambikira saba panu shakapanu gunjegeri wang'ombi washipalu saba na wakondolu washipali saba.” <verse eid="NUM 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 23:2" />Balaki katenditi gambira Balaamu ntambu yakalongiti. Su walaviyiti pakila shitalawanda tambiku ya ng'ombi gwashipalu yumu na kondolu gwashipalu yumu. <verse eid="NUM 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 23:3" />Shakapanu Balaamu kamgambiriti Balaki, Balaki, “Gusigali panu pakwegera na tambiku yaku ya kulunguziya nakamu, neni ng'endi. Pamonga Mtuwa Mlungu hakaliwoni na neni. Shoseri shakagenda kunanguziya hanizi kukugambira.” Su Balaamu kakweniti gweka yakuyi palugongu. <verse eid="NUM 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 23:4" />Mlungu kaliwoniti na yomberi. Na Balaamu kamgambiriti, “Ntandira vitalawanda vya kutambikira saba na ndaviya tambiku ya ng'ombi gwashipalu yumu na kondolu gwashipalu yumu pakila shitalawanda.”<verse eid="NUM 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 23:5" />Mtuwa Mlungu kampanana “Balaamu visoweru vyakagenda kuyowera na kamgambiriti kawuyi kwa Balaki.” <verse eid="NUM 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 23:6" />Balaamu kawuyiti, kamwoniti Balaki kagoloka pahala palaa palii pakwegera na tambiku yakuyi ya kulunguziwa nakamu, pamuhera na wakulu wakuyi wa Mowabu.<verse eid="NUM 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 23:7" />Balaamu kawagambiriti ujumbi awu pakalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:7">“Balaki kanjega panu kulawa Aramu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:7">yina, mfalumi gwa Mowabu kanjega kulawa kuvigongu vya kwakulawira shenji.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:7">Gwizi guwapangili wantu wa Yakobu kwajili yaneni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:7">yina, gwizi guwagambiri Waisraeli kuwera hawapatwi na vintu vidoda!<verse eid="NUM 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 23:8" />Hanimpangili hashi muntu ulii Mlungu kampangiliti ndiri?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:8">Hanuwatozi hashi walii Mtuwa Mlungu kawatoziti ndiri?<verse eid="NUM 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 23:9" />Kulawa mulupeleru palitalawu niwawoniti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:9">kulawa pavigongu niwasungulira.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:9">Awa wantu yawalikala gweka yawu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:9">yawalihola kuwera teratera na wantu wa isi zimonga.<verse eid="NUM 23:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 23:10" />Gaa yakaweza kuwawalanga uvuwa wa wantu wa Yakobu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:10">ama kuhola lipinga lya wantu wa Israeli?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:10">Gundeki howi gambira wantu yawamuherepeziya Mlungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:10">upeleru wa neni na uweri gambira wawu.”<verse eid="NUM 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 23:11" />Palii Balaki kamgambiriti Balaamu, “Hashi, guntendera shishi? Nukujega panu guwapangili wangondu wangu, badala yakuyi guwatekelera!”<verse eid="NUM 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 23:12" />Balaamu kamwankuliti Balaki, “Hantakuli shilii Mtuwa Mlungu shakang'ambiriti kutakula.”<verse eid="NUM 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ujumbi wa pili wa Balaamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 23:13" />Shakapanu Balaki kamgambiriti Balaamu, “Tugendi pahala pamonga, palii haguwezi kuwawona. Pamuhera na hangu haguwoni hera semu yawu, gwenga hapeni kuwawona woseri. Shakapanu guwapangili kulawa aku kwa niaba ya neni.” <verse eid="NUM 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 23:14" />Su Balaki kamtoliti Balaamu kululalanda lwa Sofimu, palugongu lwa Pisiga. Palii yomberi kanyawiti vitalawanda saba vya kutambikira na pakila shitalawanda kalaviyiti tambiku ya ng'ombi gwashipalu yumu na kondolu gwashipalu yumu.<verse eid="NUM 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 23:15" />Balaamu kamgambiriti Balaki, “Gusigali panu pakwegera na tambiku yaku ya kulunguziwa nakamu, neni ng'endi kumwambu kuliwona na Mtuwa Mlungu.”<verse eid="NUM 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 23:16" />“Mtuwa Mlungu kaliwoniti na Balaamu, kamgambiriti visoweru vyakagenda kuyowera, su kamgambiriti kawuyi kwa Balaki.” <verse eid="NUM 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 23:17" />Su Balaki kawuyiti, kamwoniti Balaki kagoloka pakwegera na tambiku ya kulunguziwa nakamu pamuhera na wakulu woseri wa Mowabu. “Balaki kamkosiyiti Balaamu, hashi, Mtuwa Mlungu kakugambira shishi?” <verse eid="NUM 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 23:18" />Su Balaamu kamgambiriti Balaki ujumbi awu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:18">“Gugoloki Balaki gupikanili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:18">gumpikaniri gwenga mwana gwa Sipori.<verse eid="NUM 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 23:19" />Mlungu ndo muntu ndiri, kapayi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:19">viraa muntu ndiri kagalambuli nfiru yakuyi!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:19">Hashi hakalagili shintu na hapeni katendi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:19">ama kalongi shintu hapeni shilawili?<verse eid="NUM 23:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 23:20" />Guloli, neni mpananwa amuli ya kutekelera,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:20">na Mtuwa Mlungu katekelera, neni weza ndiri kupangila.<verse eid="NUM 23:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 23:21" />Mtuwa Mlungu kawona ndiri udoda kwa wantu wa Yakobu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:21">ama tabu kwa wantu awa wa Israeli.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:21">Mtuwa Mlungu gwawu kapamuhera na womberi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:21">Mweni hukwisuwa kwa lusheka pakati pawu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:21">viraa hawabweri Mlungu kawera mfalumi gwawu.<verse eid="NUM 23:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 23:22" />Mlungu yakawawusiyiti kulawa Misri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:22">kankulikomanga ngondu kwajili yawu gambira mbogu. <verse eid="NUM 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 23:23" />Nakaka uhawi hapeni guwaleweleri wantu wa Yakobu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:23">ama uganga kwa wantu wa Israeli.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:23">Vinu kwa Israeli, wantu hawalongi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:23">mloli makangashu yakagatenditi Mlungu!<verse eid="NUM 23:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 23:24" />Guloli Waisraeli wagoloka gambira simba gwashidala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:24">wankugoloka gambira simba washipalu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:24">Gambira simba yakagonja ndiri mpaka kamalili magomeziwu gakuyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 23:24">na kulanda mwazi gwa magomeziwu.”<verse eid="NUM 23:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 23:25" />Shakapanu Balaka kamgambiriti Balaamu, “Paguwapangila ndiri, su naguwatekelera nakamu!”<verse eid="NUM 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 23:26" />Kumbiti Balaamu kamwankula Balaki, “Hashi, nikugambiriti ndiri kuwera shakatakula Mtuwa Mlungu ndo shanfiruwa kutenda?”<verse eid="NUM 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ujumbi wa tatu wa Balaki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 23:27" />Balaki kamgambiriti Balaamu, “Gwizi hanikujegi pahala pamonga. Pamonga Mlungu hakajimiri guwapangili wantu walii kulawa aku kwajili yaneni.” <verse eid="NUM 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 23:28" />Su Balaki kamtoliti Balaamu mpaka palugongu lwa Peori, palii muntu pakagoloka hakawoni kushiwala.<verse eid="NUM 23:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 23:29" />Balaamu kamgambiriti Balaki, “Gunyawili vitalawanda vya kutambikira saba panu, guntandiri ng'ombi gwashipalu saba na wakondolu washipalu saba.” <verse eid="NUM 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 23:30" />Balaki katenditi ntambu yakagambiritwi na Balaamu, shakapanu kalaviyiti pakila shitalawanda sha kutambikira, ng'ombi gwashipalu yumu na kondolu gwashipalu yumu.<verse eid="NUM 23:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="NUM 24" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 24:1" />Vinu Balaamu pakavimaniti kuwera Mtuwa Mlungu kafiliti kuwatekelera Waisraeli, su yomberi kagenditi ndiri kutunga kayi, kagalambukiti kulola kushiwala, <verse eid="NUM 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 24:2" />su pakaloliti kawawoniti Waisraelli wabawiriti malingu gawu, kila likabila pahali pakuyi. Shakapanu Rohu ya Mlungu imwiziriti. <verse eid="NUM 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 24:3" />Na Balaamu katakuliti ujumbi awu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 24:3">“Ujumbi waneni Balaamu mwana gwa Peori</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:3">visoweru vya muntu yakatumluwa masu.<verse eid="NUM 24:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 24:4" />Visoweri vya muntu yakapikaniriti visoweru vya Mlungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:4">muntu yakawoniti mawonu ga Mlungu yakawera na makakala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:4">muntu yakasuntama makukama na agawu pakawona pota kufifa.<verse eid="NUM 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 24:5" />Gwee Yakobu Malingu gaku gaherepa kwa ntambu gaa mwenga wantu wa Yakobu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:5">yina, kambi za mwenga wantu wa Israeli!<verse eid="NUM 24:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 24:6" />Gawera gambira lilaranda lyalinyinyirisha mashi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:6">gambira shiwunga mumbwega mwa lushemba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:6">gambira mitera ya mishubiri yaiyalitwi na Mtuwa Mlungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:6">gambira mitera ya mierezi mumbwega mwa mashi.<verse eid="NUM 24:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 24:7" />Womberi hawaweri na mvula zyazitosha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:7">mbeyu zawu hazipati mashi gavuwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:7">mfalumi gwawu hakaweri mkulu kuliku Agagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:7">na ufalumi wakuyi haupananwi ligoya nentu.<verse eid="NUM 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 24:8" />Mlungu kawatoliti kulawa Misri,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:8">na yomberi kawakomeraga ngondu kwa makakala gakuyi makulu gambira mbogu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:8">Hakawagamiziyi wantu wa isi zimonga yawawera wangondu wawu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:8">hakamegimegi mifupa yawu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:8">hakawasomi kwa misali yakuyi.<verse eid="NUM 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 24:9" />Hakawanyatiri na kugonja pasi gambira simba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:9">gaa hakajeri kumwimusiya?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:9">Katekelerwi muntu yoseri yakawatekelera mwenga Waisraeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:9">viraa kapangilwi ulii yakawapangila Waisraeli.”<verse eid="NUM 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 24:10" />Balaki kaweriti na maya kuusu Balaamu, kakoma shipopu mawoku gakuyi kwa maya na kumgambira, “Nukushemiti guwapangili wankondu wangu, kumbiti mala tatu zoseri azi gwenga guwatekelera! <verse eid="NUM 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 24:11" />Vinu gugendi zaku. Neni nukulagiliti kukupanana lifupu livuwa, kumbiti Mtuwa Mlungu kakwima!”<verse eid="NUM 24:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 24:12" />Balaki kamwankiti Balaki, “Hashi, niwagambiriti ndiri wantu yaguwatumiti kwaneni <verse eid="NUM 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 24:13" />kuwera ata megumpanani ikulu yaku paimema magini ga mpiya na zahabu, neni hapeni nuligalambuka lilagaliru lya Mtuwa Mlungu, kwa kutenda shitwatira shoseri shiheri ama shidoda kwa ntambu yanfira namweni? Ntakuliti kuwera shakatakuliti Mtuwa Mlungu, neni hanishitakuli.”<verse eid="NUM 24:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Umbuyi wa upeleru wa Balaamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 24:14" />“Vinu mbuya kwa wantu waneni, kumbiti pamberi pakuwuya, guleki nikugambiri vitwatira vyawagenda kuwatendera wantu waku mumashaka gagiza.”<verse eid="NUM 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 24:15" />Su Balamu katakuliti ujumbi awu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 24:15">“Ujumbi wa neni Balaamu mwana gwa Beori,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:15">visoweru vya muntu yakavugulitwi masu,”<verse eid="NUM 24:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 24:16" />“Ujumbi gwa muntu yakapikaniriti visoweru vya Mlungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:16">muntu yakavimana marifa kulawa kwa Mlungu Mkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:16">muntu yakawoniti mawonu ga Mlungu yakawera na makakala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:16">muntu yakagonja makukama na agawu pakawona pota kufifa.<verse eid="NUM 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 24:17" />Nimwona, ulii yakafira kwiza kumbiti shakapanu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:17">nimwona kumbiti kapakwegera ndiri.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:17">Ntondu hayirawiri kwa shiyiwuku sha Yakobu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:17">hakalawili mfalumi pakati pa Waisraeli.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:17">Luhonga lwakuyi hakawasyatangi wakulu wa wantu wa Mowabu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:17">hakawagamiziyi washiyiwuku shoseri sha Seti.<verse eid="NUM 24:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 24:18" />Edomu hakakoluwimlima na yomberi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:18">Seiri hayiweri yakuyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:18">Israeli haipati ukanka mkulu.<verse eid="NUM 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 24:19" />Yumu gwa washiyiwuku sha Yakubu hakakolimlima</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:19">na yomberi hakawalagi yawaponikiti wa Ari.”<verse eid="NUM 24:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 24:20" />Shakapanu Balaamu kawaloliti Waameleki, katakuliti ujumbi awu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:20">“Amaleki ndo isi ya wantu yawawera na makaka kuliku isi zyamonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:20">kumbiti palupeleru hawagamiziwi nakamu.”<verse eid="NUM 24:20" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 24:21" />Su Balaamu kawaloliti Wakeni, katakula ujumbi awu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:21">“Pahala pamulikala pawera ponera, mwenga Wakeni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:21">gambira shitukulu kumpindi nentu palitalawu.<verse eid="NUM 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 24:22" />Kumbiti hamlaguwi mwenga Wakeni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:22">Hamtoluwi kwa makakala na wantu wa Ashuru mpaka ndii?”<verse eid="NUM 24:22" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 24:23" />Kayi Balaamu katakuliti ujumbi awu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:23">“Ahaa! Hashi, gaa hakalikali, Mlungu pakagatenda aga?<verse eid="NUM 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 24:24" />Mitumbwi mikulu haisoki kulawa Kitimu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:24">hawaikomi Ashuru na Eberi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="NUM 24:24">kumbiti na womberi viraa hawahowi mashaka goseri.”<verse eid="NUM 24:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 24:25" />Su Balaamu kawukiti kuwuya ukaya, Balaki viraa kagenditi zakuyi.<verse eid="NUM 24:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="NUM 25" />
  <para style="s">Wantu wa Israeli yawamguwira mlungu Baali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 25:1" />Wasraeli pawaweriti aku Shitimu, wapalu wanjiti kutenda uhumba na wadala wa Mowabu. <verse eid="NUM 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 25:2" />Wadala awa washeritwi, Waisraeli watendi matambiku yawatambikiriti wamlungu wawu, nawomberi Waisraeli waliya shiboga na kuguwira wamlungu wawu. <verse eid="NUM 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 25:3" />Hangu ndo ntambu Waisraeli pawanjiti kumguwira mlungu Baali gwa Peori, su maya ga Mtuwa Mlungu gaweriti panani pawu. <verse eid="NUM 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 25:4" />Su Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Musa, “Guwatoli wakulu woseri wa Israeli yawawalonguziyiti wantu kutenda madoda, guwalagi kulongolu kwa neni pamshenji, su maya gangu kuusu mwenga gawuki.” <verse eid="NUM 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 25:5" />Musa kawagambiriti wakulu wa Israeli, “Kila yumu gwenu kamlagi muntu yoseri pakati penu ulii yakamguwiriti mlungu Baali wa Peori.”<verse eid="NUM 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 25:6" />Shaka shilaa shilii muntu yumu kamjegiti mdala yumu muntu gwa Midiyani ukaya kwakuyi, Musa na shipinga shoseri sha wantu wa Israeli pawaweriti wankudaya paligomi lya Liringu Linanagala. <verse eid="NUM 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 25:7" />Su Finehasi mwana gwa Eleazari mzukulu gwa mtambika Aruni, pakawoniti aga, su kagolokiti kulawa mushipinga shilii, katoliti mgoha <verse eid="NUM 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 25:8" />na kumfata muntu ulii gwa Israeli mpaka muliringu lyakuyi, kawasomiti mgoha woseri wawili mumtima. Su kwakutenda hangu, malweli makulu yagawapatiti Waisraeli gaperiti. <verse eid="NUM 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 25:9" />Waisraeli yawahowiti kulawirana na malweli galii, waweriti wantu elufu malongu mawili na msheshi.<verse eid="NUM 25:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 25:10" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Musa, <verse eid="NUM 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 25:11" />“Finehasi mwana gwa Eleazari, mzukulu gwa mtambika Aruni, kalewelera maya gangu kwa Waisraeli. Muwamu mwenu ndo mweni hera kafiliti ndiri kuwona mlungu yumonga pakaguwiruwa kumbiti neni hera. Su kwajili yakuyi ndo mana nuwagamiziyiti ndiri Waisraeli woseri kwa maya gangu. <verse eid="NUM 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 25:12" />Su gumgambiri Finehasi kuwera nakutenda nayu lipatanu lya ponga. <verse eid="NUM 25:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 25:13" />Nankutenda lipatanu na yomberi kuwera mweni pamuhera na shiyiwuku shakuyi hawaweri watambika mashaka goseri toziya kalekiti ndiri kuwona mlungu yumonga kaguwirwi kumbiti neni hera Mlungu gwakuyi, su kawakolaniziyiti mawoku Waisraeli na neni.”<verse eid="NUM 25:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 25:14" />Mwisraeli ulii yakalaguwitwi pamuhera na mdala ulii muntu kulawa muisi ya Midiyani yakashemitwi Zimri mwana gwa Salu, mkulu gwa kaya yimu mulikabila lya Simiyoni. <verse eid="NUM 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 25:15" />Na mdala ayu muntu gwa Midiyani yawamlagiti wamshemiti Kozibi muhinga gwa Suri, yakaweriti mkulu gwa lukolu tunga lwa aku Midiyani. <verse eid="NUM 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 25:16" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Musa, <verse eid="NUM 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 25:17" />“Muwawiziri vumu kwa makakala wantu wa Midiyani na muwalagi, <verse eid="NUM 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 25:18" />toziya womberi wawasoziya mwenga kwa vitendu vyawu vidoda, wawapayiriti kuusu Peori na toziya ya Kozibi, mhinga gwawu, yakalagitwi shaka malweri madoda pagalawiriti kulii Peori.”<verse eid="NUM 25:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="NUM 26" />
  <para style="s">Waisraeli wankuwalanguwa mala ya pili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 26:1" />Pa makomangu galii, Mtuwa Mlungu kawagambiriti Musa na Eleazari mwana gwa mtambika Aruni, <verse eid="NUM 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 26:2" />“Muwalangi shikundi shoseri sha Waisraeli, kila muntu kalavii handa ntambu yakawera yakafiriti kugenderana na kaya zawu. Muwawalangi wantu woseri wana vinja malongu mawili na kwendeleya wawafaa kugenda kungondu.” <verse eid="NUM 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 26:3" />Musa na mtambika Eleazari wayowera na wantu kuisi lalanda za Mowabu, kumwambu kulushemba Yoridani, pakwegera na Yeriko, wawagambira, <verse eid="NUM 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 26:4" />“Muwawalangi wantu kwanjira na wana vinja malongu mawili na kongereka, handa Mtuwa ntambu yakamlagaliti Musi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 26:4">Waisraeli wawawukiti Misri ndo awa.”<verse eid="NUM 26:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 26:5" />Kulawa mulikabila lya Rubeni yakaweriti shipanta njira gwa Yakubu, kuweriti na lukolu lwa Hanoki na lukolu lwa Palu <verse eid="NUM 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 26:6" />na lukolu lwa Hezironi na lukolu lwa Karimi. <verse eid="NUM 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 26:7" />Avi ndo vileri vya likabila lya Rubeni. Walanga ya wapalu yawawalangitwi waweriti elufu malongu msheshi na tatu miya saba na malongu matatu. <verse eid="NUM 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 26:8" />Lukolu lwa Palu waweriti Eliyabu, <verse eid="NUM 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 26:9" />na wana wakuyi Nemueli na Datani na Abiramu. Wana awa wawili ndo yawasyagulitwi pakati pa shipinga sha Waisraeli, kumbiti wamlemiti Musa na Aruni, kulikolerana na wantu wa Kora shaka shilii pawamlemiti Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="NUM 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 26:10" />Shaka shilii isi paivugukiti kuwamira, wahowiti pamuhera na Kora na motu guwalunguziyiti wantu wakuyi miya mbili na malongu muhanu. Ali liweriti liberiziwu kwa wantu wa Israeli. <verse eid="NUM 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 26:11" />Pamuhera na aga wana wa Kora wahowiti ndiri.<verse eid="NUM 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 26:12" />Likabila lya Simiyoni, kaweriti na lukolu lwa Nemueli na Yamini na Yakini, <verse eid="NUM 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 26:13" />Zera na Shauli. <verse eid="NUM 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 26:14" />Azi ndo kolu za likabila lya Simiyoni, walanga yoseri ya wapalu waweriti elufu malongu mawili na mbili na miya mbili.<verse eid="NUM 26:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 26:15" />Likabila lya Gadi, wantu yawawalangitwi waweriti wa lukolu lwa Sefoni na Hagi na Shuni, <verse eid="NUM 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 26:16" />Ozini na Eri, <verse eid="NUM 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 26:17" />na Arodi na Areli. <verse eid="NUM 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 26:18" />Azi ndo kolu za likabila lya Gadi, walanga yoseri ya wapalu woseri yawawalangitwi waweriti elufu malongu msheshi na miya muhanu.<verse eid="NUM 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 26:19" />Likabila lya Yuda, wapalu yawawalangitwi waweriti wa lukolu lwa Yuda na Eri na Onani. Wapalu awa wahowiti muisi ya Kanaani. <verse eid="NUM 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 26:20" />Likabila lya Yuda liweriti na kaya ya Shela na Pelesi na Zera. <verse eid="NUM 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 26:21" />Kulawa kwa Pelesi, kuweriti na shileri sha Hosironi na Hamuli. <verse eid="NUM 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 26:22" />Azi ndo kolu za Yuda, wapalu woseri yawawalangitwi waweriti elufu malongu saba na sita na miya muhanu.<verse eid="NUM 26:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 26:23" />Likabila lya Isakari liweriti na lukolu lwa Tola na Puva, <verse eid="NUM 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 26:24" />na Yushubu na Shimironi. <verse eid="NUM 26:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 26:25" />Azi ndo kolu za Isakari, wapalu woseri yawawalangitwi waweriti elufu malongu sita na msheshi na miya tatu.<verse eid="NUM 26:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 26:26" />Likabila lya Zebuluni kuweriti na lukolu lwa Seredi na Eloni na Yaleeli. <verse eid="NUM 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 26:27" />Azi ndo kolu za Zebuluni, wapalu woseri yawawalangitwi waweriti elufu malongu sita na miya muhanu.<verse eid="NUM 26:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 26:28" />Yusufu kaweriti na wana wapalu wawili, Manasi na Efraimu wiziti kuwera makabila.<verse eid="NUM 26:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 26:29" />Manasi kaweriti na mwana yakashemitwi Makiri, Makiri kaweriti na mwana yakashemitwi Gileyadi. <verse eid="NUM 26:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 26:30" />Kulawa kwa Gileyadi kuweriti na nkolu za Yezeri na Heleki <verse eid="NUM 26:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 26:31" />na Asirieli na Shekemu, <verse eid="NUM 26:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 26:32" />na Shemida na Heferi. <verse eid="NUM 26:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 26:33" />Selofehadi mwana gwa Heferi kapatiti ndiri wana wapalu kumbiti wadala hera, wana wadala awa waweriti Mala na Noa na Hogula na Milika na Tiriza. <verse eid="NUM 26:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 26:34" />Azi ndo kolu za Manasi, wapalu woseri yawawalangitwi waweriti elufu malongu muhanu na mbili na miya saba.<verse eid="NUM 26:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 26:35" />Likabila lya Efraimu liweriti na lukolu lwa Shutihela na Bekeri na Tahani. <verse eid="NUM 26:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 26:36" />Kulawa kwa Shutihela kuweriti na shileri sha Erani. <verse eid="NUM 26:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 26:37" />Azi ndo kolu za Efraimu, wapalu woseri yawawalangitwi waweriti elufu malongu matatu na mbili na miya muhanu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 26:37">Kolu zoseri azi za makabila aga mawili galawiti kwa Yusufu.<verse eid="NUM 26:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 26:38" />Likabila lya Benjamini liweriti na lukolu lwa Bela na Ashibeli na Ahiramu <verse eid="NUM 26:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 26:39" />na Shufamu na Hufamu. <verse eid="NUM 26:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 26:40" />Kulawa kwa Bela kuweriti na shileri sha Aridi na Naamani. <verse eid="NUM 26:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 26:41" />Azi ndo kolu za Benjamini, wapalu woseri yawawalangitwi waweriti elufu malongu msheshi na muhanu na miya sita.<verse eid="NUM 26:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 26:42" />Likabila lya Dani liweriti na kolu lwa Shahamu, <verse eid="NUM 26:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 26:43" />lukolu alu luweriti na wapalu elufu malongu sita na msheshi na miya msheshi.<verse eid="NUM 26:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 26:44" />Likabila lya Asheri liweriti na lukolu lwa Imina na Ishivi na Beria. <verse eid="NUM 26:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 26:45" />Kulawa kwa Beria kuweriti na shileri sha Heberi na Malikieli. <verse eid="NUM 26:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 26:46" />Asheri kaweriti na muhinga yakashemituwituwi Sera. <verse eid="NUM 26:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 26:47" />Azi ndo kolu za likabila lya Asheri, wapalu woseri yawawalangitwi waweriti elufu malongu muhanu na tatu na miya msheshi.<verse eid="NUM 26:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 26:48" />Likabila lya Nafutali liweriti na lukolu lwa Yaseeli na Guni, <verse eid="NUM 26:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 26:49" />Yeseri na Shilemu. <verse eid="NUM 26:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 26:50" />Azi ndo kolu za likabila lya Nafutali, wapalu woseri yawawalangitwi waweriti elufu malongu msheshi na muhanu na miya msheshi.<verse eid="NUM 26:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="NUM 26:51" />Walanga ya wapalu wa Israeli yawawalangitwi waweriti laki sita na elufu yimu na miya saba na malongu matatu.<verse eid="NUM 26:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="NUM 26:52" />Shakapanu Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Musa, <verse eid="NUM 26:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="NUM 26:53" />“Makabila aga hagapananwi isi iweri yawu, kulawirana na walanga ya matawu gawu. <verse eid="NUM 26:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="NUM 26:54" />Likabila likulu halipananwi pahala pawu pakulu paweri pawu na likabila lididini halipananwi pahala padidini paweri pawu. Kila likabila halipananwi pahala pawu kulinganira na walanga ya wantu wakuyi. <verse eid="NUM 26:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="NUM 26:55" />Pamuhera na ubagula wa isi hawutendewi kwa kugalambula simbi. Kila likabila halipananwi semu yawu kulawirana na ukulu ama udidini wakuyi. <verse eid="NUM 26:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="NUM 26:56" />Ubagula wa isi kwa kila likabila hauweri kwa njira ya kugalambuziya simbi, kila likabila halipati kulinganira na ukulu ama udidini wakuyi.”<verse eid="NUM 26:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="NUM 26:57" />Azi ndo kolu za wantu wa Lawi zyazilembitwi na kolu zawu. Kolu azi ziweriti za Gerishoni na Kohati na Merari <verse eid="NUM 26:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="NUM 26:58" />pamuhera na shileri sha Libini na Hebroni na Mahili na Mushi na Kora. Kohatihi tati gwakuyi kaweriti Amiramu. <verse eid="NUM 26:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="NUM 26:59" />Mdala gwa Amiramu wamshemiti Yokebedi, muhinga gwakuyi Lawi, ulii yakayiwukiti Misri. Ayu kamwiwuliriti Amiramu wana wawili wapalu, Aruni na Musa na muhinga yumu, Miriamu. <verse eid="NUM 26:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="NUM 26:60" />Aruni kaweriti na wana wapalu wamsheshi, Nadabu na Abihu na Eliyazari na Itihamari. <verse eid="NUM 26:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="NUM 26:61" />Nadabu na Abihu wahowiti pawamlaviliriti Mtuwa Mlungu tambika ya motu gufaa ndiri. <verse eid="NUM 26:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="NUM 26:62" />Walanga ya wantu wa Lawi, wapalu yawawera na umuli wa mwezi gumu na kwendeleya, waweriti elufu malongu mawili na tatu. Awa wawalangitwi ndiri pamuhera na Waisraeli wamonga toziya wapananitwiti ndiri kuhala isi pakati pa Waisraeli.<verse eid="NUM 26:62" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="NUM 26:63" />Awa ndo wapalu wa Israeli yawalembitwi na Musa na mtambika Eleazari muisi yaiwera lularanda za Mowabu, kumwambu mwa lushemba Yoridani pakwegera na Yeriku. <verse eid="NUM 26:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="NUM 26:64" />Pakati pawu paweriti ndiri ata muntu yumu yakasigaliti pakati pa walii yawawalangitwi na Musa na mtambika Aruni, walii yawawalangitwi walanga ya kwanja kushiwala sha Sinayi. <verse eid="NUM 26:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="NUM 26:65" />Mtuwa Mlungu kalongiti kuwera wantu woseri hawahowi kushiwala, nakaka kwahera ata yumu gwawu yakasigaliti mkomu, kumbiti Karebu mwana gwa Yefune na Yoshuwa mwana gwa Nuni ndo yawasigaliti.<verse eid="NUM 26:65" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="NUM 27" />
  <para style="s">Maluwa ga Wahinga wa Selofehadi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 27:1" />Lishaka limu wahinga wa Selofehadi ashina Mala na Nowa na Hogila na Milika na Tiriza wamgenderiti Musa, ayu Selofehadi kaweriti mwana gwa Heferi, mwana gwa Gileadi mwana gwa Makili mwana gwa Manasi kaweriti mwana gwa Yosefu. <verse eid="NUM 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 27:2" />Su womberi wiziti palugomi lwa Liringu Linanagala na kugoloka kulongolu kwa mtambika Eleazari na wakulu woseri wa wantu wa Waisraeli. <verse eid="NUM 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 27:3" />Womberi walongiti, “Tati gwetu kahowiti kushiwala na kaheriti mwana mpalu yoseri. Mweni kaweriti ndiri muwamu mwa wantu wa Kora yawimwiziriti Mtuwa Mlungu, tati gwetu kahowiti kulawirana na vidoda vyakuyi mweni. <verse eid="NUM 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 27:4" />Iwera hashi litawu lya tati gwetu liwusiwi mulukolu lwakuyi toziya kaheriti na mwana maplu? Gutupanani semu ya isi yetu pamuhera na walongu wakuyi tati gwetu.”<verse eid="NUM 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 27:5" />Musa kalijegiti lihinginiku lyawu kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="NUM 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 27:6" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Musa, <verse eid="NUM 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 27:7" />“Shawatakuliti wahinga wa Selofehadi shiwera sha nakaka, guwapanani seemu ya isi pamuhera na walongu wa tati gwawu, watoli semu ya isi iweri yawu. <verse eid="NUM 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 27:8" />Shakapanu guwagambiri Waisraeli kuwera muntu yoseri pakahowa pota kuleka mwana mpalu, uhala wakuyi wa semu ya isi hakapananwi muhinga gwakuyi. <verse eid="NUM 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 27:9" />Paiwera kahera muhinga, su semu ya isi ayi hawapananwi walongu wakuyi wapalu. <verse eid="NUM 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 27:10" />Na payiwera kahera walongu wapalu, su uhala wakuyi hawapananwi watati wakuyi wakulu na wapusu. <verse eid="NUM 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 27:11" />Na payiwera tati gwakuyi kahera walongu wapalu, su uhala wakuyi hawapananwi walongu wakuyi wa pakwegera, na yomberi hakahali gambira yakuyi. Aga hagaweri malagizu na amuli kwa Waisraeli gambira neni Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yanulagaliriti.”<verse eid="NUM 27:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yoshuwa kasyagulwa kuwalongoziya Waisraeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 27:12" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Musa, “Gukweni kulugongu alu vigongu vya Abiramu guiloli isi yang'enda kuwapanana Waisraeli. <verse eid="NUM 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 27:13" />Paguyiwona kala, gwenga viraa haguhowi gambira mlongu gwaku Aruni ntambu yakahowiti. <verse eid="NUM 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 27:14" />Gwenga haguhowi toziya mugajimiriti ndiri malagaliru gangu kulii kushiwa sha Sini. Shaka shipinga sha wantu pawahinginikiti kuusu neni kulii Meriba, mwenga mlemiti kugajimira makakala gangu mananagala kulongolu kwawu pawafiriti wapananwi mashi.” Meriba liweriti linegu lya mashi ga kulii Kadeshi kushiwala sha Sini. <verse eid="NUM 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 27:15" />Su Musa kamluwiti Mtuwa Mlungu, <verse eid="NUM 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 27:16" />“Gwee Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu yaguweriti shyanjiru sha ukomu kwa viumbi vyoseri. Nikuluwa gumsyaguli muntu gwa kushigolokera shipinga sha wantu awa, <verse eid="NUM 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 27:17" />ulii hakawalongoleri mumahengu gawu goseri, su Waisraeli nawiza kuwera gambira wakondolu yawahera mlolera.”<verse eid="NUM 27:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 27:18" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Musa, “Gumtoli Yoshuwa mwana gwa Nuni, muntu yakawera na rohu iherepa, shakapanu gumtulili mawoku, <verse eid="NUM 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 27:19" />na kumgolusiya kulongolu kwa mtambika Eleazari na shipinga shoseri sha wantu, gumpanani lihengu ali kulongolu kwa wantu agawu pawamlola. <verse eid="NUM 27:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 27:20" />Gumpanani semu ya uwezu waku su shipinga shoseri sha Waisraeli wamjimiri. <verse eid="NUM 27:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 27:21" />Yomberi hakamtumbiri mtambika Eleazari, su yomberi hakamumaniziyi galii ganfira neni kwa kugalambuziya simbi mulibuwi lya Ulimu na Sumimu. Kwa njira ayi Eleazari hakamlonguziyi Yoshuwa pamuhera na shipinga shoseri sha wantu wa Israeli muvitwatira vyawu vyoseri vyawatenda.” <verse eid="NUM 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 27:22" />Musa katenditi gambira Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yakamlagaliriti. Su kamtoliti Yoshuwa na kumgolusiya kulongolu kwa mtambika Eleazari na wantu woseri sha Waisraeli. <verse eid="NUM 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 27:23" />Shakapanu kamtuliriti mawoku pamtuwi na kumpanana ulonguziwu ntambu yakalagalilitwi na Mtuwa Mlungu.<verse eid="NUM 27:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="NUM 28" />
  <para style="s">Tambiku za kila lishaka</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="EXO 29:38-46">Kulawa 29:38-46</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 28:1" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Musa, <verse eid="NUM 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 28:2" />guwalagaliri Waisraeli ntambu ayi. Mwenga hamundaviliri kwa shaka shakuwi tambiku zyazifiruwa. Viboga vya kulunguziya nakamu kwa motu, virii vyaviwera na ununkira uherepa. <verse eid="NUM 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 28:3" />Guwagambiri kuwera tambiku yawagenda kundavilira tambiku ya kulunguziya nakamu, su hayiweri hangu. Wana wa kondolu wawili wa shinja shimu yawahera shilema shoseri, kwajili ya tambiku ya kulunguziwa kila lishaka. <verse eid="NUM 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 28:4" />Mwana gwa kondolu yumu hakalaviwi mandawira na yumonga pamihi <verse eid="NUM 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 28:5" />na kila yumu hakalaviwi pamuhera na tambiku ya viboga ya kilu yimu ya ubumu uherepa yauhanganyikituwi pamuhera na lita yimu ya lipaki liherepa lya mzyetuni. <verse eid="NUM 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 28:6" />Ayi iwera tambiku yailaviwa kila lishaka yailunguziwa nakamu mumotu, tambiku ilii yailaviwituwiti kwa mala ya kwanja kulugongu lwa Sinayi gambira tambiku ya shiboga yaiwera na ununkira uherepa wa kumuherepeziya Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="NUM 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 28:7" />Tambiku ya shirandu yailaviwa na kila mumwanagwa kondolu hayiweri lita yimu ya divai. Gwenga Haguimiminiri tambiku ayi ya shirandu sha ujimbi pahala Pananagala. <verse eid="NUM 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 28:8" />Shaka sha pamihi hagumlaviyi mwana gwa kondolu ulii yumonga gambira tambiku ya viboga na gambira tambiku ya shirandu haguilaviyi gambira tambiku ya kulunguziwa nakamu, tambiku yaiwera na ununkira uherepa wa kumuherepeziya Mtuwa Mlungu.<verse eid="NUM 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tambika ya Lishaka lya Kwoyera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 28:9" />Lishaka lya Kwoyera, mwenga hamulaviyi tambiku ya wana kondolu wawili washipalu wa shinja shimu yawahera shilema, tambiku ya viboga ya kilu mbili za ubumu unama yauhanganyikituwiti na lipaki, na tambiku yakuyi ya virandu. <verse eid="NUM 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 28:10" />Tambiku ayi ya kulunguziwa hayilaviwi kila lishaka lya Kwoyera pota kuleka tambiku ya kila Lishaka pamuhera na tambiku yakuyi ya virandu.<verse eid="NUM 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tambiku za kila mwezi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 28:11" />Kila pakwanjira mwezi, hamumlaviliri Mtuwa Mlungu tambiku ya kulunguziwa nakamu, ng'ombi washipalu wawili yawakamala ndiri na kondolu gwashipalu yumu na wana wa kondolu washipalu saba wa shinja shimu, walii yawahera shilema. <verse eid="NUM 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 28:12" />Hamlaviyi tambiku ya viboga vya ubumu unama kilu tatu, yauhanganyikiwituwi na lipaki kwa kila ng'ombi yumu na hamulaviyi kilu mbili za ubumu kwa kila kondolu gwashipalu, <verse eid="NUM 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 28:13" />na kilu yimu ya ubumu kwa kila mwana gwa kondolu. Tambiku azi zyaziwera za kulunguziwa ndo tambiku ya shiboga yana ununkira wa kumuherepeziya Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="NUM 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 28:14" />Shipimu sha tambiku ya shilandu shashifiruwa hashiweri lita mbili za divayi kwa kila ng'ombi gwashipalu, lita nyimu na nusu kwa kila kondolu gwashipalu na lita yimu kwa kila mwana gwa kondolu. Ayi ndo tambiku ya kulunguziya nakamu kila mwezi mushinja shoseri. <verse eid="NUM 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 28:15" />Kayi hamumlaviliri Mtuwa Mlungu tambiku ya kuwusiya vidoda, hawalaviyi mbuzi gwashipalu yumu pota kuleka tambiku ya kulunguziwa ya kila lishaka na tambiku yakuyi ya virandu.<verse eid="NUM 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tambiku ya Pasaka</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LEV 23:5-14">Walawi 23:5-14</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 28:16" />Lishaka lya lilongu na msheshi mumwezi gwa kwanja, hayiweri Pasaka ya Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="NUM 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 28:17" />Lishaka lya lilongu na muhanu mumwezi gulaa agu hakuweri msambu gwa mabumunda yagalekeruwa ndiri simika. Kwa mashaka saba mwenga hamliyi mabumunda yagalekeluwa ndiri simika. <verse eid="NUM 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 28:18" />Mulishaka lya kwanja mumsambu agu, mwenga hamjojoniki kunguwira neni, mwenga mfiruwa ndiri kutenda mahengu goseri galii. <verse eid="NUM 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 28:19" />Mulishaka ali mwenga hamulaviyi tambiku ya kulunguziwa nakamu gambira tambiku ya shiboga kwa Mtuwa Mlungu. Hamlaviyi tambiku ya wang'ombi washipalu wawili yawakamala ndiri na kondolu gwashipalu yumu na wana wa kondolu washipalu saba wa shinja shimu, woseri waweri wahera shilema. <verse eid="NUM 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 28:20" />Tambiku ya viboga yailaviwa pamuhera na tambiku zyamonga, hayiweri tambiku ya ubumu uherepa yauhanganyiwituwi na lipaki, kilu ndatu kwa kila ng'ombi gwashipalu na kilu mbili kwa kila kondolu gwashipalu, <verse eid="NUM 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 28:21" />kilu yimu kwa kila yumu gwa wana wa kondolu walii saba. <verse eid="NUM 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 28:22" />Hamlaviyi viraa mbuzi pongu yumu kuwera tambiku ya kuwusiya vidoda su muwuziwi kwa Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="NUM 28:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 28:23" />Hamlaviyi vintu avi pota kuleka tambiku ya kulunguziwa nakamu gambira tambiku zyamonga zyazilaviwa kila mandawira. <verse eid="NUM 28:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 28:24" />Kwa njira ayi mtandiri shiboga kwajili ya tambiku ya kulunguziwa nakamu kila lishaka kwa mashaka saba kuwera tambiku yaiwera na ununkira uherepa wa kumuherepeziya Mtuwa Mlungu. Tambiku ayi hamuilaviyi pota kuleka tambiku ilii ya kulunguziwa nakamu kila lishaka pamuhera na tambika yakuyi ya virandu. <verse eid="NUM 28:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 28:25" />Mulishaka lya saba mumsambu, mwenga hamujojoniki pamuhera kunguwira neni, mwenga mfiruwa ndiri kutenda lihengu lyoseri.<verse eid="NUM 28:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tambiku ya msambu gwa mabenu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LEV 23:15-22">Walawi 23:15-22</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 28:26" />Mulishaka lya kwanja lya msambu gwa mabenu, mwenga pamumlavilira Mtuwa Mlungu mabenu gasyai ga viboga vyenu, mwenga hamujojoniki kunguwira neni, namtenda lihengu lyoseri. <verse eid="NUM 28:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 28:27" />Hamlaviyi tambiku ya kulunguziwa nakamu, wang'ombi washipalu wawili yawakamala ndiri nentu na kondolu gwashipalu yumu na wakondolu washipalu saba wa shinja shimu, woseri waweri wahera shilema. <verse eid="NUM 28:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 28:28" />Tambiku ya viboga hailaviwi pamuhera na ubumu uherepa yauhanganyikituwi lipaki kilu tatu kwa kila ng'ombi, na kilu mbili kwa kila kondolu gwashipalu, <verse eid="NUM 28:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 28:29" />na kilu yimu kwa kila mwana gwa kondolu. <verse eid="NUM 28:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 28:30" />Mwenga hamulaviyi viraa mbuzi gwashipalu yumu kuwera tambiku ya kuwusiya vidoda su kumbuyira neni. <verse eid="NUM 28:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 28:31" />Hamulaviyi vintu avi pota kuleka tambiku ya kulunguziwa gambira tambiku zyamonga pamuhera na tambiku yakuyi ya virandu.<verse eid="NUM 28:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="NUM 29" />
  <para style="s">Tambiku kwajili ya msambu gwa shinja sha syayi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LEV 23:23-25">Walawi 23:23-25</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 29:1" />Lishaka lya kwanja lya mwezi gwa saba, hamjojoniki kunguwira neni. Namutenda mahengu, toziya ayi ndo lishaka lya kugomba mbalapi. <verse eid="NUM 29:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 29:2" />Hamlaviyi tambiku ya kulunguziwa nakamu, su hakuweri na ununkira uherepa wa kumuherepeziya Mtuwa Mlungu. Hawalaviyi wang'ombi washipalu wawili yawakama ndiri nentu na wakondolu washipalu wawili na wana wa kondolu washipalu saba wa shinja shimu. Woseri waweri wahera ndiri shilema. <verse eid="NUM 29:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 29:3" />Hamlaviyi viraa tambika yakuyi ya viboga vya ubumu uherepa wawuhanganyituwi na lipaki. Kilu ntatu kwa kila pongu, kilu mbili kwa kila kondolu. <verse eid="NUM 29:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 29:4" />Na kilu yimu kwa kila mwana kondolu. <verse eid="NUM 29:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 29:5" />Kayi hamlavii pongu yumu kwa tambika ya kuwusiya vidoda su kuwatendera wantu wambuyiri. <verse eid="NUM 29:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 29:6" />Hamlaviyi vintu avi pota kuleka tambera ya tambika ya kulunguziwa ya mwezi gwa syayi na tambika yakuyi ya viboga na tambika yakuyi ya kila lishaka lya kulunguziwa pamuhera na tambika ya viboga na tambika yakuyi ya kulanda ntambu yaifiruwa kwa nunkira iherepa, ndo tambika kwa Mtuwa Mlungu yailunguziwitwi kwa motu.<verse eid="NUM 29:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malaviwu ga lishaka lya kukolaniziwa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LEV 23:26-32">Walawi 23:26-32</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 29:7" />Lishaka lya lilongu lya mweni gwa saba hamtendi kuliwona kunanagala. Mulishaka ali mwoyi kuliya shintu, viraa namtenda mahengu. <verse eid="NUM 29:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 29:8" />Hamumlaviliri Mtuwa Mlungu tambiku ya kulunguziwa nakamu kwa motu, su hayiweri na ununkira wa kumuherepeziya Mtuwa Mlungu. Tambiku ayi hayiweri ya ng'ombi gwashilau yumu yakakamala ndiri nentu na kondolu gwashipalu yumu na wana wa kondolu saba wa shinja shimu. Woseri waweri wahera shilema. <verse eid="NUM 29:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 29:9" />Pamuhera na vintu avi, mwenga hamulaviyi tambiku ya ubumu uherepa yauhanganyikituwiti lipaki kilu ntatu pamuhera na ng'ombi, kilu mbili pamuhera na kondolu gwashipalu ulii. <verse eid="NUM 29:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 29:10" />Kilu yimu kwa kila mwana gwa kondolu. <verse eid="NUM 29:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 29:11" />Hamalaviyi viraa mbuzi pongu yumu kuwera tambiku ya kuwusiya vidoda pota kuleka tambiku ya kukolaniziya, pamuhera na tambiku zilii zyazilaviwa kuwera tambiku za kulunguziwa nakamu na tambiku yakuyi ya viboga na tambiku yakuyi ya virandu.<verse eid="NUM 29:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tambiku ya msambu gwa visasa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LEV 23:33-43">Walawi 23:33-43</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 29:12" />Lishaka lya lilongu na mhanu ya mwezi gwa saba, hamliwoni kuliwona kunanagala. Hapeni mtendi lihengu lishaka ali. Hamtendi sikukuwi kwajili ya Mtuwa Mlungu kwa mashaka saba. <verse eid="NUM 29:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 29:13" />Hamalavii tambika ya kulunguziya kwa motu, yaiwera nunkira yakumfiriziya Mtuwa Mlungu. Ponga wana wangali kukamala lilongu na watatu, kondolu washipalu wawili, wanakondolu lilongu na msheshi awa shinja shimu, woseri waweri pota shilema. <verse eid="NUM 29:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 29:14" />Tambiku yayifira kugenda pamuhera hayiweri ubumu uherepa yawuhanganyituwi na lipaki. Kilu ntatu kwa kila pongu kilu mbili kwa kila kondolu. <verse eid="NUM 29:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 29:15" />Na kilu yimu kwa kila mwana kondolu. <verse eid="NUM 29:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 29:16" />Hamlavii viraa pongu yumu kwa shinja sha kuwusiya vidoda, tembera ya tambika ilii ya ntambiku ilii ntambu iraa ya kulunguziwa, pamuhera na tambika yakuyi ya viboga na tambika yakuyi ya virandu.<verse eid="NUM 29:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 29:17" />Lishaka lya pili hamlavii. Pongu yawakamala ndiri lilongu na wawili, kondolu shapalu wawili, wanakondolu shipalu lilongu na msheshi, wa shinja yawahera shilema. <verse eid="NUM 29:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 29:18" />Mlaviyi viraa tambiku ya viboga na tambiku ya virandu pamuhera wang'ombi walii, kondolu na wanakondolu, kulawirana na walanga yawu ntambu yailagaliritwi. <verse eid="NUM 29:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 29:19" />Hamlavii viraa pongu yumu kuwera tambika ya kuwusiya vidoda, tembera ya tambika ya kulunguziwa na gambira tambiku zimonga pamuhera na tambiku yakuyi ya viboga na tambiku yakuyi ya virandu.<verse eid="NUM 29:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 29:20" />Lishaka lya tatu hamlavii. Pongu lilongu na yumu, kondolu wawili, wanakondolu lilongu na msheshi wa shaka shimu, wahera dosali. <verse eid="NUM 29:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 29:21" />Hamuwalaviliri pamuhera na tambika ya viboga na tambika ya kulanda ntambu yaifirutuwi kulinganira na walanga yawu ntambu yailagaliritwi. <verse eid="NUM 29:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 29:22" />Viraa hamalaviyi pongu yumu kwa tambika ya kuwusiya vidoda, tembera na ilii tambika ya kila lishaka ya kulunguziwa pamuhera na tambika yakuyi ya virandu.<verse eid="NUM 29:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 29:23" />Lishaka lya msheshi hamalaviyi wang'ombi lilongu na wakondolu washipalu wawili na wanakondolu lilongu na msheshi, woseri waweri wahera dosari. <verse eid="NUM 29:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 29:24" />Hamlavii viraa tambika ya viboga na tambikua ya kulanda na awa pongu na kondolu na wanakondolu kulinganira na walanga yawu, ntambu yaifiruwa. <verse eid="NUM 29:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 29:25" />Mlaviyi viraa pongu yumu kwa tambika ya kuwisiya vidoda tembera ya tambika ya kila lishaka ya kulunguziwa nakamu na tambiku yakuyi ya viboga na tambiku yakuyi ya virandu.<verse eid="NUM 29:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 29:26" />Lishaka lya muhanu, hamlaviyi wang'ombi tisa na kondolu wawili, wanakondolu washipalu lilongu na msheshi wa shinja shimu yawahera dosari. <verse eid="NUM 29:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 29:27" />Viraa hamlaviyi tambiku ya viboga na tambiku ya kulanda pamuhera na wang'ombi na kondolu ulii na wanakondolu kulinganira na walanga yawu ntambu yaifiruwa. <verse eid="NUM 29:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 29:28" />Hamlaviyi viraa pongu yumu kwa tambiku ya kuwusiya vidoda, tembera ya tambiku ya kila lishaka ya kulunguziwa nakamu, pamuhera na tambiku yakuyi ya viboga na tambiku yakuyi ya virandu.<verse eid="NUM 29:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 29:29" />Lishaka lya sita hamlaviyi ng'ombi wanani, kondolu shipalu wawili, wanakondolu shipalu lilongu na msheshi wa shinja shimu wahera shilema. <verse eid="NUM 29:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 29:30" />Hamlaviyi viraa tambika ya viboga na tambika za vyakulanda pamuhera na ng'ombi, kondolu shipalu kulinganira na walanga yawu, ntambu yaifiruwa. <verse eid="NUM 29:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 29:31" />Hamlavii viraa pongu yumu kuwera tambika ya kuwusiya vidoda, pamuhera na tambika yakuyi ya viboga na tambiku za virandu.<verse eid="NUM 29:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 29:32" />Lishaka lya saba hamlaviyi ng'ombi saba, kondolu shipalu wawili, wanakondolu shipalu lilongu na msheshi wa shinja shimu wahera dosali. <verse eid="NUM 29:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 29:33" />Hamlaviyi viraa tambika ya viboga na tambika ya vyakulanda pamuhela na ng'ombi, kondolu shipalu na wanakondolu, kulinganira na walanga yawu ntambi yaifiruwa. <verse eid="NUM 29:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 29:34" />Hamlaviyi viraa pongu yumu kuwera tambika ya kuwusiya vidoda, tembera ya tambiku ya kila lishaka ya kulungiziwa nakamu, pamuhera na tambiku yakuyi ya viboga na tambiku yakuyi ya virandu.<verse eid="NUM 29:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 29:35" />Mulishaka lya nani mwenga hamunguwira neni. Namtenda lihengu lishaka ali. <verse eid="NUM 29:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 29:36" />Hamlavii tambika ya kulunguziwa yaiwera na kununkira iherepa kwa kumherepeziya Mtuwa Mlungu. Ng'ombi yumu, kondolu shipalu yumu, na wanakondolu shipalu saba wa shinja shimu wahera shilema. <verse eid="NUM 29:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 29:37" />Hamlaviyi viraa tambika ya viboga na tambika ya virandu pamuhera na ng'ombi ayu, kondolu shipalu na mwanakondolu kulinganira na walanga yawu ntambu yailagaliritwi. <verse eid="NUM 29:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 29:38" />Viraa hamlaviyi pongu yumu kwa tambika ya kuwusiya vidoda, tembera ya tambiku ya kila lishaka ya kulunguziwa nakamu na tambiku yakuyi ya viboga na tambiku ya virandu.<verse eid="NUM 29:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 29:39" />Aga ndo malagizu ga tambiku za kila msambu ntambu yailagalirutuwi. Pota kuliwaluwa tambiku za nazili na tambiku ya kulunguziwa nakamu, na tambiku za viboga na tambiku virandu na tambiku za ponga na tambiku ya kufira gamweni zyamgenda kumlavilira Mtuwa Mlungu. Mushipindi sha misambu yenu ntambu yaitulituwiti.<verse eid="NUM 29:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 29:40" />Su, Musa kawagambiriti Waisraeli kila shintu Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yakamlagaliriti.<verse eid="NUM 29:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="NUM 30" />
  <para style="s">Malagizu kuusu lagiru lya gweka kwa Mtuwa Mlungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 30:1" />“Shakapanu Musa kayoweriti na wakulu wa makabila ga Israeli, kawagambiriti, ashi do shisoweru shakalagalirituwiti na Mtuwa Mlungu.<verse eid="NUM 30:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 30:2" />Mumtu pakatula naziri yakuyi kwa Mtuwa Mlungu ama pakalagila kwa shirapu na kulitawa mweni kwa lagiru yakuyi, yomberi kafiruwa katendi shilii shakalagiliti na katendi goseri gakalagiliriti kwa visoweru vyakuyi.<verse eid="NUM 30:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 30:3" />Muhinga yakankali kankulikala ukaya kwa tati gwakuyi pakatula naziri yakuyi kwa Mtuwa Mlungu na kulitawa mweni kwa lagiru ali, <verse eid="NUM 30:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 30:4" />na tati gwakuyi papikanira lagiru lilii, nakamlewelera, su naziri zakuwi zakatuliti hazimbani na kila zakatuliti hazimbani na kila lagiru yakalaviyiti haimubani. <verse eid="NUM 30:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 30:5" />Kumbiti tati gwakuyi pakapikanira kuusu naziri ayi na lagira ayi pakamlewelera, su shilii shashilagilituwiti na muhinga ulii hapeni shilaviwi. Mtuwa Mlungu hakamlegiziyi toziya tati gwakuyi kashilewelera shitwatira shilii.<verse eid="NUM 30:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 30:6" />Paiwera muhinga pakayuguwa pa kutula naziri na lagiru ama kulagila pota ya kulihola kwanja, na yomberi kalitawa mweni, <verse eid="NUM 30:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 30:7" />shakapanu mpalu gwakuyi pakapikanira shitwatira shilii nakamlewelera, su yomberi hakalaviyi lagira zakuyi. <verse eid="NUM 30:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 30:8" />Kumbiti mpalu gwakuyi pakapikanira shitwatira shilii na kumlewelera, su mpalu gwakuyi hakaliwusiyi lilagilu lya mdala gwakuyi na shilii shakalagiliriti pota kulihola, su Mtuwa Mlungu hakamlegeziyi.<verse eid="NUM 30:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 30:9" />Kumbiti naziri na lagira ama shilii shashilagilituwiti na mawu mkenja ama mdala yakalekituwiti na mpalu gwaku, galii hagamtawi na kafiruwiti kalaviyi shakalagiliriti. <verse eid="NUM 30:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 30:10" />Mdala yakayugituwiti pakalaviya naziri na lagira yakuyi ama pakalagila kwa shirapu uganu pakawera ukaya kwa mpalu gwaku, <verse eid="NUM 30:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 30:11" />shakapanu mpalu gwakuyi pakashipikanira shitwatira ashi kumbiti katakuliti ndiri shintu shoseri na kumlewelera. Su virii vyakalagiliriti hakafiruwi kuvitenda. <verse eid="NUM 30:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 30:12" />Kumbiti handa mpalu gwakuyi pakapikanira visoweru vyakuyi, pakawusiya naziri na lagira lilii, Mtuwa Mlungu hakamlegeziyi yomberi kwa shilii shakalagiliriti. <verse eid="NUM 30:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 30:13" />Mpalu gwakuyi kaweza kujimira ama kubela shilii shashilagilituwiti na mdala ulii. <verse eid="NUM 30:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 30:14" />Kumbiti payiwera mpalu gwakuyi pakatakula ndiri shoseri kwanjira pakapikaniriti visoweru vya naziri na lagira ama vyavilagilituwiti na mdala gwakuyi, su yomberi hakaweri kalijimira lilagilu lilii lishaka ali pakapatiti visoweru vyakuyi toziya kalongiti ndiri shoseri. <verse eid="NUM 30:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 30:15" />Kumbiti pakaziwusiya shaka pa kupikanira visoweru vyakuyi, su mpalu ulii hakazibiwi kwa likosa lya mdala gwakuyi.”<verse eid="NUM 30:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 30:16" />Aga ndo nazili na malagira zeni Mtuwa Mlungu kamlagaliriti Musa kuusu kulikolerana kwa mpalu na mdala gwakuyi, tati na muhinga gwakuyi pakawera kankali kakulikala mnumba mwakuyi.<verse eid="NUM 30:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="NUM 31" />
  <para style="s">Waisraeli wankulikomanga na Wamidiyani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 31:1" />Mtuwa kamgambiriti Musa, kamgambira, <verse eid="NUM 31:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 31:2" />“Guwawuziliri Wamidiani vitwatira vyawawatendiriti Waisraeli, shakapanu gwenga haguhowi.” <verse eid="NUM 31:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 31:3" />Su, Musa kayowera na wantu kawagambira, “Muwatandi wantu kwa ngondu wagendi kuwakomanga Wamidiani kuwawuzilira Waisraeli kwajili ya Mlungu. <verse eid="NUM 31:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 31:4" />Kulawa kila likabila lya Israeli, hamjegi wantu elufu yimu kung'ondu.” <verse eid="NUM 31:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 31:5" />Su, wantu elufu yimu yawalaviyitwi kulawa kila likabila muwamu mwa maelufu ga wantu wa Waisraeli, Wapalu woseri lilongu na wawili elufu waweri kala kwajili ya nkondu. <verse eid="NUM 31:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 31:6" />Musa kawajegiti wantu kunkondu pasi pa ulonguziya wa Finehasi mwana gwa mtambika Eliiazari. Pakawera na vyombu vya pahala pananagala na talumbeta za lirangaliru. <verse eid="NUM 31:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 31:7" />Wawakomangi wantu wa isi ya Midiani, handa Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yakamlagaliriti Musa, wawalanga wantu woseri. <verse eid="NUM 31:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 31:8" />Muwamu mwa wantu wawalagitwi, kuweriti wafalumi wamhanu wa Midiani. Evi na Rekemu na Suri na Huri na Reba. Viraa wamlagiti Balamu mwana gwa Beori.<verse eid="NUM 31:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 31:9" />Waisraeli wawabatiti kwa makakala wantu wa Midiyani wadala pamuhera na wana wauwu na kutola wang'ombi na wakondolu pamuhera na lunda zawu zoseri. <verse eid="NUM 31:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 31:10" />Womberi wayilunguziyiti motu miji yawu na numba zawu na kambi zawu zoseri. <verse eid="NUM 31:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 31:11" />Watoliti vintu vyoseri vyavitolitwi kwa makakala munkondu, wantu pamuhera na wankanyama, <verse eid="NUM 31:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 31:12" />wamjegeriti Musa na Eleazari na shipinga shoseri yawaweriti mukambi muisi ya lulalanda lwa Mowabu, kumwambu kwa Yoridani pakwegera na Yeriku.<verse eid="NUM 31:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuwuya kulawa munkondu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 31:13" />Musa na mtambika Eleazari pamuhera na wakulu wa shipinga sha wantu wa Israeli walawiti mukambi, womberi wagenditi kuwawanka wamashonta. <verse eid="NUM 31:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 31:14" />Musa kakalaziwitwi na wakulu wa nkondu na wakulu wa mashonta yawalonguziyiti vipinga vya wamashonta elufu yimu na wakulu wa mashonta mamiya ga wamashonta yawalonguziyitwi kulawa munkondu. <verse eid="NUM 31:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 31:15" />Musa kakosiya, “Iwera hashi muwaleka wadala awa woseri pawawera wakomu?” <verse eid="NUM 31:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 31:16" />“Muliholi kuwera wadala awa ndo yawafatiti visoweru vya Balaamu, wawatenditi Waisraeli wamlemi Mtuwa Mlungu kuli Peori ata malweli madoda gawizira wantu wakuyi Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="NUM 31:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 31:17" />Su muwalagi wana woseri wapalu na kila mdala yakagonjiti na mpalu. <verse eid="NUM 31:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 31:18" />Kumbiti namuwalaga wahinga woseri, hawenigonji na wapalu, muwaleki walikali kwajili yamwenga. <verse eid="NUM 31:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 31:19" />Woseri walii yawawera pakati penu, walii yawalagiti muntu ama kushinkula mitugulu, su wafiruwa walikali kukambi kwa mashaka saba. Mulipungi mulishaka lya saba, mwenga pamuhera wantu yawabatitwi kwa makakala. <verse eid="NUM 31:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 31:20" />Viraa mpungi kila nguwu na kila shintu sashinyawitwi kwa lukuli na kwa mibayila ya wakondolu ama vintu vyavinyawitwi kwa mitera.”<verse eid="NUM 31:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 31:21" />Mtambika Eleazari kawagambiriti wapalu yawawuyiti kulawa munkondu, “Ali ndo lilagaliru Mtuwa Mlungu lyakamlagaliriti Musa. <verse eid="NUM 31:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 31:22" />Zahabu na madini ga feza na madini ga shaba na madini ga shuma na madini ga bati na madini ga lisasi, <verse eid="NUM 31:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 31:23" />vintu vyoseri vyavivumiliya motu, havitakasiwi kwa kupitiziwa mumotu. Ata hangu, ndo mpaka vitakasiwi kwa mashi ga kutakasiya. Vintu vimonga vyoseri viweza ndiri kuvumiliya motu havitakasiwi kwa mashi ga kutakasiya. <verse eid="NUM 31:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 31:24" />Lishaka lya saba ndo mpaka mziputi nguwu zyenu, ndo pamuhera mherepa na kujimiruwa kwingira kukambi.”<verse eid="NUM 31:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kubagulilana wantu na vintu vyawatoliti kunkondu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 31:25" />Mtuwa Mlungu kayowera na Musa, kamgambira, <verse eid="NUM 31:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 31:26" />“Gwenga na mtambika Eleazari, pamuhera na wakulu wa wantu wa Waisraeli, muwalangi lopola ya vintu, wantu na wankanyama. <verse eid="NUM 31:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 31:27" />Mbagulirani lopola mafungu mawili, lifungi limu lya mashonta yawagenditi kungondu na fungu limonga kwajili ya wantu woseri. <verse eid="NUM 31:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 31:28" />Shakapanu kulawirana na lifungu lilii lya mashonta yawagenditi kunkondu, gutuligweka tambika kwajili ya Mtuwa Mlungu. Kila yumu kulawa kila vintu miya mhanu, iweri ndo wantu ama ng'ombi na punda na kondolu ama mbuzi, <verse eid="NUM 31:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 31:29" />Gumpananani vintu avi Eleazari kuwera lifupu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="NUM 31:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 31:30" />Kulawa lifungu lilii lya wantu woseri, kila shikundi sha vintu malongu mhamu gutoli shimu, iweri ndo wantu, ngombi, punda, kondolu na mbuzi. Avi haguwapanani wantu wa Walawi weni wana lihengu lya utenderu Kuliringu Linanagala lya Mtuwa Mlungu.” <verse eid="NUM 31:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 31:31" />Musa na mtambika Eleazari watenditi handa Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yakamlagaliriti Musa.<verse eid="NUM 31:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 31:32" />Lopola zawapatiti mashonta ziweriti, Kondolu na Mbuzi waweriti laki sita na malongu saba na mhanu elufu, <verse eid="NUM 31:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 31:33" />Ngo'mbi malongu saba na mbili elufu, <verse eid="NUM 31:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 31:34" />Punda malongu sita na yimu elufu, <verse eid="NUM 31:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 31:35" />na wahinga yawaweriti wagonja ndiri na mpalu malongu matatu na mbili elufu. <verse eid="NUM 31:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 31:36" />Nusu yakuyi, semu yeni wawabaguliriti mashonta wawagenditi kunkondu, iweriti Kondolu na Mbuzi laki tatu malongu matatu na saba elufu na miya mhanu, <verse eid="NUM 31:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 31:37" />muawa miya sita malongu saba na mhanu yawalaviyiti kwa Mtuwa. <verse eid="NUM 31:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 31:38" />Ng'ombi wa mashonta waweriti malongu matatu na sita elufu, na muawa malongu saba na mbili wawalaviwiti tambika kwa Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="NUM 31:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 31:39" />Punda wawu waweriti malongu elufu miya mhanu, na muawa malongu sita na yimu wawalaviwiti tambika kwa Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="NUM 31:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 31:40" />Wahinga waweriti elufu lilongu na sita, na muawa semu ya Mtuwa Mlungu iweriti ndo wantu malongu matatu na mbili. <verse eid="NUM 31:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 31:41" />Su, Musa kampanana mtambika Eleazari tambika ayi yayilaviwitwi kwa Mtuwa Mlungu, handa Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yakamlagaliriti Musa.<verse eid="NUM 31:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 31:42" />Lifungu lilii lyawapananitwi Waisraeli, ndo sawa na lifungu lya wantu yawagenditi kungondu, <verse eid="NUM 31:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 31:43" />iweriti Kondolu na Mbuzi miya tatu na malongu matatu na saba elufu na miya mhanu, <verse eid="NUM 31:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 31:44" />na ng'ombi malongu matatu na elufu sita, <verse eid="NUM 31:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 31:45" />punda malongu matatu elufu na miya mhanu, <verse eid="NUM 31:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 31:46" />na wantu lilongu na sita elufu. <verse eid="NUM 31:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 31:47" />Kulawa lifungu ali lyawapanananitwi Waisraeli, Musa katoliti yumu pakati pa kila lopola malongu mhanu wankanyama malongu muhanu, ntambu yakalagaliritwi na Mtuwa Mlungu, kawapanana wantu wa Lawi weni watenditi lihengu kuliringu lya Mtuwa Mlungu.<verse eid="NUM 31:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 31:48" />Shakapanu wakulu woseri wamashonta kwa pamuhera wamugenderiti Musa, <verse eid="NUM 31:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 31:49" />na wamgambira, “twenga wantumintumi waku tuwawalanga mashonta woseri yawawera pasi petu na tuwona handa kwahera hata yumu gwawu kawuya ndiri kulawa kunkondu. <verse eid="NUM 31:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 31:50" />Su, tujega vyombu vya zahabu, vikuku, bangili, peti za mhuli, vipuli na sanga zeni kila muntu kapatiti. Tulaviyiti avi kwajili ya kulonga mayagashii Mtuwa Mlungu kwajili ya makaliru getu.” <verse eid="NUM 31:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="NUM 31:51" />Musa na mtambika Eleazari wayanga vintu vyoseri vyavilembitwi na zahabu. <verse eid="NUM 31:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="NUM 31:52" />Walanga ya zahabu yoseri yawamlaviliriti Mtuwa Mlungu iweriti handa kilu miya mbili, <verse eid="NUM 31:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="NUM 31:53" />kila shonta kalitoliriti vintu vyakalopoliti mweni. <verse eid="NUM 31:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="NUM 31:54" />Su, Musa na mtambika Eleazari wayiwankiti zahabu ilii kulawa kwa makamanda waijega Muliringu lya kuliwona, iweri liholuziwu kwa Waisraeli kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu handa kawalolera.<verse eid="NUM 31:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="NUM 32" />
  <para style="s">Makabila ga kwagulawa mshenji mwa Yoridani</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="DEU 3:12-22">Liholu 3:12-22</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 32:1" />Makabila ga Rubeni na Gadi gaweriti na mifugu ivuwa nentu. Womberi pawawoniti kuwera enewu lya Yazeri na Gadi lifaa kwa kuiliyiziya mifugu, <verse eid="NUM 32:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 32:2" />Wawagendiriti Musa, mtambika Eleazari na wakulu wa shipinga, wawagambira, <verse eid="NUM 32:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 32:3" />“Miji ya Ataroti na Diboni na Yazeri na Nimra na Heshiboni na Eleali na Sebamu na Nebu na Beoni. <verse eid="NUM 32:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 32:4" />Isi yeni Mtuwa Mlungu kawatangiti Waisraeli kukanka, ndo isi iherepa kwa kuyiliziya mifugu na twenga twanayu mifugu ivuwa nentu. <verse eid="NUM 32:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 32:5" />Handa pamutujimira tuwaluwa mtupananani isi ayi iweri uhala watwenga namtulosiya kumwambu kulushemba Yoridani kulikala aku.”<verse eid="NUM 32:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 32:6" />Musa kawagambira Wantu wa makabila ga Reubeni na “Hashi, mfira kusigala panu aku walongu wenu Waisraeli wankugenda kungondu? <verse eid="NUM 32:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 32:7" />Iwera hashi muwawuziya kumbeli wantu wa Israeli nawagenda muisi yeni Mtuwa Mlungu kawapanana? <verse eid="NUM 32:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 32:8" />Hangu ndo ntambu yawatenditi watati wenu paniwatumiti kulawa Kadeshi barineya kuyilolalola isi ilii. <verse eid="NUM 32:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 32:9" />Walolalola weri awa wagenditi mpaka lushi lwa Eshikoli wayiwona isi kumbiti pawawuyiti wawawuziyiti kumbeli wantu wa Israeli su nawayingira muisi yakawapanananiti Mtuwa Mlungu. <verse eid="NUM 32:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 32:10" />Mtuwa Mlungu kaweriti na maya lishaka lilii, kalirapiriti pakalonga. <verse eid="NUM 32:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 32:11" />Toziya wanjimiriti ndiri kwa moyu gwawu goseri, nakaka kwahera muntu yoseri pakati pa wantu yawalawiti muisi ya Misri yakaweriti na vinja malongu mawili na kwendeleya, yakagenda kwingira muisi yanuwalagiliriti kuwapanana Abrahamu na Isaka na Yakobu. <verse eid="NUM 32:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 32:12" />Woseri hapeni wingiri muisi ayi, kumbiti Karebu mwana gwa Yefune wa lukolu lwa Kenizi na Yoshuwa mwana gwa Nuni, toziya womberi wanjimiriti kwa moyu gwawu goseri. <verse eid="NUM 32:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 32:13" />Mtuwa Mlungu kakalaliti kuusu wantu wa Israeli kawatenda wayeliyeli kushiwala kwa shaka sha vinja malongu msheshi, shiyiwuku shoseri shashiweriti shitenda ukondola kulongulu kwakuyi shihowiti. <verse eid="NUM 32:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 32:14" />Vinu mwenga shiyiwuku sha wantu yawawera na vidoda, mlawira pahala pa wazewi wenu kwongera kayi maya nkulu ya Mtuwa Mlungu kuusu Waisraeli. <verse eid="NUM 32:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 32:15" />Handa mwenga pamlema kumfata, yomberi hakawalekani kayi kushiwala, mwenga hamuwatendi wantu woseri awa wahowi.”<verse eid="NUM 32:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 32:16" />Su wantu wa likabila lya Rubeni na Gadi wamgenderiti Musa, wamgambiriti, “Gutulekiziyi tuwanyawiri wakondolu wetu maboma na wana wetu miji panu. <verse eid="NUM 32:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 32:17" />Kumbiti twaweni twenga hatuweri kala kugenda munkondu pamuhera na walongu wetu Waisraeli, viraa hatuweri musitali gwa kulongolu munkondu mpaka tutendi wasoki pahala pawagenda kulikala. Shaka ashi wana wetu hawalikali mumiji yaiwera na boma, su kulilolera na wenikaya wa isi hii. <verse eid="NUM 32:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 32:18" />Hapeni tuwuyi ukaya mpaka Waisraeli wamonga woseri wahali pahala pawu pawabagulitwi. <verse eid="NUM 32:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 32:19" />Kumbiti hapeni tuhali shintu shoseri kumwambu kwa Yoridani toziya twenga tupata pahala petu panu kwagulawa mshenji kulushemba Yoridani.”<verse eid="NUM 32:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 32:20" />Musa kawagambiriti, “Handa nakaka hamtendi ntambu yamtakuliti, su palaa panu kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu, mtoli migoha yenu kugenda munkondu. <verse eid="NUM 32:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 32:21" />Kila mjangila gwenu hakaloki lushemba Yoridani uganu pamuhera pasi pa ulonguziya wa Mtuwa Mlungu, hamuwakomangi wangondu wenu, Mtuwa Mlungu kawatangi mpaka kawakanki, <verse eid="NUM 32:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 32:22" />na kuitola isi. Pamtenda aga, muwuyi toziya hamuweri mulitenda lihengu lyenu kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu na kwajili ya walongu wenu Waisraeli. Shakapanu Mtuwa Mlungu hakaijimiri isi ayi ya kwagulawa mshenji mwa Yoridani kuwera isi yenu. <verse eid="NUM 32:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 32:23" />Kumbiti niwaberiziya kuwera pamulaviya ndiri shilii shamulagiliti, mwenga hamumtendi vidoda kulongolu kwa Mtuwa Mlungu, viraa muvimani kuwera hamwazibiwi. <verse eid="NUM 32:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 32:24" />Muwanyawili wana wenu miji na wakondolu wenu maboma, kumbiti mtendi ntambu yamulagiliti.”<verse eid="NUM 32:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 32:25" />Shakapanu, wantu wa Gadi na wa Rubeni wamgambira Musa, “Twenga wantumintumi waku hatutendi ntambu yagutulagalira. <verse eid="NUM 32:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 32:26" />Wadala wetu na wana wetu na wakondolu na wang'ombi, hawasigali panu mumiji ya Gileadi. <verse eid="NUM 32:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 32:27" />Kumbiti twenga wantumintumi waku tuwera kala kugenda kungondu pasi pa ulonguziya wa Mtuwa Mlungu. Hatuloki lushemba Yoridani na kulikomanga ngondu ntambu yagutakula.”<verse eid="NUM 32:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 32:28" />Su Musa kalagalira ntambu ayi kwa mtambika Eleazari, na kwa Yoshua mwana wa Nuni kwa wakulu wa shikundi sha makabila ga Waisraeli. <verse eid="NUM 32:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 32:29" />“Paiwera wantu wa Gadi na wa Rubeni hawaloki lushemba Yoridani pamuhera na mwenga, kuwera kala kugenda munkondu pawalonguziwa na Mtuwa Mlungu, na myikanga na kuyitola isi ya Gileadi iweri isi yawu. <verse eid="NUM 32:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 32:30" />Kumbiti handa hapeni waloki lushemba Yoridani pamuhera na mwenga na kugenda kulikomanga ngondu, su hawatoli semu ya isi ya kanani pamuhera na mwenga yamuwera uwega wa kwaguzyeta mshenji.” <verse eid="NUM 32:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 32:31" />Wantu wa Gadi na wa Rubeni wankula, “Mtuwa, twenga hatutendi handa Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yakatugambiliti twenga wantumintumi waku. <verse eid="NUM 32:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 32:32" />Pasi pa ulongiziya wa Mtuwa Mlungu hatuloki kugenda kulikomanga ngondu mpaka muisi ya Kanaani, kumbiti uhala wetu hawuweri uwega awu kwagulawa mshenji mwa Yoridani hayiweri yatwenga.”<verse eid="NUM 32:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 32:33" />Su Musa kawapanana wantu wa likabila lya Gadi na Rubeni na nusu ya likabila la Manase mwana gwa Yusufu, isi yoseri ya mfalumi Sihoni gwa Waamori na isi ya mfalumi Ogu gwa Bashani pamuhera na miji na isi zyazizyengikiti miji ayi. <verse eid="NUM 32:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 32:34" />Likabila lya Rubeni ndo linyawa kayi miji ya Diboni na Ataroti na Aroeli, <verse eid="NUM 32:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 32:35" />Atroti Shofani na Yazeri na Yogibeha. <verse eid="NUM 32:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 32:36" />Betinimra na Betiharani. Miji ayi iweriti na shibambaza na maboma ga wakondolu. <verse eid="NUM 32:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 32:37" />Likabila lya Rubeni linyawiti kayi miji ya Heshiboni na Eleale na Kiriataimu, <verse eid="NUM 32:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 32:38" />na Nebu na Baali Meoni na Sibima. Miji yawayinyawiti kayi wayipananiti matawu gamonga.<verse eid="NUM 32:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 32:39" />Wiwuka wa Makiri, mwana gwa Manasi, wayikomangiti isi ya Gileadi, wayitola isi ayi na kuwawinga Waamori yawaweriti walikala amu. <verse eid="NUM 32:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 32:40" />Hangu, Musa kawapanana wantu wa lukolu lwa Makili mwana gwa Manasi, Isi ya Gileadi na womberi walikala amu. <verse eid="NUM 32:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 32:41" />Lukolu lwa Yaili mwana gwa Manasi, wavikomiti vijiji vivuwa vya Gileadi na kuvitola kwa makakala na wavipananiti matawu vijiji vya Hawoti yaili. <verse eid="NUM 32:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 32:42" />Na lukolu lwa Noba ligenditi kugukomanga mji gwa Kenati pamuhera vya vijiji vyakuyi, su kagushemiti mji agu kwa litawu lyakuyi lya Noba.<verse eid="NUM 32:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="NUM 33" />
  <para style="s">Mwanja gwa Waisraeli kulawa Misri kugenda Mowabu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 33:1" />Azi ndo semu zeni Waisraeli wagenda mwanja pawalawiti Misri pawawera muvipinga vya makabila gawu pasi pa ulongoziya wa Musa na Aruni. <verse eid="NUM 33:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 33:2" />Musa kalembiti litawu lya kila pahala pawagonjiriti mwanja, kulawirana na malagaliru ga Mtuwa Mlungu.<verse eid="NUM 33:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 33:3" />Waisraeli wawukiti mumji gwa Ramsesi lishaka lya lilongu na muhanu lya mwezi gwa kwanja, lishaka limu pa msambu gwa Pasaka. Womberi wawukiti kwa ugangamala mkulu kulongolu kwa Wamisri woseri. <verse eid="NUM 33:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 33:4" />Wamisri waweriti wankuwasila wapanta njira wawu wapalu yawalagitwi na Mtuwa Mlungu, tembera Mtuwa Mlungu kaweriti kajega utoza ata kwa milungu yawu.<verse eid="NUM 33:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 33:5" />Su wantu wa Israeli wawuka Ramisesi wabawaliti malimgu gawu aku Sukoti. <verse eid="NUM 33:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 33:6" />Kulawa Sukoti wabawaliti malingu gawu aku Etamu kumbwega kushiwala. <verse eid="NUM 33:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 33:7" />Kulawa Etamu, kushiwala wagalambuka na kuwuya mpaka Pi Hahiroti kwagulawa mshenji mwa Baali Sefoni, wabawaliti malingu gawu pakwegera na Migidoli. <verse eid="NUM 33:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 33:8" />Wawukiti Pi hahiroti, walokiti bahari ya Shamu mpaka kushiwala sha Etamu, waweriti mumwanja kushiwala mwanja gwa mashaka matatu, wagonjera mwanja gwawu Mara. <verse eid="NUM 33:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 33:9" />Kulawa Mara, wagenditi mwanja mpaka Elimu, Elimu aku kuweriti na mbwiru za mashi lilongu na mbili na mitendi malongu saba, wabawaliti malingu gawu kulii.<verse eid="NUM 33:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 33:10" />Wagenditi mwanja kulawa Elimu, wabawariti malingu gawu pakwegera na baali ya Shamu. <verse eid="NUM 33:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 33:11" />Kulawa baali ya Shamu wabawariti malingu gawu mushiwala sha Sini. <verse eid="NUM 33:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 33:12" />Kulawa kushiwala sha Sini wabawariti malingu gawu Dofika. <verse eid="NUM 33:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 33:13" />Kulawa Dofika wabawariti malingu gawu aku Alushi. <verse eid="NUM 33:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 33:14" />Kulawa Alushi wabawariti malingu gawu aku Refidimu, peni paweriti ndiri na mashi ga kulanda.<verse eid="NUM 33:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 33:15" />Wawukiti Refidimu wabawariti malingu gawu mushiwala sha Sinai. <verse eid="NUM 33:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 33:16" />Kulawa Sinai wabawariti malingu gawu aku Kibroti Hataavi <verse eid="NUM 33:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 33:17" />Kulawa Kibroti Hataava wabawariti malingu gawu aku Haseroti. <verse eid="NUM 33:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 33:18" />Kulawa Haseroti wabawaliti malingu aku Ritima. <verse eid="NUM 33:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 33:19" />Kulawa Ritima, wabawaliti malingu gawu aku Rimoni Perezi. <verse eid="NUM 33:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 33:20" />Kulawa Rimoni Perezi, wabawaliti malingu gawu aku Libina. <verse eid="NUM 33:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 33:21" />Kulawa Ribina wabawaliti malingu gawu Risa. <verse eid="NUM 33:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 33:22" />Wawukiti Risa, wabawaliti malingu gawu aku Kehelati. <verse eid="NUM 33:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 33:23" />Kulawa Kehelati, wabawaliti malingu gawu kulugongu Sheferi. <verse eid="NUM 33:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 33:24" />Kulawa lugongu Sheferi wabawaliti malingu gawu aku Harada. <verse eid="NUM 33:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 33:25" />Kulawa Harada, wabawaliti malingu gawu aku Mekeloti. <verse eid="NUM 33:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 33:26" />Kulawa Mekeloti, wabawaliti malingu gawu aku Tahati. <verse eid="NUM 33:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 33:27" />Kulawa Tahati wabawaliti malingu gawu Tera. <verse eid="NUM 33:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 33:28" />Kulawa Tera wabawaliti malingu gawu Mitika <verse eid="NUM 33:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 33:29" />Kulawa Mitika, wabawaliti malingu gawu Hashimoni. <verse eid="NUM 33:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 33:30" />Kulawa Hashimoni, wabawaliti malingu gawu Moseroti. <verse eid="NUM 33:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 33:31" />Kulawa Moseroti, wabawaliti malingu gawu Bene yakani. <verse eid="NUM 33:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 33:32" />Kulawa Beni Yakani, wabawaliti malingu gawu Hori Hagidigadi. <verse eid="NUM 33:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 33:33" />Kulawa Hori Hagidigadi, wabawaliti malingu gawu Yoti Bata. <verse eid="NUM 33:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 33:34" />Kulawa Yoti Bata, wabawaliti malingu gawu Abirona. <verse eid="NUM 33:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 33:35" />Kulawa Abrona, wabawaliti malingu gawu Esiyoni Geberi. <verse eid="NUM 33:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 33:36" />Wawukiti Esiyoni Geberi, wagenda mwanja na kubawila malingu gawu kushiwala sha Sini, ndo Kadeshi. <verse eid="NUM 33:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 33:37" />Kulawa Kadeshi, wabawaliti malingu gawu kulugongu Hori, mumbaka mwa isi ya Edomu.<verse eid="NUM 33:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 33:38" />Kwa lilagaliru lya Mtuwa Mlungu, mtambika Aruni kakweni kulugongu Hori, na aku kahowiti lishaka lya kwanja lya mwezi gwa muhanu, shinja sha malongu msheshi kwanjira Waisraeli walawiti muisi ya Misri. <verse eid="NUM 33:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 33:39" />Aruni kaweriti na vinja miya yimu na malongu matatu pakahowiti kulugongu Hori.<verse eid="NUM 33:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 33:40" />Mfalumi gwa Aradi, muntu gwa Kanaani ulii yakalikaliti uwega wa kusika muisi ya Kanaani, yomberi kapatiti visoweru kuwera wantu wa Israeli waweriti wankwiza.<verse eid="NUM 33:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 33:41" />Kulawa kulugongu Hori, wantu wa Israeli wabawaliti malingu gawu aku Salimona. <verse eid="NUM 33:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 33:42" />Kulawa Salimona, wabawaliti malingu gawu aku Punoni. <verse eid="NUM 33:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 33:43" />Kulawa Punoni, wabawaliti malingu gawu Oboti. <verse eid="NUM 33:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 33:44" />Kulawa Oboti, wabawaliti malingu gawu Lye Abarimu, museemu ya Mowabu. <verse eid="NUM 33:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 33:45" />Kulawa Lye abarimu, wabawaliti malingu gawu Diboni Gadi <verse eid="NUM 33:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 33:46" />Kulawa Diboni Gadi, wagenditi mwanja na kubawilamalingu gawu aku Alimoni Dibilataimu. <verse eid="NUM 33:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 33:47" />Kulawa Alimoni Dibilataimu, wagenditi mwanja na kubawila malingu gawu kulugongu lwa Abarimu, pakwegera na lugongu Nebu. <verse eid="NUM 33:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 33:48" />Kulawa migongu ya Abarimu, wagenditi mwanja na kubawila malingu gawu kulalanda za Mowabu kumwambu kulushemba Yoridani pakwegera na Yeriku. <verse eid="NUM 33:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 33:49" />Watuli kambi ayi pakwegera na lushemba Yoridani pakati pa Beti Yeshimoti na lulalanda lwa Abeli shitimu lalanda za Mowabu.<verse eid="NUM 33:49" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malagaliru pamberi pa kwingira Kanaani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 33:50" />Mululalanda za Mowabu, kumwambu kulushemba Yoridani pakwegera na Yeriku, Mtuwa kamgambiriti Musa, <verse eid="NUM 33:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="NUM 33:51" />“Guwagambiri wantu wa Israeli kuwera pamloka lushemba Yoridani na kwingira kuisi ya Kanaani, <verse eid="NUM 33:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="NUM 33:52" />muwawingi wenikaya woseri wa isi ayi kulongolu kwenu. Hamuvihabisiyi vinyagu vyawu vyoseri vya kusongola na vinyagu vya kuponda na kupabomola kila pahala pawu pambindi pa kuguwira. <verse eid="NUM 33:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="NUM 33:53" />Hamuitoli kwa makakala isi ayi na kulikala amu toziya niwapanani iweri yenu. <verse eid="NUM 33:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="NUM 33:54" />Hamuyibagulangi isi ayi kwa kugalambula simbi kugenderana na kaya zenu, semu nkulu kwa likabila likulu na semu ndidini kwa likabila lididini. <verse eid="NUM 33:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="NUM 33:55" />Kumbiti handa pamuwawinga ndiri huti wenikaya wa isi ayi, su walii yamgenda kuwaleka hawaweri gambira shipingiri pamasu penu ama misontu mukila wega muluwavu mwenu na hawawagaziyi. <verse eid="NUM 33:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="NUM 33:56" />Na neni haniwagamiziyi mwenga ntambu yanfiriti kuwagamiziya womberi.”<verse eid="NUM 33:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="NUM 34" />
  <para style="s">Mbaka za isi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 34:1" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Musa, <verse eid="NUM 34:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 34:2" />“Guwagambiri Waisraeli pagulonga. Pamwingira kanani, isi yaniwapananiti iweri uhala wenu, mbaka za enewu lya mwenga lyoseri haliweri ntambu ayi. <verse eid="NUM 34:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 34:3" />Uwega wa kusika mbaka yenu hayiweri kulawa kushiwala sha Sini kupitara uwega wa Edomu hagwanjiri kwagulawa mshenji uwega wa kusika upeleru wa bahari ya Munyu. <verse eid="NUM 34:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 34:4" />Shakapanu hagupindi kusika njira ya kugenda Akirabimu kupitira Sini mpaka Kadeshi Barinea, uwega wa kusika. Kulawa panu mbaka hayipindi kupitira kushana kwagulawa mshenji mpaka Hasari Adari na kupita mpaka Azimoni. <verse eid="NUM 34:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 34:5" />Kulawa Azimoni hagupindi kugenda lushemba lwa Misri mumbaka ya Misri na kupelera bahari ya Mediteraniya.”<verse eid="NUM 34:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 34:6" />“Mbaka yenu ya uwega wa kwaguzyeta mshenji hayiweri bahari ya Mediteraniya.”<verse eid="NUM 34:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 34:7" />“Mbaka wenu ya uwega wa kushana hayiweri ntambu ayi kulawa bahari ya mediterania, hamtuli shigingi mpaka lugongu Hori. <verse eid="NUM 34:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 34:8" />Kulawa lugongu Hori hamtuli shigingi mpaka njira ya Hamati na kwendeleya mpaka Sedadi, <verse eid="NUM 34:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 34:9" />na kupita mpaka Zifironi na kupelera Hazari Enani, ayi hayiweri mbaka yenu ya kushana.”<verse eid="NUM 34:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 34:10" />“Mbaka yenu ya uwega wa kwagulawa mshenji hamugutuli kulawa Hazari Enani mpaka Shefamu. <verse eid="NUM 34:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 34:11" />Kulawa Shefamu hagugendi kusika mpaka Ribila, kwagulawa mshenji mwa Aini shakapanu mbaka ayi hayiseleri pasi mpaka kuluseleru lwa kwagulawa mshenji mwa litanda Kinereti, <verse eid="NUM 34:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 34:12" />Shakapanu haguseleri kufata lushemba Yoridani mpaka bahari ya Munyu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 34:12">“Ayi ndo hayiweri isi yaku handa mbaka ntambu yayiwera.”<verse eid="NUM 34:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 34:13" />Su, Musa kawagambira Waisraeli, “Ayi ndo isi yamfira kuyihala kwa kugalambula simbi, isi yeni Mtuwa Mlungu kalagalira wagapanana makabila tisa na nusu. <verse eid="NUM 34:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 34:14" />Likabila lya Rubeni na lya Gadi na nusu ya likabila lya Manasi gapata uhala wawu kulinganira na kolu zawu. <verse eid="NUM 34:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 34:15" />Makabila aga mawili na nusu gapata uhala wawu kumwambu kulushemba Yoridani uwega wa kwagulawa mshenji pakwegera na Yeriku.”<verse eid="NUM 34:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wakulu yawagolokera kubagula isi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 34:16" />Mtuwa Mlungu kamgambiriti Musa, <verse eid="NUM 34:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 34:17" />“Mtambika Eleazari na Yoshuwa mwana gwa Nuni ndo wawafira kuwabagulira wantu isi su iweri yawu. <verse eid="NUM 34:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 34:18" />Viraa hagutoli mkulu yumu kulawa kila likabila katangi mukubagula isi.” <verse eid="NUM 34:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 34:19" />“Aga ndo matawu gawu, kulawa likabila lya Yuda, kaweirti Karebu mwana gwa Yefuni. <verse eid="NUM 34:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 34:20" />Kulawa likabila lya Simioni, kaweriti Shemueli mwana gwa Amihudi. <verse eid="NUM 34:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 34:21" />Kulawa likabila lya Benjamini, kaweriti Elidadi mwana gwa Kisiloni. <verse eid="NUM 34:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 34:22" />Kulawa likabila lya Dani, kaweriti Buki mwana gwa Yogili. <verse eid="NUM 34:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 34:23" />Kulawa likabila lya Manase kaweriti mwana gwakuyi Yusufu, kaweriti Hanieli mwana gwa Efodi <verse eid="NUM 34:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 34:24" />Kulawa likabila lya Efraimu, kaweriti mwana gwakuyi Yosefu, kaweriti Kemueli mwana gwa Shifitani. <verse eid="NUM 34:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 34:25" />Kulawa likabila lya Zebuluni, kaweriti Elisafani mwana gwa Parinaki. <verse eid="NUM 34:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 34:26" />Kulawa likabila lya Isakari, kaweriti Palitieli mwana gwa Azani. <verse eid="NUM 34:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 34:27" />Kulawa likabila lya Asheri, kaweriti Ahihudi mwana gwa Shelomi. <verse eid="NUM 34:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 34:28" />Kulawa likabila lya Nafutali, kaweriti Pedaheli mwana gwa Amihudi.” <verse eid="NUM 34:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 34:29" />Awa ndo wantu walii Mtuwa Mlungu kawalagaliriti wawabagulili Wasraeli isi ya Kanaani iweri uhala wawu.<verse eid="NUM 34:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 34" />
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="NUM 35" />
  <para style="s">Miji ya wantu wa Lawi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 35:1" />Mtuwa Mlungu kayowiriti na Musa mululalanda lwa Mowabu, kumwambu kulushemba lwa Yoridani, pakwegera na Yeriku. Kamgambira. <verse eid="NUM 35:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 35:2" />“Guwagambiri Waisraeli kuwera kulawirana na uhala yawafira kuukolamlima, wawapanani Walawi miji ya kulikala na semu za kuliyiziya mifugu mumbwega mwa miji ayi. <verse eid="NUM 35:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 35:3" />Miji ayi hayiweri ya Walawi na hawalikali amu na maliwuziwu gakuyi hagaweri kwanjili ya ng'ombi na mifugu yawu pamuhera na wakanyama wawu wamonga. <verse eid="NUM 35:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 35:4" />Maliwuziwu ga semu yamfira kuwapanana wantu wa Lawi mumbwega ya miji hayieneyi kila uwega utali wa mita miya msheshi na malongu mhanu kulawa mushibambaza sha miji ayi. <verse eid="NUM 35:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 35:5" />Hangu, enewu ali lya maliwuziwu haliweri lya mita miya tisa, na halieneyi kila uwega wa mji, mji gweni haguweri pakatikati. Enewu ali haliweri maliwuziwu gawu mbwega mwa miji yawu. <verse eid="NUM 35:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 35:6" />Hamuwapanani wantu wa Lawi miji sita ya matugiru yeni muntu pakamlaga myuguwi pota kufira hakajimiluwi kutugira pamuhera na aga, hamuwapanani miji imonga malongu msheshi na mbili. <verse eid="NUM 35:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 35:7" />Walanga yoseri ya miji yamfira kuwapanana Walawi hayiweri malongu msheshi na minani, hamwapanani miji ayi pamuhera na semu zakuwi za kuliyiziya. <verse eid="NUM 35:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 35:8" />Walanga yoseri ya miji yamfira kawapanani Wantu wa Lawi muuhala wa Waisraeli hayitumbili ukulu wa likabila, likabila likulu halilaviyi miji ivuwa na likabila lididini halilaviyi miji mididini. Kila likabila lya Waisraeli halilaviyi miji kwajili ya Walawi kulinganira na enewu lyalifira kuhala.”<verse eid="NUM 35:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Miji ya kutugira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 35:9" />Mtuwa Mlungu kayowera na Musa, kamgambira. <verse eid="NUM 35:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 35:10" />Guwagambira “Waisraeli handa shipindi pawafira kuloka lushemba Yolidani na kwingira muisi Kanani, <verse eid="NUM 35:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 35:11" />hamsyaguli miji yaiwera miji ya kutugira handa muntu pakamlaga muyaguwi pota kufira hakawezi kutugira. <verse eid="NUM 35:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 35:12" />Miji ayi hayiweri pahala pa kutugira su ayu yakalaga nawamlaga na yakamwuzilira pamberi pa kutozwa na wantu. <verse eid="NUM 35:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 35:13" />Hamyituliri gweka miji sita kwajili ya kutugira. <verse eid="NUM 35:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 35:14" />Pakati pa miji sita ayi yamyitula gweka, mitatu iweri kwagulawa mshenji mwa Yoridani, na mitatu iweri muisi ya Kanani. <verse eid="NUM 35:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 35:15" />Miji ayi hayiweri ya kutugira kwajili ya Waisraeli na wahenga wa mashaka goseri ama shipindi shifupi yawalikala pamuhera na womberi. Muntu yoseri yakamlaga umonga pota kufira kaweza kutugira aku.”<verse eid="NUM 35:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 35:16" />“Kumbiti muntu pakamkoma myaguwi kwa shintu sha shuma, kahowa, muntu ayu yakalaga ndo mpaka wamlagi. <verse eid="NUM 35:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 35:17" />Muntu yoseri pakamguma myaguwi libuwi, kahowa, muntu ayu yakalaga, ndo mpaka wamlagi. <verse eid="NUM 35:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 35:18" />Handa pakamkoma myaguwi kwa shintu shashinyawitwi na mtera shimtenda kahowi, muntu pakaliwona na ayu yakalaga, hakatendi toza ya kulaga. <verse eid="NUM 35:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 35:19" />Mlongu gwapakwegera na muntu yawamlagiti hawamuwuziliri. Ayu pakaliwona na mlaga ayu, hakatendi toza ya kulaga.”<verse eid="NUM 35:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 35:20" />“Ntambu iraa, handa muntu pakamkalalira myaguwi shakapanu, kamsukuma ama kamyasira shintu kwa kumgwadira, <verse eid="NUM 35:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 35:21" />Ama kwa kumkoma ngumi kahowa, su muntu ayu yakamkomiti myaguwi mlaga na ndo wamlagi. Walongu wa pakwegera wa muntu ayu yawamlagiti hakawuziliri pawaliwona na yomberi.”<verse eid="NUM 35:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 35:22" />“Kumbiti handa muntu pakamsukuma myaguwi vumu pota kuvimana ama kumyasira shintu pota kumgwadira. <verse eid="NUM 35:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 35:23" />Ama muntu pakamguma libuwi lyaliweza kumtenda kahowa, na kumlaga muntu pota kufira, tembera paweriti ndiri na unkondu pakati pawu su kafiliti ndiri kumlaga, <verse eid="NUM 35:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 35:24" />Su wantu wa Waisraeli hawaamuwi pakati pa muntu yakalaga na walongu wa muntu yawamlagiti yakafira kuwuzilira, kulinganira na lagaliru azi. <verse eid="NUM 35:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 35:25" />Wantu wa Waisraeli hawamlopoziyi muntu ayu yakalagiti mumawoku mwa walongu wa muntu yawamlagiti na kumwuziya kumji gwa kutugira mwakaweriti katugira. Hakalikali aku mpaka kuhowa kwa mtambika mkulu gwa shipindi ashi yawamsyaguliti kwa kuswagwa lipaki linanagala. <verse eid="NUM 35:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 35:26" />Kumbiti yakalagiti ayu pakalawa kunja kumji gwakatugiriti shipindi shoseri shilii. <verse eid="NUM 35:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 35:27" />Shakapanu walongu wa muntu yawamlagiti kampata kunja kumbaka ya mji agu gwa kutugira wamlaga ayu hapeni kaweri na likosa lya kulaga. <verse eid="NUM 35:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 35:28" />Toziya ayu yakalagiti kalikali mngati mwa mji gwa kutugira mpaka mtambika mkulu pakahowa, kumbiti pakahowiti kala mtambika kaweza kuwuya ukaya. <verse eid="NUM 35:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 35:29" />Lagaliru azi hazitenderuwi muviyiwuku vyenu nyoseri, pahala poseri pamlikala.”<verse eid="NUM 35:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 35:30" />“Muntu yoseri yakalaga muntu, hawamtozi kuhowa kulawirana na ukapitawu wa wakapitawu wawili ama nentu, muntu yoseri kaweza ndiri kutozwa kuhowa kulawirana na ukapitawu wa muntu yumu. <verse eid="NUM 35:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 35:31" />Namwanka malipu goseri kugalopuziya makaliru ga yakalaga yakapatikaniti na likosa, hakatozwi kuhowa muntu ayu mpaka kalaguwi. <verse eid="NUM 35:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 35:32" />Namwenga pota kujimira malipu goseri kulawa kwa muntu yakatugiriti mji gwa kutugira su kumjimira kawuyi kulikala ukaya kwakuyi pamberi pakuhowa mtambika mkulu. <verse eid="NUM 35:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 35:33" />Pamtenda ntambu ayi hamuweri mjimilika ndiri kulongolu kwa neni mji gwamlikala. Gwitanga mwazi kuyilekera isi kujimilika ndiri na neni, na kwahera tambika yaiweza kutakasiya isi yaitenderitwi ulaga ila kwakumlaga ayu. <verse eid="NUM 35:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 35:34" />Kotu kuyitenda nayijimilika ndiri kwa neni isi yamlikala, isi yeni neni nilikala toziya neni Mtuwa Mlungu nilikala muwamu mwenu Waisraeli.”<verse eid="NUM 35:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 35" />
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="NUM 36" />
  <para style="s">Uhala wa wadala wawayugituwi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 36:1" />Wakulu wa walongu mulukolu lwa Gileadi, mwana gwa Makili, mwana gwa Manase, mwana gwa Yusufu, wagenditi kuyowera na Musa na wakulu wamonga wa lukolu lwa Wantu wa Israeli. <verse eid="NUM 36:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 36:2" />Walonga, “Mtuwa gwetu, Mtuwa Mlungu kakulagaliriti kuwabagulira wantu wa Israeli isi kwa kugalambula simbi, kuwera uhala wawu, kakulagaliriti guwapanani viraa wahinga wa Selufihadi yakaweriti mlongu gwetu uhala wa tati gwawu. <verse eid="NUM 36:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 36:3" />Kumbiti womberi pawayugwa na wantu wa Israeli wa makabila gamonga, uhala wawu wa alizi haulawi kwa twenga na kugenda kulikabila lyawayugwa, hangu uhala wa twenga hauweri mdidini. <verse eid="NUM 36:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 36:4" />Mumsambu gwa kuholera gwa vinja malongu muhanu, vintu vyawashuziti viwuziwa kwa weni, hangu alizi ya wahinga wa Selufihadi hayigendi kulikabila lyawayugituwi hangu likabila lyetu hapeni lipati uhala awu kayi.”<verse eid="NUM 36:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 36:5" />Su Musa kawalagalira Waisraeli ntambu ayi kulawa kwa Mtuwa Mlungu, kawagambira, “wantu wa lukolu lwa likabila lya Yusufu, watakula nakaka, <verse eid="NUM 36:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 36:6" />Na hangu ndo ntambu yakalagaliriti Mtuwa Mlungu kuusu wahinga wa Selufihadi, walekeziwa kuyugwa na muntu yoseri yawamfira, kumbiti wayugwi mukabila lyawu hera. <verse eid="NUM 36:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 36:7" />Su uhala wa wantu wa Israeli nawuhamiziwa kulikabila limonga, kila Mwisraeli hakasigalwi na uhala wa lukolu lwakuyi. <verse eid="NUM 36:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 36:8" />Mdala yoseri yakawera na uhala wa alizi mulikabila limu lya Israeli ndo mpaka kayugwi na muntu gwa lukolu lwakuyi, su kila Muntu gwa Israeli katoli uhala wa wambuyi wakuyi. <verse eid="NUM 36:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 36:9" />Hangu hapeni paweri na uhala woseri wawuhamiziwa kulawa likabila limu mpaka limonga. Kila likabila lya Waisraeli halikoleri uhala wakuyi.” <verse eid="NUM 36:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 36:10" />Wahinga wa Selufihadi watenditi gambira Mtuwa Mlungu ntambu yakamlagaliriti Musa. <verse eid="NUM 36:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 36:11" />Woseri. Mala na Tirizi na Hogila na Milika na Noa wayugwa na wana wapalu wa tati wawu wakulu ama watati wawu wapusu. <verse eid="NUM 36:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 36:12" />Wayugitwi muwalongu wa lukolu lwa Manasi mwana gwa Yusufu na uhala wawu usigali mulikabila lya tati gwawu. <verse eid="NUM 36:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 36:13" />Aga ndo malagiru na malagizu galii Mtuwa Mlungu kawapananiti wantu wa Israeli kupitira Musa kulalanda za Mowabu, kumwambu kulushemba Yoridani pakwegera na lushemba lwa Yeriku.<verse eid="NUM 36:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 36" />
</usx>